#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:10
msgid "Back already? Something must have bitten you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:10
msgid "Philters, tonics, cures. Slime remover is extra."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:100
msgid "Be welcome again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:100
msgid "The Guild of Spirit takes all who seek."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:101
msgid "Basket?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:101
msgid "Baskets. For fish, mostly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:102
msgid ""
"I can teach you how to swim for a mere 100 gold. Or sell you a scroll, if you sink."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:102
msgid "Water's fine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:103
msgid ""
"The sorceresses of Rivercity have stolen a magical pendant of mine. I want it back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:104
msgid "Are the beasts gone?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:104
msgid "Three dragons live in my lake. You can't fish with dragons."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:105
msgid "Any word of the Book?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:105
msgid "The Holy Book of Elvenkind was lost in the Troll Forest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:106
msgid "Crazed sprites hold my Wand of Faery Magic in the south woods."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:106
msgid "My wand?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:107
msgid "I hate the surf. Find my skull."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:107
msgid "My skull?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:108
msgid "Still not Barok? Good."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:108
msgid ""
"The tavern pays us to keep Barok out of town. You are not Barok. Sit, but touch nothing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:109 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:246 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:327
msgid "Thirsty?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:109
msgid "We plugged the fountain. Water is a growth business."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:11
msgid "Bless you. Wipe your feet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:11
msgid "Welcome to the Slime Temple. The name was not our idea."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:110 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:227
msgid "Duck."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:110
msgid ""
"Two lessons. How to hit with nothing in your hands, and how not to be there when they hit back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:111
msgid "Changed your mind about the deed?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:111
msgid ""
"The ruins of Newcastle are for sale. Twelve thousand gold, deed included."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:112
msgid "Still on legs, sadly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:112
msgid "These legs itch. Have you ever had legs that itch?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:113
msgid "Hurt?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:113
msgid ""
"I followed the taxman for the souls. Mostly I bandage the people he taxes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:114
msgid "Good evening. It is always evening."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:114
msgid ""
"We open when the moon is up. The Count prefers it. So do our customers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:115
msgid "Back so soon? How warm of you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:115
msgid ""
"The living pay a small fee to visit. A very small fee. Mostly in blood."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:116
msgid "Blessed light."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:116
msgid ""
"We hung the first lamp the morning the Count died. We have not taken it down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:117
msgid "A table by the window?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:117
msgid "The red wine is wine now. I checked."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:118
msgid "Browsing the dead?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:118
msgid "Everything here belonged to someone who no longer needs it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:119
msgid "Garlic for the neck, holy water for the rest. Cash only."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:119
msgid "More garlic?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:12
msgid "The Fire Guild of Vertigo. Open to all, and mind the curtains."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:12
msgid "Warm to see you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:120
msgid "Mind your head. No, lower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:120
msgid "We hid under the floor for nine years. It was roomy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:121 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:222
msgid "Shh."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:121
msgid "Vampires can't bite what they can't find."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:122
msgid "Is it day? Is it really day?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:122
msgid "Still day?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:123
msgid "A collar?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:123
msgid "I made high collars for the whole town. They sold well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:124
msgid "Graves dug, graves filled, graves refilled. Nightshadow kept me busy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:124 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:409
msgid "Need a hole?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:125
msgid "A song?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:125
msgid "I have songs about the Count. None you would sing at dinner."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:126
msgid "Bats in every chimney. They tip badly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:126
msgid "Soot?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:127
msgid "Anything to record?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:127
msgid "I wrote down every disappearance. It was a long book."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:128
msgid "Spare a coin? The Count never did."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:128
msgid "Spare another?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:129
msgid ""
"The Count wakes at nine and sleeps at nine. Set the dials, and he does neither."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:129
msgid "The dials are fine now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:13
msgid "Ah, the breeze is back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:13
msgid "The Air Guild. Close the door, the scrolls blow away."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:130
msgid "Lamps are lit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:130
msgid "Nine years I lit lamps that nobody wanted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:131
msgid "Every lock in town is mine. They never kept anything out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:131
msgid "Locked out?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:132
msgid "What needs hammering, my lord?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:132
msgid "Your castle, your smith. I forge plate for lords now. That's you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:133
msgid "Ready for the yard?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:133
msgid ""
"Run through four times and still standing. Train here, and you'll stand to sixty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:134
msgid "A castle with a chapel is a castle that means to stay."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:134
msgid "Blessings on the house."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:135
msgid "Deposit, my lord?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:135
msgid "Ebenezer's taxes come in here now. Funny how that works."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:136
msgid "Any luck with the pedestals?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:136
msgid ""
"The people of Asp are turning into snakes. My Eve has started to hiss."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:137
msgid "Ssso glad you came."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:137
msgid "Ssstill here?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:138
msgid "Gargoyles stole my Scarab of Imaging and flew off to their range."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:138
msgid "The scarab?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:139
msgid ""
"Bring me the Crystals of Piezoelectricity from Asp, and I'll tell you why."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:139
msgid "The crystals?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:14
msgid "The Water Guild of Vertigo. The creek is ours too, sadly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:14
msgid "Welcome back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:140
msgid ""
"By royal appointment. The King has never bought a thing, but the sign looks good."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:141
msgid "Mind the rivets."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:141
msgid "Plate is a house you wear. Learn to live in it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:142
msgid "Blessings."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:142
msgid ""
"The Chapel of the Crown heals all, Crusaders or not. The King insists on the first part."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:143
msgid "Back on the horse?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:143
msgid ""
"Lance up, chin down. The lists train you to forty, and the ground trains you the rest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:144
msgid "Vertigo, Rivercity or Asp. The coaches go when the horses agree."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:145
msgid "Sit. Eat. The pig is not the one from the sign."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:146
msgid "Shields up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:146
msgid ""
"Three years champion of the lists. A shield is not for hiding behind. It is for hitting with."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:147
msgid ""
"The King wants a mirror. I gave him a weather report. We do not speak now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:147
msgid "Windy today."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:148
msgid "Know the beast before it knows you. Mind the cages on the way out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:148
msgid "Seen anything new?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:149
msgid "Hear ye! Nothing new. Hear ye anyway."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:149
msgid "Hear ye."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:15
msgid "Still standing? Good."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:15
msgid "The Earth Guild. Solid ground, solid spells."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:150
msgid "Mind the wet sheets."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:150
msgid "The Prince's sheets come back folded just as I left them. Every week."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:151
msgid ""
"Forty years in the lists and I never once fell off. I was pushed. Every time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:151
msgid "Pull up a stool."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:152
msgid "Bread for the castle, buns for the guards, crusts for the fools."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:152
msgid "Still warm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:153
msgid "Move along. Politely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:153
msgid ""
"The gate is for Crusaders. The village is for everyone. The tavern is for me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:154
msgid "Buying or browsing?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:154
msgid "Everything on the wagon is genuine. Mostly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:155
msgid "The leaf?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:155
msgid "The leaves fall here, and nowhere else on Xeen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:156
msgid "Burlock or Rivercity?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:156
msgid "The pit is outside the town. So am I. Let's keep it that way."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:157
msgid "Hurt again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:157
msgid "I heal what walks in on two legs. The rest I pray for."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:158
msgid "I'll ssslip your name into the guild rollsss."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:158
msgid "Ssstill no cure?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:159
msgid "Another bottle?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:159
msgid "Snake oil cures everything. I have checked."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:16
msgid "Ready to sweat?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:16
msgid "Thylon's Training. I can take you to tenth level, no further."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:160
msgid "Need a fitting?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:160
msgid "Scale mail. Locally sourced."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:161
msgid "Steady footing?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:161
msgid "Stone does not shed its skin. Learn from it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:162
msgid "Feeling whole?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:162
msgid "We cured ourselves of snakes. We can cure you of anything."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:163
msgid "Cut yourself? Wait a bit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:163
msgid ""
"When I was half a snake, I grew back my own tail. Twice. The knack stayed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:164
msgid "Bless me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:164
msgid "I hissed for a month. Still do when I sneeze."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:165
msgid "I weave the guild's robes. Sleeves were hard while we had no arms."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:165
msgid "Need a robe?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:166
msgid "I dig the pedestal stones back in every spring."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:166
msgid "Mind the hole."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:167
msgid "We ate mice for a season. Never again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:168 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:355
msgid "Buy a pot."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:168
msgid "My pots have scales painted on. The fashion stuck."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:169
msgid "Boots again! I had nothing to make them for."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:169 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:358
msgid "New soles?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:17
msgid "Coaches to Rivercity, three days a week."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:17
msgid "The horses remember you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:170
msgid "Cross my palm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:170
msgid "I saw the curse coming. Nobody listens to a woman who hisses."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:171
msgid "Flour?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:171
msgid "The mill turned all through the curse. Nobody could carry the flour."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:172
msgid "Only Crusaders may stand before the throne. Have you found my mirror?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:173
msgid "A quiet word, Crusaders?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:173
msgid "The King hears little these days but the word 'mirror'."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:174
msgid "Megacredits?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:174
msgid ""
"Walls, keeps, dungeons. Bring me Megacredits and I'll build you a castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:175
msgid "Any news of my tiara?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:175
msgid ""
"Don't look so disappointed. I'm not a damsel in distress, but there is a quest you could perform for me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:176
msgid "Still here? How loyal."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:176
msgid "Welcome, Crusaders. My brother has great need of you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:177
msgid ""
"Crusaders. The last face I saw before the coffin was Alamar's. Yours are a great improvement."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:177
msgid "Still here? Good. A coffin is poor company."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:178
msgid "Still awake? I'm not."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:178
msgid ""
"The guild was closed to newcomers. Then I fell asleep with the roll book open. (wink, wink) Go on in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:179
msgid "How many waves now?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:179
msgid ""
"My town is full of ghosts and empty of people. Ring the gongs, and come back after each wave."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:18
msgid "Mind the sacks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:18
msgid "The slimes got into the flour again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:180
msgid "Something hot?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:180
msgid "The last ghost drank here every night. Never paid."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:181 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:418
msgid "Warm yourself."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:181
msgid "We buried the town twice. Once was enough."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:182
msgid "Step out of the light."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:182
msgid "The ghosts were amateurs. We teach the real thing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:183
msgid "Cold?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:183
msgid "Fur outside, iron inside. The tundra respects both."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:184
msgid "I heard the ghosts' thoughts for nine years. Yours are much louder."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:184
msgid "I know why you came."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:185
msgid "Seen anything pale?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:185
msgid ""
"The Acme Ghost Visualization System. Sold by the gross, works by the dozen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:186
msgid "Mind the ice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:186
msgid "Shovelled snow off the ghosts' graves. They complained."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:187
msgid "Scarf?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:187
msgid "Wool, wool and more wool. There's no such thing as too warm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:188
msgid "Need furs?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:188
msgid "Snow beasts by the score. They taste like boots."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:189 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:269
msgid "Bowl?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:189
msgid "Soup. It's always soup. It's always cold out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:19
msgid "Tobias is out back, swearing at the flour."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:190
msgid "Bite yet?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:190
msgid "The fish under the ice don't care about ghosts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:191
msgid "Mind the goats."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:191
msgid "The goats knew about the ghosts before we did."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:192
msgid "Candles sell well in a ghost town. Nobody wants the dark."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:192
msgid "Candles?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:193 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:323
msgid "A fitting?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:193
msgid "I sewed shrouds for a year. Now it's coats again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:194
msgid "Need wood?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:194
msgid "Wood for the fires, wood for the coffins. Mostly fires now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:195
msgid "Hello again!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:195
msgid "I talked to the ghosts. They were nice. Papa says don't say that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:196
msgid "Population: forty. Was: four hundred. I keep the old ledger too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:196
msgid "Sign the book?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:197
msgid "Sit. Breathe."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:197
msgid ""
"The ninja in the pagoda were once my students. They learned the wrong lesson."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:198 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:330
msgid "Peace."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:198
msgid "The arrow that misses heals faster than the one that hits."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:199
msgid "Again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:199
msgid "Your hands are weapons. Mind where you leave them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:20
msgid "Shield up, chin down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:20
msgid "Thirty years on the wall. I can teach you to hold a shield."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:200
msgid ""
"Cyclopes on my border, snow on my roof. Burn their outpost and I'll make it worth your while."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:200
msgid "Is it burnt?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:201
msgid "Back again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:201
msgid "His Majesty is busy. His Majesty is always busy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:202
msgid ""
"My water clock freezes. Bring me the Ever-Hot Lava Rock from Mount Firestone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:202
msgid "The rock? Efficiently, please."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:203
msgid "Climb with me and you'll come down stronger. Or not at all."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:203
msgid "Up again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:204
msgid ""
"The trolls are uncouth. Burn their warren and we shall discuss the weather."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:204
msgid "The warren?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:205
msgid "Snow falls here, and nowhere else on Xeen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:205
msgid "The snowflake?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:206
msgid "Back in the dark?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:206
msgid "You walk loudly for people who killed a ninja master."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:207
msgid "The flower?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:207
msgid "The sun is kind here, and nowhere else on Xeen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:208
msgid "Sit by the urn. Breathe. The sand will wait."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:208
msgid "Still breathing?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:209
msgid "Thirsty again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:209
msgid "Water's free. The cup costs a gold. The shade costs two."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:21
msgid "Gunther is at the town hall. He is always at the town hall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:21
msgid "Oh, it's you again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:210
msgid "Camels to Asp, wagons to Rivercity. The sand comes along for free."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:210
msgid "Riding?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:211
msgid ""
"One coach a week to Rivercity. One to Castleview, if you hold the sigil. Same seats, fewer passengers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:211
msgid "Still in one piece? Climb in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:212
msgid "The well is deeper than the Sphinx is tall. I've measured both."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:212
msgid "Water?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:213
msgid "Mind the camel. He bites."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:213
msgid "Saddles for camels. The camels have opinions about saddles."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:214
msgid "Did you find the scroll?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:214
msgid ""
"The wizards of Castle Basenji killed my master. His scroll is still in there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:215
msgid ""
"If you didn't come to fight, you have no business being here! Pick your battle, or come back when you have the mettle to do battle for glory!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:215
msgid ""
"You look like tough fighters. Would you like to participate in the War Games? The odds can be high but the thrill of victory is well worth the risk."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:216
msgid "Snack?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:216
msgid ""
"Try peanut butter and honey on your morning toast. Or anything on anything. It's Shangri-La."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:217
msgid "Shangri-La welcomes you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:217
msgid "Still welcome. Behave."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:218
msgid ""
"Arm and Hammer: arms through this door, armour through the other. The hammers are also arms."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:218
msgid "What'll it be?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:219
msgid "Rest a while."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:219
msgid "The earth heals all things, slowly. I do it faster, for a fee."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:22
msgid "Come in, mind the loom."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:22
msgid "Doom bugs eat wool. Did you know that? I know that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:220
msgid "Welcome back, members."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:220
msgid ""
"You folks look like you want membership in the Shangri-La Wizard's Guild. I'll put your name on the list. Membership is free here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:221
msgid ""
"I will teach you everything. Well, learning. Learning is everything, if you think about it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:221
msgid "Learned anything?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:222
msgid "Silence is the first lesson. You've already failed it. Sit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:223
msgid "Fire in a library. Yes, I know. That's why I'm very, very good at it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:223
msgid "Mind the scrolls."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:224
msgid "Every wound in the book, I've read about. Most of them I've healed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:224
msgid "Page forty, I think."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:225
msgid "I know things. Ask me. No, go on, ask me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:226
msgid "Bravery is mostly muscle. The rest is not thinking about it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:226
msgid "Lift something."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:227
msgid "A princess learns to dodge early. Suitors, mostly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:228
msgid ""
"Smile. The intent expression you are wearing is being broadcast to millions from the hidden crystal in the wall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:228
msgid "Still smiling?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:229
msgid "Back from somewhere?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:229
msgid "I've been everywhere on Xeen. Twice, on the flat bits."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:23
msgid "Keeping your edge?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:23
msgid "Pike. I keep the gates and teach the sword."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:230
msgid "A staff is a walking stick with ambitions. Not unlike yourselves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:230
msgid "Oh. You again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:231
msgid "I knew you were coming. I always know. It's very tiring."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:231
msgid "Yes, I know."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:232
msgid "Still wandering?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:232
msgid "The tavern in Shangri-La has the best tips. I wander here for them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:233
msgid "Rustle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:234
msgid "The moons are fine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:234
msgid "The moons will align when you are able to visit the Darkside."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:235
msgid ""
"I came up the mountain to be alone. Then everyone came up the mountain to fight me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:235
msgid "Sit. Don't touch the hoard."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:236
msgid "Need a point?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:236
msgid "Spears for the walls, spears for the gate, spears for whoever pays."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:237
msgid "Count your rings."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:237
msgid ""
"Ten thousand rings to a shirt. The gremlins steal about a hundred a night."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:238
msgid "Browsing?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:238
msgid ""
"Wands, scrolls, and Eeried's guidebook. The guidebook is mostly wrong."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:239
msgid "I found a glowing orb in a crater. Take it, please. It hums at night."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:239
msgid "Still humming?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:24
msgid "I've had my eye on you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:24
msgid "Some fool said money's now growing on trees. Ha!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:240
msgid "Heretics hold the Western Tower in Mok's name. Mok would be appalled."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:240
msgid "Mok's blessing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:241
msgid "Another?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:241
msgid "Bread's short. The siege, you know. Ale isn't."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:242 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:302
msgid "Deposit?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:242
msgid ""
"Our vault is the only building the gremlins haven't sabotaged. We check daily."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:243
msgid "On your feet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:243
msgid ""
"Train here and stand a watch. We train to forty, and the watch trains you the rest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:244
msgid "Fire is the one thing the besiegers can't take from us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:244
msgid "Warm?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:245
msgid "Breezy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:245
msgid "The wind blows the smoke over the enemy camp. You're welcome."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:246
msgid "We keep the wells clean. Somebody keeps putting frogs in them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:247
msgid "Steady."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:247
msgid "The walls stand because I tell them to."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:248
msgid "Siege injuries, gremlin bites, and the odd catapult foot."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:248
msgid "Where does it hurt?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:249
msgid "Ready to ride?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:249
msgid "The ogres burned two of my wagons. I pay well for two of their forts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:25
msgid "Boots, buckles, broken things. I mend them all."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:25
msgid "What did you break this time?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:250
msgid ""
"Adventurers come through the pyramid looking lost. I put them up and put them to work."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:250
msgid "Looking for company?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:251
msgid "Any news of the gremlins?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:251
msgid ""
"Gremlins in the gears, enemies at the gate, and a stranger in my office. What now?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:252
msgid "Visiting hours are whenever I'm asleep."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:252
msgid "Who are you visiting?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:253
msgid "Any luck with the door?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:253
msgid "I'm innocent. Joe sold the fake maps; I only drew the real ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:254
msgid "Jasper?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:254
msgid "My brother Jasper rots in jail for Joe's maps. Help me get him out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:255
msgid ""
"Public Storage: put things in, take things out, in the right order. The order is the hard part."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:255
msgid "Solved it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:256
msgid "Show me your orb. Ah. First it must see Ellinger."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:256
msgid "The orb remembers you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:257
msgid "My necklace?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:257
msgid ""
"Rats took my onyx necklace into the sewer. Bring it back and I'll give you the tower key."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:258 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:259 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:260
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:261
msgid "Again it do."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:258
msgid "Lesson one, first: backward walk."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:259
msgid "Lesson two: fist the not, hand the strike."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:26
msgid "Still here? So am I."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:260
msgid "Lesson three: answer the before question the hear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:261
msgid "Lesson four: Reger see now. Outside walls the."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:262
msgid "Seen my pigeons?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:262
msgid "That bench is reserved for me. It says so."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:263
msgid "Quietly, please."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:263
msgid ""
"We sell the Voweless Knights' answers, bound. Young dragons study here too; we keep buckets by the shelves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:264
msgid "Mind the light."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:264
msgid "My people walk in shadow. Here, at least, the shadow is honest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:265
msgid "Arrows for the walls. They come back, mostly, from the other side."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:265
msgid "Arrows?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:266
msgid ""
"Rope for the ladders, rope for the catapult, rope for the gremlins if I catch them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:266
msgid "Rope?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:267
msgid "No pass, no gate. Even I need a pass to go home."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:267
msgid "Pass?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:268
msgid "Flour's dear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:268
msgid ""
"The gremlins burned my mill. I grind by hand now and complain by mouth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:269
msgid "Soup for the hungry. Everybody is hungry. It's a siege."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:27
msgid "Keep your purse close. Habit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:270
msgid "Broken wheel?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:270
msgid "I fix carts by day. The gremlins unfix them by night."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:271
msgid "Best melons on the Darkside. Ask the monkeydog."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:271
msgid "Melon?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:272
msgid "Fire arrows. Every roof. Every week."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:272
msgid "Roof leaks?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:273
msgid "My husband stood the wall. Now I knit for those who do."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:273
msgid "Socks?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:274
msgid "Hear the bells?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:274
msgid "One bell for gremlins, two for the enemy, three for supper."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:275
msgid "Lamps lit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:275
msgid "The sun is weak here. I light the lamps by noon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:276
msgid "Saddle?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:276
msgid "Saddles for Kramer's caravans. When there are horses."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:277
msgid "I dig the moat deeper every year. Nobody asked me to stop."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:277
msgid "Mind the ditch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:278
msgid "Every stone of that wall I've laid twice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:278
msgid "Solid, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:279
msgid "Coo!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:279
msgid "Lyle lets me feed them on Tuesdays!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:28
msgid "On the roll? Then off to the guild row."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:28
msgid "Vern, clerk of the guild roll. Every name goes on it these days."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:280
msgid ""
"Five rubies of the right cut, and gems, and I'll make you something worth the trouble."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:280
msgid "Rubies?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:281
msgid "Emerald steel never dulls. Bring me five stones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:281
msgid "Emeralds?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:282
msgid "Sapphire armour keeps you cool under fire. Literally."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:282
msgid "Sapphires?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:283
msgid ""
"Diamonds come only from the north adit in the Forbidden Zone. Few who go there come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:283
msgid "Diamonds?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:284
msgid ""
"My staff lost its emerald handle somewhere in the east. Find it, and I'll get you into Sandcaster."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:284
msgid "The handle?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:285
msgid "Lessons the all you took? Word the say then."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:285
msgid "Word the?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:286
msgid "Castleview pass? I happen to have one. It happens to be expensive."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:286
msgid "Still need a pass?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:287
msgid "The statuettes?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:287
msgid ""
"Thieves stole my golden statuettes: the pegasus, the dragon and the griffin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:288
msgid "Talk or fight?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:288
msgid "You smell of town. Talk fast or fight faster."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:289
msgid "The disks?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:289
msgid ""
"You passed my tests. Alamar moved Castle Kalindra out of phase; twenty Energy Disks bring it back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:29
msgid "Lost already?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:29
msgid ""
"Mylo's Maps. I will teach anyone cartography for 100 gold. Nobody ever asks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:290
msgid "Back to petition the king?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:290
msgid ""
"I am Gettlewaithe, Imperator Primus of the Gremlins! Give me one good reason why I should not command my mighty army to cut your grotesque human heads from your shoulders and hang your eviscerated corpses above my throne for the entertainment of my subjects!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:291
msgid "Another map? Every one's a winner."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:291
msgid ""
"Treasure maps! Genuine! Passes to Castleview, also genuine! Prices genuinely low!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:292
msgid "Hello. I live in the bed. It's a nice bed. The rats don't like it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:292
msgid "Is the big rat gone?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:293
msgid ""
"I helped invent the compass! These days I mostly invent tunnels. The gremlins wedged the town sluice open with the mill's gears; shut it and the old culvert drains, rats and all."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:293
msgid "Shut the sluice yet? Mind the rats when it drains."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:294
msgid "My crown. My castle. My thanks, Crusaders."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:294
msgid "The Darkside owes you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:295
msgid ""
"I kept watch over an empty throne in a castle that wasn't there. You learn to notice things."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:295
msgid "Notice anything?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:296
msgid "Every weapon in the armoury, I've used. Some of them on the armoury."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:296
msgid "Pick one."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:297
msgid "Leave me be."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:297
msgid "The Queen is gone. What is a captain without a queen?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:298
msgid ""
"Father has lost all hope. Only the Songbird of Serenity could lift it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:298
msgid "The Songbird?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:299
msgid "Look through the glass."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:299
msgid ""
"The stars from here are very small. So is everything else, if you look closely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:3
msgid "Back for more steel?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:3
msgid "Norman's Ironworks. If it's sharp, I made it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:30 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:82
msgid "(hic)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:30
msgid "Get Lost! Can't you see I'm drinkin'?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:300
msgid "Got a file?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:300
msgid ""
"Try ten, eleven, twelve on the tougher safes. You didn't hear it from me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:301
msgid "Bless you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:301
msgid "The mace is a holy instrument. It is also a mace."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:302
msgid "The treasury came back with the castle. Most of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:303
msgid "Blades up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:303
msgid "Train here and there is no ceiling. Only the sky, and it's failing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:304
msgid "Need fitting?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:304
msgid "Plate for the Queen's knights. Fit for a queen's enemies, too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:305
msgid "The horses came back with the castle. They were not pleased."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:306
msgid "A shield held right stops anything. Held wrong, it stops you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:306
msgid "Shields!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:307
msgid "Dead end? Keep walking."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:307
msgid ""
"I helped build Castle Kalindra. The place is full of secret doors and traps. If you ever come to a dead end in the castle, just keep walking. The wall may be an illusion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:308
msgid ""
"Orcs hold my Princess Sheewana in the Temple of Bark. Ask politely, pay, or take her."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:308
msgid "Sheewana?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:309
msgid "A sip?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:309
msgid "Potions brewed from morning dew. Mostly dew."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:31
msgid "Leather is just a cow with better manners. I teach it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:31
msgid "Smell's not so bad once you're used to it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:310
msgid "Glow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:310
msgid "The sun is weak; we keep a little of it in jars."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:311
msgid "Big people! Mind the branches. And the sprites on them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:311
msgid "Hello again, big people."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:312
msgid "A tune?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:312
msgid "I play for the trees. They don't clap, but they listen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:313
msgid "(Nibbler sniffs your pack hopefully. He is looking for melons.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:313
msgid "(Nibbler wags at you.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:314
msgid "Take me home."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:314
msgid "You came for me? Oh, how proper."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:315
msgid "Peace?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:315
msgid "You come to Graalg's pass. Talk peace or Graalg talks with club."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:316
msgid "Business, then?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:316
msgid ""
"You got past the gongs and the chest. Impressive. Sit down before I'm impressed enough to kill you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:317
msgid "Brought my gold?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:317
msgid "You fell in. Everyone falls in. Now you pay, or you stay."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:318
msgid "Still in the pen. Still breathing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:318
msgid "The orcs drag one of us out every morning. Nobody comes back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:319
msgid ""
"Days in this pen. I've forgotten the sun. Not that there's much of it left."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:319
msgid "Is it day out there?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:32
msgid "Rialdo the Ranger. I teach the bow to those who can hold still."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:32
msgid "Steady hands today?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:320
msgid "Snog no do evil. Other orcs no like that. So Snog in here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:320
msgid "Snog still here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:321
msgid "The truth keeps."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:321
msgid ""
"They chained me for saying aloud what the shaman is. The truth does not care for chains."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:322
msgid "A dagger is a sword that has learned to be discreet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:322
msgid "Something sharp?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:323
msgid "Brass scale: it shines, it turns a blade, and it cooks you at noon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:324
msgid "Lamps cleaned, lamps sold. If anything comes out, that's extra."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:324
msgid "Rub one?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:325
msgid "It didn't work? Odd."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:325
msgid "Vulture Repellant! Guaranteed! Results may vary."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:326
msgid "Be healed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:326
msgid "The sun fails, and still we pray to it. Habit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:327
msgid "Water is dearer than wine here. I charge accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:328
msgid "Again!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:328
msgid "Lift, run, lift again. Eighty levels of it, if you can stand."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:329
msgid "The wizards took the quarter. We kept the guild. Small mercies."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:329
msgid "Think on it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:33
msgid "Barrels need staves, staves need an axe. I'll show you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:33
msgid "Split anything lately?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:330
msgid "Spirit is what's left when the wizards take everything else."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:331
msgid "A small sun, but ours. Light is learned slowly here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:331
msgid "Let there be light."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:332
msgid "Castleview, and Lakeside when the coven lets us through."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:333
msgid "Mind your tongue."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:333
msgid "Xenoc kept us under lock. Now you hold the key. Do not insult it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:334
msgid "Everything here is magic. Some of it even works."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:334
msgid "Look, don't touch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:335
msgid "Think louder."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:335
msgid "You are thinking that I am rude. I am thinking it too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:336
msgid "I can tell you what it is, who made it, and how much you overpaid."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:336
msgid "Show me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:337
msgid "Black potions, white potions. The rest is details."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:337
msgid "Bring me something to boil."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:338
msgid "The quarter?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:338
msgid ""
"Xenoc and Morgana have seized the guilds of the quarter. Help me throw them out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:339
msgid "I enchant anything for a fee. A griffin's bridle? Double fee."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:339
msgid "Something to enchant?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:34
msgid "Arrows by the dozen. Rialdo buys most of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:34
msgid "Need fletching?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:340
msgid "Your other hand?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:340
msgid "Your palm says you will pay me. It is never wrong."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:341
msgid "A lesson in haggling?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:341
msgid "Buy low, sell high, and never let a wizard set the price."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:342
msgid "Read everything. Believe half. Remember all of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:342
msgid "Study."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:343
msgid "I never stole a thing in Sandcaster. Ask anyone who noticed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:343
msgid "Say nothing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:344
msgid "Lost?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:344
msgid "North is that way. Usually."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:345
msgid "I speak eleven tongues and the wizards understand none of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:345
msgid "Pardon?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:346
msgid "In the shadows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:346
msgid ""
"The dark elves remember the old ways. I'll teach you the sharper ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:347
msgid "Saffron, cumin, and a little sand. The sand is free."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:347
msgid "Smell this."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:348
msgid "Hit anything?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:348
msgid "The secret of archery: accuracy, accuracy, and accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:349
msgid "Sand?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:349
msgid "The wizards took the quarter and the taxes. They left us the sand."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:35
msgid "Any news of the orcs?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:35
msgid "The orcs took our sheep. All of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:350
msgid "Every colour but desert. Nobody wants desert."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:350
msgid "Some blue?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:351
msgid "Mind the glass."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:351
msgid "Sand in, glass out. Sandcaster's one honest trade."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:352
msgid "Cup?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:352
msgid "Water! Cold water! Well, water."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:353
msgid "Camels spit. People complain. The camels don't care."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:353
msgid "Need a camel?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:354
msgid "I write the wizards' decrees. I also misspell them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:354
msgid "Write something?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:355
msgid "Pots for water, pots for oil, pots for hiding gold from the wizards."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:356
msgid "Pay up?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:356
msgid "The wizards' tax is due. It is always due."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:357
msgid "I remember when the sun was bright. You don't."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:357
msgid "Sit with me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:358
msgid "Sandals for sand. Boots for fools."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:359
msgid "Date?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:359
msgid "Dates from the river palms. Sweeter than the wizards."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:36
msgid "A good breeze today."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:36
msgid "The wind tells me things. Mostly about weather."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:360
msgid "Deepest well in the city. Something at the bottom hums."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:360
msgid "Drink?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:361
msgid "Kebab?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:361
msgid "Six roads meet here, and all of them are hungry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:362
msgid "Robes for wizards, robes for pilgrims. Same robe, different price."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:362
msgid "Try one on."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:363
msgid "Every necklace protects against something. Mostly poverty: mine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:363
msgid "Pretty, no?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:364
msgid "A good belt holds up more than your trousers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:364
msgid "Belt?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:365
msgid "Boots?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:365
msgid "Six roads. You'll need boots for all of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:366
msgid ""
"Gargoyles took my magnifying glass. Destroy their lair and I'll show you what it magnifies."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:366
msgid "The glass?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:367
msgid ""
"The Fountain of Youth runs dry without the Jewel of Ages. Thieves took it, and sold it on to who knows whom."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:367
msgid "The Jewel?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:368
msgid "See that? No? That's why you need me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:368
msgid "Seen it yet?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:369
msgid ""
"How dare you speak to me? You can learn to show respect to your betters on your own, or I can teach it to you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:37
msgid "Dry feet? Lucky you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:37
msgid "The creek is full of slime. I teach water magic anyway."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:370
msgid ""
"I never joined the coven. They kept me on for the bookkeeping. Spells are on the shelves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:370
msgid "Mind the cauldron, it's mine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:371
msgid "Something warm?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:371
msgid ""
"We rebuilt the tavern in a week. Turns out the witches only painted it gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:372
msgid "The witches wanted cauldrons. I made them swords. We disagreed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:372
msgid "What needs an edge?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:373
msgid "Be still."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:373
msgid ""
"We had the doors nailed shut for two years. The prayers got out anyway."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:374
msgid "Isle?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:374
msgid ""
"The coven never sank my boat. Somebody had to row their rejects to the Isle. Isle of Lost Souls, every day, for anyone with business there. Mind the octopods."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:375
msgid "Fish?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:375
msgid "I stayed. The witches didn't want an old man. Their loss."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:376
msgid "Feel that grain."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:376
msgid ""
"Good leather turns a blade and keeps out the rain. Great leather does it while you sleep in it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:377
msgid "Hear the water?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:377
msgid "The lake listens to me. It ignored the coven. Lakes have taste."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:378
msgid "Come in. Not too close to the window."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:378
msgid ""
"I quit Castle Blackfang. The hours were terrible and the master worse."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:379
msgid "Every net in Lakeside has a witch-sized hole in it. Now I mend them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:379
msgid "Mind the hooks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:38
msgid "Back on solid ground."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:38
msgid "Stone listens if you speak slowly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:380
msgid "I was a goblin for a year! I still like beetles."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:380
msgid "Want a beetle?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:381
msgid ""
"They turned my boy into a goblin. Now he's a boy who eats beetles. I'll take it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:381
msgid "Tobbin, put that down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:382
msgid ""
"Reeds for roofs, reeds for baskets, reeds for brooms. Not anymore, for brooms."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:382
msgid "Reeds?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:383
msgid "Bite?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:383
msgid "Eels in the shallows, octopods in the deep. Stay in the shallows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:384
msgid "Any news from the Isle?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:384
msgid ""
"My husband went to the Isle of Lost Souls to look for our daughter. Nobody comes back from the Isle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:385
msgid "Boat?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:385
msgid "I built the ferry. I also painted the sign. I'm good at signs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:386
msgid ""
"A real treasure map? Nobody has brought me one of those in years. Let me see."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:386
msgid "Found anything I'd want?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:387
msgid "Any luck with the coven?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:387
msgid "The witches put me here to watch the square. I watch them instead."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:388
msgid "The leaves shiver. A tree hears axes before it sees them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:388
msgid "The wind brought you back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:389
msgid "Any luck on the mountain?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:389
msgid "Mind the stumps. Half this forest is firewood that hasn't heard yet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:39
msgid "Any word of Tam?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:39
msgid "The orcs took my boy Tam to their caves in the hills."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:390
msgid "Back to Lakeside?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:390
msgid "The Captain rows them out. I row back whoever's left."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:391
msgid ""
"A seer says I'll die of a poisoned drink. So I've stopped drinking. It's terrible."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:391
msgid "Taste this for me?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:392
msgid "An axe is a hammer that made something of itself."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:392
msgid "Swing it. No, properly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:393
msgid "A mug? It's been tasted."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:393
msgid "The King doesn't drink any more. More for everyone else."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:394
msgid "Feel the rock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:394
msgid ""
"We dug this hall with spells. Then with shovels, when the spells got tired."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:395
msgid "A dwarf shirt has forty thousand rings. I count every one. Twice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:395
msgid "Arms up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:396
msgid "Bring me anything broken. If it isn't broken, I'll fix that too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:396
msgid "What did you do to it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:397
msgid ""
"Ah, the taste testers! Please, please, sit down and drink with me for awhile! My halls will always be open to you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:397
msgid "My halls will always be open to you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:398
msgid "Greetings again, little ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:398
msgid "Greetings, little ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:399
msgid "Rest where you can, Chosen Ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:399
msgid "You bring my orb. Few climb so far, and fewer climb back down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:4
msgid "Mind the slime on your boots. Armour?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:4
msgid "Still in one piece, I see. Good."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:40
msgid "Thanks for getting me out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:40
msgid "You came! Is it far to home?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:400
msgid ""
"Membership used to cost fifty thousand. Now it costs your attention. Pay it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:400
msgid "You are still alive. Remarkable."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:401
msgid "Feeling poorly? Feeling dead?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:401
msgid ""
"We raise the dead here at a discount. We have a great deal of practice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:402
msgid ""
"Everything here was buried with someone who no longer needs it. I asked. Nobody objected."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:402
msgid "Nothing is stolen. It's re-homed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:403
msgid ""
"Potions for the living, preserves for the rest. Don't mix them up. I did once."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:403
msgid "Something to keep?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:404
msgid "A bowl? It's for display."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:404
msgid ""
"Food for the dead, keep warm. The dead don't eat, but they like the smell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:405
msgid "Back already?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:405
msgid "Death is a door. We are the locksmiths."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:406
msgid "Do sit. I won't."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:406
msgid ""
"I have been a vampire for four hundred years. The first hundred are the hardest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:407
msgid "The best dagger work is never seen. I'm told mine is excellent."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:407
msgid "You didn't hear me come in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:408
msgid "I built every trap in the city. One of them got me. I've forgiven it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:408
msgid "Mind the floor. Not that bit. That bit either."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:409
msgid "I dig them in. They dig themselves out. It's steady work."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:41
msgid "Derek is waiting for me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:41
msgid "Untie me, please! Derek must be frantic."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:410
msgid "I am not sad. I just like the acoustics."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:410
msgid "Oooh. Hello again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:411
msgid ""
"I caught a griffin. Now I need it to agree to be ridden. The bridle wants a spell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:411
msgid "The bridle?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:412
msgid "Sheltem must not sense me. Speak quietly, and carry me carefully."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:412
msgid "We are close now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:413
msgid "Hammer or tongs?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:413
msgid "I forged the thunderbolts. These are smaller. They're on sale."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:414
msgid "Another cup?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:414
msgid "Nectar, ambrosia, and a cheese plate. Even gods like cheese."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:415
msgid "Be well. You will be."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:415
msgid "I see the future. It needs healing. So do you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:416
msgid "No ceiling in this hall. Only sky, and we're above most of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:416
msgid "Twelve labours. Start with one."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:417
msgid "Shine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:417
msgid "The sun below is failing. Up here we keep a spare."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:418
msgid "Every hearth has a spirit. Mine has a guild."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:419
msgid ""
"Celestial boats. Castleview, Sandcaster, Lakeside. Don't lean over the side."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:419
msgid "Going down? Use the mirror. My boats only sail up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:42
msgid "Mind the toads. Some of them were people."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:42
msgid ""
"The witches of the meadow have been turning everyone they find into toads."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:420
msgid ""
"Ever lie down on your belly and look over the edge of the cloud? The people are so small they look like ants."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:420
msgid "Still handsome. Thank you for noticing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:421
msgid ""
"Fill your packs with the nectar of the Gods while you are here. Then pick up a spear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:421
msgid "Hungry? Armed?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:422
msgid "Buying or selling?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:422
msgid ""
"Pears just about everywhere cost but 1 gold. Know that, and you know trade."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:423
msgid "I held up the sky once. My back healed. Yours will too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:423
msgid "Shoulders back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:424
msgid "I am Zeus. You may have heard. Lightning is mostly wrist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:424
msgid "Thunder?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:425
msgid ""
"I'm waiting for my friend Ligono. If you see him, tell him to meet me here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:425
msgid "Know thine enemy. I do."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:426
msgid "Back again? They remember you, you know."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:426
msgid "Pets Unlimited! Soft, quiet, and loyal to whoever pays for them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:427
msgid "The Clan King's dead and the mine is ours again. What needs mending?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:428
msgid ""
"Everyone who enters pays the tax. Dragons pay in lessons. The last lesson costs the most."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:428
msgid "Receipt?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:429
msgid "I was old when Xeen was flat. It has always been flat. I am very old."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:429
msgid "Speak up, small one."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:43
msgid "Toad Meadow. The toads were here first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:43
msgid "Wipe your feet, it's a bog."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:430
msgid "Back again? Sit. Not in my chair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:430
msgid ""
"Thousands of years I have sat here, and you are not the strangest thing I have seen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:431
msgid "Ah, brave adventurers, perhaps you can help me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:431
msgid "No egg yet? I'm not getting any younger."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:44
msgid "Sit, sit. I'll tell you of Falista."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:44
msgid ""
"When I was still a young maiden, I fell asleep in Toad Meadow, and woke beside a unicorn."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:45
msgid "Pest control by Joe!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:45
msgid ""
"Two years ago, I came to this town on contract to control the vermin infestation. I've just about got the situation under control."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:46
msgid "Have you found Celia?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:46
msgid "My bride Celia is held in a hut in the zombie wood."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:47
msgid "I lost my bone whistle in the creek. Without it the statues sleep."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:47
msgid "The whistle?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:48
msgid "As I renew the year, so will I renew you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:48
msgid "Spring comes to those who wait."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:49
msgid "Sinners must repent."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:5
msgid "My favorite citizens, I'm always glad to see you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:5
msgid ""
"Welcome to Vertigo. Sadly, most of the population has left because the town is infested with pests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:50
msgid "The end is near."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:51
msgid "The plague is upon us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:52
msgid "Slime lords shall rule."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:140 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:427 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:53
msgid "Back for an edge?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:53
msgid "Rivercity Smithing. Paid up front; this is Rivercity."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:54
msgid "Armour. In this town you'll want it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:54
msgid "Still alive. My work, I expect."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:55
msgid "Back, dearies?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:55
msgid "Into the Cauldron, dearies. Wands, rings, oddments."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:56
msgid "Something bubbling for you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:56
msgid "The Bubbling Flask. Don't drink the green one."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:57
msgid "The Bank. Deposits welcome. Robbers less so."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:57
msgid "Your gold is where you left it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:58
msgid "Bull's Tavern. Sit, drink, don't start anything."
msgstr ""

