#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:686 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd17.lua:185 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd17.lua:194
msgid "Water Time"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:742
msgid "The dial clicks home at nine. Somewhere below, stone grinds level."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:744
msgid "Somewhere below, stone drops away."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:746
msgid "{title}: the sundial reads {reading}."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:755
msgid "{title}. The sundial reads {reading}. Turn?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:770
msgid ""
"Genie of the Lamp: \"Lucky day! For freeing me, I will grant you one of three wishes.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:774
msgid ""
"Genie of the Lamp: \"My powers are low. I can give you 10,000 gold, but it is all that I have. Do you want it?\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:790
msgid ""
"Genie of the Lamp: \"(yawn) The people before you used up two wishes. There's one left. Take your pick.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:792
msgid ""
"Genie of the Lamp: \"Thank you for releasing me. I like you, and I will grant you one wish. Choose one.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:794
msgid ""
"Genie of the Lamp: \"What took you so long? I've been stuck in that little lamp for 2000 years. If you had freed me after one thousand years, I would understand. But two? Two thousand years is simply unacceptable. I just can't let this slide. You can give up your life or the lives of your friends. What will it be?\""
msgstr ""

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:834
msgid "OK."
msgstr "De acuerdo."

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:834
msgid "Or else WHAT?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:834
msgid "Sky Bandits: \"Pay us 10,000 gold or else!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:835
msgid ""
"Sky Bandits: \"You have invaded our territory. Appease us with 10,000 gold or face our wrath!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:836
msgid "Bow down before us!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:836
msgid "Take our money"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:837
msgid ""
"Sky Bandits: \"Many apologies, good folks, but this is a robbery. I'm afraid we are going to have to ask you for 10,000 gold.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:838
msgid "Here you are"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:838
msgid "We must decline"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:839
msgid ""
"Sky Bandits: \"Hold! The toll for passing this part of the road is 10,000 gold!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:840
msgid "Draw steel, knave!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:840
msgid "Here you go"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:880
msgid ""
"Merchant of the Elements: \"Between Fire and Air I constantly travel, a simple clue to unravel. What's my cargo?\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:881
msgid ""
"Merchant of the Elements: \"Between Air and Earth I constantly travel, a simple clue to unravel. What's my cargo?\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:882
msgid ""
"Merchant of the Elements: \"Between Fire and Water I constantly travel, a simple clue to unravel. What's my cargo?\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:883
msgid ""
"Merchant of the Elements: \"Between Water and Earth I constantly travel, a simple clue to unravel. What's my cargo?\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:915
msgid "A disembodied voice booms, \"What's the password?\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:977
msgid ""
"The book is blank but for one page with the letters: \"Lt slpng dgs l\" So say the Voweless Knights. A blank line underneath awaits your answer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:980
msgid ""
"The book is blank but for one page with the letters: \"H wh lghs lst, lghs bst\" So say the Voweless Knights. A blank line underneath awaits your answer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:983
msgid ""
"The book is blank but for one page with the letters: \"Th nds f th mny twgh th nds f th fw\" So say the Voweless Knights. A blank line underneath awaits your answer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:986
msgid ""
"The book is blank but for one page with the letters: \"Lv f mny s th rt f ll vl\" So say the Voweless Knights. A blank line underneath awaits your answer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:989
msgid ""
"The book is blank but for one page with the letters: \"Dn't lk gft hrs n th mth\" So say the Voweless Knights. A blank line underneath awaits your answer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:992
msgid ""
"The book is blank but for one page with the letters: \"Fl nd hs mny r sn prtd\" So say the Voweless Knights. A blank line underneath awaits your answer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:995
msgid ""
"The book is blank but for one page with the letters: \"F wshs wr hrss, bggrs wld rd\" So say the Voweless Knights. A blank line underneath awaits your answer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1144 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10000
msgid ""
"Dead Food. It is warm, as the sign asked, and it tastes of the grave. It stays down, and leaves you harder to kill. (+2 Endurance, permanent, for each of you new to it)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1136 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10008
msgid ""
"Sandro the Lich rises from his bier. \"And now my hunger for the living compels me to attack you.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1140 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10014
msgid ""
"Sandro's voice, close behind you: \"Don't even THINK about taking my statuette!\" The grille is locked."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:86 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1002
msgid ""
"Darzog sealed his tower with a Skeleton Key, and the Archmage's study atop the Tower of High Magic keeps it for him. The study's key is sold by a talking skull deep in the Cave of Illusion, in the tundra. Skulls take gems, not gold: ten, for that key. Don't ask me what a skull does with a gem."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1130 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10021
msgid "An empty jar."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1129 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10027
msgid ""
"In a jar of green glass, in a fluid that should not still be warm: a heart, beating slowly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1132 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10034
msgid ""
"Sandro waits. Without his heart there is nothing to give him but another fight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1131 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10041
msgid ""
"Sandro: Thank you for returning my heart. I am free of this life. You are welcome to the treasures in this room as well as this key. It opens the way to my old home on the other side of the world, a place now called the Dungeon of Death. Goodbye, brave mortals, and good luck. Remember: Alamar CAN be defeated."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1134 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10048
msgid "Sandro: I have taught you all of it. Now the heart."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1135 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10049
msgid "Sandro: There is nobody here I could teach. Give me my heart."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1133 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10053
msgid ""
"Sandro laughs, a dry sound. \"Asked nicely. Very well.\" He shows your casters how the heart is parted from the body, and what it costs. The Priests among you rise as Priests of Dark, the Wizards and Necromancers as Liches."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1126 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10060
msgid ""
"Sandro the Lich stands up out of what is left of him. \"My heart. You have it. Give it to me, and I will be free of this life.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1127 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10064
msgid ""
"Sandro: Do not come to me without my heart. You have beaten me once, and it changed nothing. Bring the heart."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1128 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10069
msgid ""
"Sandro rises from the floor as if nothing happened. \"I am Sandro, the most accomplished sorcerer to ever live in Xeen. Many years ago I separated my heart from my body to cheat death. It worked, but I am not wholly alive: I am a wretched and evil monster who must kill mortals to remain alive. Retrieve my heart from the sewers below here and I will finally be released, and you may have the treasure in this room.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1138 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10075
msgid "The wheel is turned as far as it goes. The culvert gate stands open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1137 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10078
msgid ""
"The wheel turns with a groan. Down the culvert, a gate grinds up out of the water."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1146 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1149 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1152
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1155 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1158 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1161
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1166 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10089 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10108
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10125 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10141 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10157
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10173 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10189
msgid "Where the boulder stood there is only sand."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:28 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:306 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1009
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4381
msgid "Passes"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1165 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10095
msgid ""
"Correct! You have solved my riddle. Please take the magical things that I have left in the care of these enchanted boulders. Be sure to visit the other boulders for their treasure. The boulder crumbles to sand and leaves behind a suit of golden plate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1167 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10101
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder says nothing. It is, after all, a boulder."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:98 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1011
msgid "You've got one. I don't do refunds, and I don't do two."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1147 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1150 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1153
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1156 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1159 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1162
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10131 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10147
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10163 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10179 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10195
msgid ""
"The boulder crumbles to sand and leaves behind something the paladin left in its care."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1148 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10118
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My first is in apple and also in pear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1151 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10134
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My second is in cave and also in lair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:99 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1015
msgid ""
"One pass into Castleview, signed by the Mayor himself. Well, by someone. A thousand gold, and the guards never look past the seal."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1154 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10150
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My third is in fable and also in tale."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1157 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10166
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My fourth is in lark and also in quail."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1160 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10182
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My fifth is in wind but not in gale."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1163 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10198
msgid ""
"The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My sixth is in glimpse and also in sight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:100 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1020
msgid ""
"A pass is a thousand gold. Come back when you have it. The gremlins won't, if that's what you're hoping."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1164 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10204
msgid "The Enchanted Boulder speaks: My last is in night but not in light."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1145 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10210
msgid ""
"A weathered sign reads: A dying paladin gave all his magical armor to the enchanted boulders of the land for safekeeping."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1283 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10221
msgid ""
"A throne of black horn stands where every corridor ends. Whoever reaches it has walked the labyrinth. The Minotaurs among you sit, and rise as lords of the maze."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1284 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1286 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10226
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10237
msgid "The Minotaur sits, and rises a lord of the maze."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1285 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10229
msgid ""
"The horned throne waits. It honours Minotaurs, and anyone else who sits gets a sore back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1171 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1172 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10243
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10250
msgid "Bolted from above."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:105 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1025
msgid ""
"Still have it? Good. Keep it away from my herbs. The mint went purple."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1169 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10257
msgid ""
"The door is locked. Scratched on the surface are some words: The Megadragon has the key!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1168 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10274
msgid "The Megadragon is dead. The sky is a little quieter."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:106 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1028
msgid ""
"Something fell out of the sky last month and made a crater by the river. In the middle was this orb. It glows, it hums, and it looks at me. I don't want it. Take it to Madame Oorla; she reads things like that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1170 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10283
msgid ""
"The Megadragon's key turns in the lock and stays there. The hatch swings down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1187 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10292
msgid ""
"\"Die selfish scum!\" The genie's bolt finds the one who spoke, and leaves just enough of you to regret it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1188 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10300
msgid ""
"\"Your throne awaits!\" You sit down on it. You will be sitting on it for some time: you are made of stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1186 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10310
msgid ""
"\"How noble. I hate noble.\" The genie strikes you down, and your friends feel wiser for watching. (+500 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1173 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1174 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1175
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1179 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10316 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10324
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10348 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10364
msgid "The lamp is cold. Its genie has gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1177 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10332
msgid "The lamp is cold. Its genie has gone, with interest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1034
msgid ""
"Let me see... This orb belongs to the Dragon Pharaoh, in his pyramid in the desert. But first it must see Ellinger, the Queen's wizard. He locked himself in his tower with traps, so you will need his key, and at the top his tower will ask whom you seek: say his name, 'Ellinger'."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1176 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10340
msgid ""
"The lamp is cold, and warm on one side from the lava. Its genie has gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1180 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10356
msgid "The lamp is cold. Its genie has gone, still angry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1178 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10372
msgid "The lamp is cold. Its genie has gone back to sleep somewhere else."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1184 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10381
msgid ""
"The gold is in your hands for one moment. \"Now that I have my powers back I've decided to teach you not to be so greedy. I'm taking my gold back, plus interest!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1185 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10388
msgid ""
"\"Well here, why don't we share it, since neither of us seem to be greedy.\" (5,000 gold)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1181 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10396
msgid ""
"The genie snaps its fingers. Things you never studied are suddenly familiar. (+2,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1183 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10412
msgid ""
"The genie snaps its fingers, and ten gems roll out of the lamp, still warm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1182 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10419
msgid ""
"The genie snaps its fingers, and gold pours out of the lamp's spout until it doesn't. (10,000 gold)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1194 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10427
msgid ""
"Marble steps down into running water. Even the gods' drains are marble."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1210 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10437
msgid ""
"Under the straw tick, something Cyrano has not got round to selling yet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:31 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1044
msgid "The orb"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1196 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1199 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1202
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1205 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10443 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10458
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10473 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10488 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd26.lua:40
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd26.lua:42 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd26.lua:45 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd26.lua:47
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd26.lua:50 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd26.lua:52 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd26.lua:55
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd26.lua:57
msgid "Drain"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1203 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1204 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10449
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10452
msgid "You find a piece of a note that reads: BL"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:107 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1046
msgid ""
"The Pharaoh's orb wants to go home, but first it must see Ellinger. I don't make the rules. The orb does."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1206 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1207 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10464
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10467
msgid "You find a piece of a note that reads: ES"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1200 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1201 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10479
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10482
msgid "You find a piece of a note that reads: IB"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1197 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1198 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10494
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10497
msgid "You find a piece of a note that reads: TR"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1195 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10503
msgid "Search the drains."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1208 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10515
msgid "Correct! You may pass."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1209 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10521
msgid "Wrong! You may not pass!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:802 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10527
msgid "The Drawkcab Monks study the Palindrome."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:32 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1054
msgid "Fortune"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:800 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10541
msgid "The door is open to Drawkcabs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:799 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10544
msgid "'Correct,' says a voice behind the door. 'Come in. Ni emoc.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:801 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10550
msgid ""
"WRONG!!! You call yourself a Drawkcab. You know nothing of the Drawkcab! Go to the monks for further enlightenment and return to me when you feel you are ready."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:810 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10556
msgid "Nine closed chests. They spell PITCHFORK, if you squint."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:809 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10559
msgid ""
"P, I, T, C, H, F, O, R, K. The last lid drops. A pitchfork, spelled in chests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:109 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1056
msgid ""
"I see a bird in a cage on an island, and a sad man in a castle. Free the one and the other will smile."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:808 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10565
msgid "Nine closed chests, in order."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:807 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10568
msgid ""
"The ninth lid drops shut with a satisfying clunk. Nine closed chests. Somewhere, Dyson nods."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:816 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10574
msgid "The nest is quiet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:815 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10579
msgid ""
"Rooka the Queen Rat is dead. Down the tunnel, someone in a bed cheers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:818 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10594
msgid ""
"You find a diploma that reads: Valio Magnus, graduated 787 cum laude, School of Evil Wizardry. Valio smiles simply."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:819 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10598
msgid ""
"You hear Valio (the peasant hiding in the bed) yell, 'Hey, that's MY chest. Leave it alone!' You open it anyway. Inside, a diploma: Valio Magnus, cum laude, School of Evil Wizardry. Valio gets out of bed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:110 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1060
msgid ""
"I see the castle growing back, stone by stone. More disks. Always more disks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:843 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10616
msgid ""
"Fountain. The water is cool and refreshing, and it crackles on the way down. (+5 Air resistance, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:847 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10628
msgid ""
"Fountain. The water is cool and refreshing, with a bitter end that your stomach decides to like. (+5 Body resistance, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:111 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1064
msgid ""
"I see little round things that hum. Twenty of them. Gremlins, sprites, ogres, the towers. Ellinger counts them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:841 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10640
msgid ""
"Fountain. The water is cool and refreshing, and the heat of the tower seems to step back from you. (+5 Fire resistance, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:845 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10652
msgid ""
"Fountain. The water is cool and refreshing, and colder than it looks. (+5 Water resistance, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:833 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:836 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10659
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10671
msgid "The front door stands open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:834 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10660
msgid ""
"Locked, and warded from both sides. The key is upstairs, with the heretics."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:832 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:835 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10664
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10676
msgid ""
"The key turns and the heretics' wards on the door die with a small, sulky pop."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:837 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10672
msgid ""
"Locked, and warded from both sides. The key is upstairs, with the heretics. A rope hangs from a window on the north wall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:112 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1068
msgid ""
"I see a tower full of traps and a man at the top who loves his boots. Go up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:828 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:830 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10685
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10705
msgid "Thank you for sparing my life. I shall be going now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:839 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10691
msgid "The alcove is empty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:838 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10696
msgid ""
"Disc. Two of them, Energy Disks, set in the alcoves like offerings. Mok will not miss them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:827 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10719
msgid ""
"Hand over hand, past the arrow slits. Nobody looks out. The window at the top is open: heretics trust their wards, not their windows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:113 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1072
msgid ""
"I see a woman who lost her necklace to the rats under the town, and holds a key she doesn't need. Nadia."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:860 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10725 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:143
msgid ""
"Split and cold. Whatever hatched here was eaten by whatever lives here now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:861 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10748
msgid "The mountains are full. Empty them first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1075
msgid "I see an orb. Somebody nearby has one. Zelda, the herbalist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:862 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10752
msgid ""
"The God of Minerals refills the mines for 10,000 gold. Minerals are not cheap. Gods are worse."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:863 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10760
msgid ""
"The God of Minerals takes your gold, which is, after all, a mineral. Somewhere in the rock, veins knit shut and fill again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:869 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10782
msgid "Rubble, and nothing green in it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:868 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10788
msgid "You found an emerald handle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:116 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1080
msgid ""
"My necklace! It still smells of sewer, but it's mine. Here, for your trouble. And Ellinger owes me a favour. Tell him Nadia sent you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:876 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10811
msgid "Melon vines, picked clean."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:875 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10816
msgid ""
"Monga Melons, three of them, ripe. Something with a great many legs objects."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1242 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10823
msgid ""
"The countless futures of the Dragon stream into your brain like fire licking at tender wood. You break its grip before you are destroyed, and can only mutter the words: The possibilities are unlimited."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1243 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10828
msgid ""
"The lock is instantaneous, and endless futures flash before you. The mortal shell you wear cannot hold what the mind now sees. Fire flares in your head, and the link breaks just in time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1238 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10835
msgid ""
"As your mind links with the Dragon's, its knowledge fills your brain with fire. You break the link before it is overloaded, weak and drained, and find yourself saying one phrase over and over: The knowledge is limitless."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1239 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10840
msgid ""
"As your mind links with the Dragon you feel its knowledge combine with your own. Your feeble mind tries to absorb the new wisdom but is found lacking. You tear yourself away, your head ringing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1240 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10847
msgid ""
"The past of the Dragon fills your brain, faster and faster, towards the creation of time and beyond. You break the link in a desperate attempt at self preservation, and the words tumble from your lips: The history is endless."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1241 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10852
msgid ""
"Images of times long past fill your mind, and you watch worlds being uncreated. You try to break free from the grip of the Dragon and only just manage it. Your body aches as if something had been trying to leave it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1246 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1248 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1250
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10859 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10872 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10885
msgid "Dragon Power Crystal. It has nothing more for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1247 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10865
msgid ""
"The power from the Dragon Crystal discharges into your body in a nearly fatal surge. Your body is able to absorb some of the mystic energy. (+3,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1249 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10878
msgid ""
"The power from the Dragon Crystal discharges into your body in a nearly fatal surge. Your body is able to absorb some of the mystic energy. (+4,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1251 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10891
msgid ""
"The power from the Dragon Crystal discharges into your body in a nearly fatal surge. Your body is able to absorb some of the mystic energy. (+5,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1218 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10897
msgid ""
"Two eggs are left in the nest. Taking another would be pushing your luck."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:117 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1090
msgid "The rats have it down there somewhere. Big rats. Organised rats."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1217 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10903
msgid ""
"You lift one of the eggs out of the nest. It is heavy, leathery and warm, and something inside it turns over."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1223 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10910
msgid "The flask has been drained. By you, as it happens."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1224 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10915
msgid ""
"Potion. It is thick, bitter and faintly warm, and your bones seem to set harder as it goes down. (+2 Endurance, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1228 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10921
msgid ""
"The Eye of the Dragon looks at you. It has nothing more to say, and it says so."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1227 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10929
msgid ""
"\"Very good, mortals!\" The Eye of the Dragon closes, and opens again on a crystal set in a golden shaft: the Elder Staff."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:118 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1093
msgid ""
"The rats came up the drain and took my onyx necklace right off the dresser. They live in the sewers under town. Bring it back and I'll make it worth your while."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1229 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10936
msgid "\"Die fools!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1222 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10942
msgid ""
"A note amongst the bones reads: You have to be pretty smart to survive a look in one of the crystal balls on the Dragon Cloud."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1221 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10948
msgid ""
"A note amongst the bones reads: The eye of the Dragon holds the Elder Staff."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1220 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10954
msgid ""
"You find a note amongst the bones that was part of this dead adventurer's diary. It reads: I think the secret of the dragon has something to do with forever, or really, really big..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1219 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10960
msgid ""
"You find a note amongst the bones that was part of this dead adventurer's diary. It reads: I don't trust that druid guy. He seemed too eager to get his hands on a dragon egg, and he sure didn't look like he had ten million gold pieces!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1231 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1233 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1235
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1237 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10966 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10974
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10982 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10990
msgid "You are unable to understand the strange Dragon Runes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1232 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10968
msgid ""
"You decipher the strange Dragon Runes and are puzzled by the simplicity of the inscription: FI"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1230 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10976
msgid ""
"You decipher the strange Dragon Runes and are puzzled by the simplicity of the inscription: IN"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1234 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10984
msgid ""
"You decipher the strange Dragon Runes and are puzzled by the simplicity of the inscription: NI"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1236 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10992
msgid ""
"You decipher the strange Dragon Runes and are puzzled by the simplicity of the inscription: TY"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1225 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10999
msgid "You learn nothing new from the Tome."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:34 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1100
msgid "Necklace"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1226 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11004
msgid ""
"Tome of Great Experience. You read it cover to cover, and several of its chapters read you. (+4,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1216 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11010
msgid ""
"Two black leaves, warm to the touch, with a keyhole shaped like a dragon's eye. The gate opens only to the Key to the Dragon Tower. The dragons say its key lies under Castle Alamar."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1215 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11012
msgid ""
"The black key turns with a sound like a sigh. The gate of the Dragon Tower swings in on warm air."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:115 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1102
msgid "I wear it every day now, and I don't go near the drains."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1245 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11038
msgid ""
"Well of Fantastic Skill. The water is cool and refreshing, and for a while everything seems easy. (+20 to every statistic until you rest)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:123 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1112
msgid ""
"Welcome. I'm sorry you had to run the gauntlet; my defenses keep Alamar's spies from my door. I see that you hold the Dragon Pharaoh's orb. Without it he cannot fight Alamar, and you must return it to him. But he has sealed his pyramid, and the key is in Queen Kalindra's castle, which Alamar moved out of phase when he took the Queen. Twenty energy discs will bring it back, five at a time. Bring them to me. And here is a little something: your gifts are in the chest that runs away from you in the south-west of Castleview. I will tell it to stay still."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1275 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11134
msgid ""
"You try to open the lid of the coffin, but it is too heavy and you are too weak. From inside, someone turns over."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1269 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11141
msgid "Sorry, the crossword puzzle is not done yet. You may not descend!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1268 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11146
msgid ""
"You may pass. For completing the puzzle, here is your reward. (+6,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1253 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11153
msgid "Sandro's door stands open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1254 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11154
msgid ""
"A black iron door with Sandro's mark, a skull with a keyhole for an eye. It answers only to his key, the Key to the Dungeon of Death."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1252 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11158
msgid ""
"The Key to the Dungeon of Death turns in the skull's eye. The black iron door opens on a stair, and a smell of old incense and older dust comes up it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1276 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11164
msgid "The gongs fall silent."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1282 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11170
msgid ""
"The Lord Xeen Machine is dark and cold. Somebody will have to write a new maintenance schedule."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1281 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11176
msgid ""
"You pull the four cores out of the Lord Xeen Machine one by one. It shudders, sparks and stops. Somewhere a great many lights go out, and nothing else happens, which is how you know it worked. (+10,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1274 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11182
msgid ""
"You find a note that reads: Gone to Necropolis, will return soon. Please keep the place clean. I've de-activated most of the defenses so that you and your friends can roam around freely. The vampires have requested their privacy, so leave them alone. Have fun... (signed) Sandro"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1272 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11192
msgid ""
"The Shrine of Great Evil shatters with a sound like a scream cut short. (+3,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:124 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1120
msgid ""
"You climbed my tower without the Pharaoh's orb? Then you are either very brave or very lost. Come back when you hold it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1271 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11202
msgid ""
"The Shrine of Lesser Evil breaks apart. The air in the gallery is easier to breathe. (+2,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1270 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11212
msgid ""
"The Shrine of Minor Evil cracks and falls in. Something small and spiteful goes out of the room. (+1,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1273 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11221
msgid ""
"You destroy the shrine, which destroys this dungeon, taking you with it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1278 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11227
msgid ""
"The screen flashes with the response: Code accepted already. Have a nice day."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1277 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11232
msgid ""
"The screen flashes with the response: CODE ACCEPTED. WELCOME, OPERATOR. Somewhere below, a great many fans slow down. (+2,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1279 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11239
msgid "The screen flashes with the response: You are a SUPER Goober!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1280 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11243
msgid "The screen flashes with the response: You are a Goober!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1297 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11249
msgid ""
"Prisoner list. One Lich, known as Vexor the Black, to be held indefinitely, for the crime of Necromancy. One Lich, known as Clemon the Dead, the same. One Lich, known as Saxar the Permanent, the same. One Lich, known as Morgrath the Grey, the same. One Lich, known as Ulvane the Unrepentant, the same. One Bone Dragon, formerly Iron Vithnipravad, to be held until proper reburial can be arranged. One Bone Dragon, formerly Argonax, the same. One Bone Dragon, formerly Drothnavod the Weighty (A.K.A. Scraps), the same."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1299 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11255
msgid "The cells are quiet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1298 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11258
msgid ""
"The last lich comes apart like a dropped bundle of kindling. The cells are quiet, for the first time since the castle came back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:183 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:318 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:36
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:376 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:378 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1126
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3295 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4429 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4661
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4669 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd04.lua:193
msgid "Alamar"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1343 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11274
msgid ""
"The last drum burns, and the caves fall silent but for dripping water. Without their drums the warband's raiders will not ride out again. Oslo will want to hear of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:122 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1128
msgid ""
"The castle can be restored to our world by casting certain complex spells powered by energy discs. Energy discs are rare magical batteries. I recently used the last of mine protecting this tower, and I haven't a clue where others may be found. Every five will restore a fourth part of the castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1342 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11284
msgid ""
"A skinny farm boy scrambles to his feet. \"You came! I'm Tam, Oslo's son. They were going to sell me back to Pa for every cow he's got. I can climb out myself now. I'll run straight home and tell him!\" He swarms up the rope ladder and is gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1486 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11290
msgid "Leaves. Leaves and a pigeon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1485 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11294
msgid "You found some money growing on this tree!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1484 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11300
msgid "Pest control by Joe"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1483 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11306
msgid "This space for rent"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1505 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11312
msgid "If you can read this ad, so can your customers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1506 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11318
msgid "REAL adventurers try Deep Mine Alpha!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1508 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11324
msgid "Mountains in your way? Try due N."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1507 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11330
msgid "School of Navigation 9N"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1509 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11339
msgid "What did you expect, money?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1513 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11347 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:480
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:486
msgid "You ruin their food, burn their tents, and poison their water."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1518 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11356
msgid ""
"The encampment burns to the sound of distant howls of anger and frustration."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1517 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11362
msgid "Asp-->"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1524 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11368
msgid ""
"Every caravan adds a stone for luck on the crossing. You add yours, and feel luckier for it. (+Luck, until you rest)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1525 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11374
msgid ""
"Your stone is already on the cairn. Piling on more would be greed, and the desert notices greed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:138 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1138
msgid ""
"Have I taken the time to tell you that you are doing a wonderful job? All of you. I mean it. These discs will free the second level of the castle from Alamar's curse. Perhaps you will find more on the newly restored section."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1521 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11380
msgid ""
"The urn is full of sand and old coins. Saul says the coins are for the sand."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1522 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11386
msgid ""
"The Summer Druid's stones are warm long after dark. Their heat sinks into you. (+Fire resistance, until you rest)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1523 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11392
msgid "The stones are warm, but you have had your share of their heat."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1519 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11400
msgid ""
"You lift the bar from the desert side, and the yard gate swings open. Beyond it a coach waits, its driver asleep under a sign: WARZONE. ALL COMERS."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1520 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11406
msgid ""
"The gate is barred. Gorm calls from the coach house door: \"The sand's no place for you yet. Arena or home.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1533 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11413
msgid ""
"A demon and a devil, carved in black rock. The demon's eye sockets are empty. Their skulls are not here; someone has scratched an arrow pointing inside."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1527 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11419
msgid "Charred stakes and cold ash. The orcs have not come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1526 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11424
msgid "The Outpost burns well. The orcs will not be coming back to it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1528 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11430
msgid ""
"Shrine of Fire. You pray, and the heat of the mountain seems to turn away from you. (+10 Fire resistance, until you rest)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1529 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11436
msgid "You don't think anyone is listening."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1532 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11442
msgid ""
"A note nailed by the pay chest: \"The dragons came south. Pay owed to the end of the month. Nobody stays.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1530 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11448
msgid ""
"Well of Speed. The water is gone from the cup before you know you have drunk it. (+2 Speed, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1345 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11460
msgid "The statue is silent."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1344 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11468
msgid ""
"The statue's stone mouth moves: \"I dub all who find me 'Super Explorer'.\" You feel lighter on your feet. +2 Speed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1346 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1347 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11478
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11488
msgid ""
"Bones, feathers and stolen trinkets go up together. The harpies will nest somewhere lower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1348 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11498
msgid ""
"The nest burns, and the smoke drifts down through a gap in the cloud toward Vertigo."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:139 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1150
msgid ""
"Excellent work. You have brought enough discs to restore the first level of the castle. Go to the castle as soon as you can. Perhaps you will find more energy discs inside."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1534 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11504
msgid ""
"The clouds hold under your feet. Far ahead, past the rocs, stand the black walls of Castle Xeen, and between here and there someone has set up a carnival."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1562 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11511
msgid "The great Castle Xeen recently stood here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1537 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11521
msgid ""
"The nest goes up, and the aviary's rocs scream at you from every perch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1538 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11531
msgid ""
"The nest goes up. A roc's egg cracks in the heat, and nothing comes out of it any more."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1539 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11541
msgid ""
"The last nest burns. Lord Xeen will have to buy his rocs somewhere else."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1535 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1536 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11551
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11561
msgid ""
"Sticks the size of spars, eggshells the size of shields, and the bones of things that flew too near. It all burns."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1540 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1543 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1546
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1549 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1552 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1555
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11569 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11586 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11603
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11620 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11637 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11654
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x8.lua:122 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x8.lua:138
msgid ""
"A gust of wind strikes you from the statue's hands. It is kept for Crusaders."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1541 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1544 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1547
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1550 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1553 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1556
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11573 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11590 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11607
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11624 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11641 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11658
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x8.lua:119 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x8.lua:135
msgid "The statue's hands are empty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1542 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1545 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1548
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1551 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1554 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1557
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11578 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11595 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11612
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11629 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11646 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11663
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x8.lua:128 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x8.lua:144
msgid "The statue's open hands hold a gift for a Crusader."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:140 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1163
msgid ""
"Good, good. More discs. I still need five to restore level two of the castle. Keep the discs with you and come back when you have them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1561 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11669
msgid "Xeen's Aviary"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:141 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1167
msgid ""
"Ahh! I see you have energy discs for me! I will need five to power the spells that will restore the first level of the castle. Keep the discs with you and return when you have at least five. The world of Xeen is counting on you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1558 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11675
msgid "Danger! Go back!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1560 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11687
msgid "Now entering Xeendom"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1569 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11694
msgid ""
"The Book of Languages: a grammar of every tongue of Cloudside, from the dwarves' runes to the gremlins' squeaks. Someone has underlined 'Please' and 'Thank you' in all of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1570 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11700
msgid ""
"The Book of Languages: a grammar of every tongue of Cloudside, from the dwarves' runes to the gremlins' squeaks. Someone has underlined 'Please' and 'Thank you' in all of them. An afternoon with it, and the old runes on the cloud statues will make sense to you. (Linguist)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1581 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11711
msgid "You teleported into the air outside the tower!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1579 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11717
msgid ""
"The plaque reads: Remember, today is the first day of the rest of your life."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:142 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1172
msgid ""
"No discs? Well, don't worry. When Alamar destroys the world, you won't be the only ones to die. Millions will go with you. That must be comforting."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1574 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11723
msgid "The plaque reads: Don't worry, be happy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1572 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11729
msgid "The plaque reads: King Burlock's ceremonial armor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1576 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11735
msgid "The plaque reads: Have a nice day."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1573 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11741
msgid "The plaque reads: Prince Roland's ceremonial armor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1575 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11747
msgid ""
"The plaque reads: Peasant's choice award--Best Ruler of the Year (597)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:143 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1175
msgid ""
"You haven't found any energy discs yet, eh? Perhaps you fail to grasp the urgency of your mission. ALAMAR IS GOING TO DESTROY XEEN! NOW GET BACK OUT THERE AND SAVE THE WORLD!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1577 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11753
msgid ""
"The plaque reads: Remember, he who is too sharp sometimes cuts himself."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1578 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11759
msgid "The plaque reads: Speak softly, but carry a large magic sword."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1580 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11765
msgid "The plaque reads: Remember, eat less and think thin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1594 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11778
msgid ""
"Green grass, still air and a clear sky, in the middle of a volcano. Nobody here seems surprised to see you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1601 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11784
msgid ""
"Fallen rock chokes the cleft. Cool air, and a smell of grass, seeps between the stones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1600 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11786
msgid ""
"The cleft is clear. Cool air and a smell of grass come up from the valley."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1599 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11794
msgid ""
"You shift the last stones from the inside. The cleft is open both ways now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1597 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11800
msgid ""
"A crystal set in the rock at eye height, watching you. From somewhere behind it, Benedict's voice: \"Smile! You're being broadcast to millions.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1598 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11806
msgid "The moons are not aligned. You are unable to pass."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1596 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11821
msgid ""
"Congratulations, You found Shangri-La! The water tastes of every road that led here. (+15,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:147 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1183
msgid ""
"The Songbird is on the isle in the lake, past Lakeside. The dungeon there is all doors that ask you to cheer up. Father would never get through them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:148 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1186
msgid ""
"My father Dimitri was captain of the Queen's guard. Since she was taken he sits in the dark and won't eat. Only the Songbird of Serenity could lift his despair, and it's caged in the Dungeon of Lost Souls on the lake isle. Here is the key to its cage. Father kept it; he won't use it. The Isle eats parties, mind."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:39 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1193
msgid "The Queen"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:149 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1194
msgid ""
"The Queen is gone. What is a captain without a queen? A man in a chair. Leave me be."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:154 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1202
msgid ""
"Dig, and say nothing at table. He smiles at me now. He never used to smile."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:155 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1205
msgid ""
"Crodo is home, and he says the Prince is... no. I believe him. I have watched that man not eat for a year. The King would not hear it, and the thing at his side would. So, quietly again: an Excavation Permit for Newcastle's dungeon. Emerson will dig where you tell him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:156 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1218
msgid ""
"Dug, shored and swept. There's a door at the bottom my men won't touch. It hums. I put a chalk mark on it: NOT MY DEPARTMENT."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:157 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1222
msgid ""
"A permit, signed and sealed, and five Megacredits. Lovely. The old dungeon was caved in by the bolt that took the castle. My men will have it open by the time you get there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:158 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1236
msgid ""
"The permit's fine. The Megacredits aren't here. Five, please. Digging is the expensive kind of building."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:159 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1239
msgid ""
"No digging without a permit. I don't make the rules. Artemus does, and he's very fond of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:169 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1246
msgid ""
"That song... I have been sitting in the dark like a fool. Listen. When Alamar took the castle, he gave the Queen to Count Blackfang, and the Count made her a vampire. Only her own crown can undo it, and it is in her bedroom safe, upstairs, in the part of the castle that isn't back yet. The disk safes on this floor open to 64, 52, 31. And go to Ambrose, the Queen's Knight, at Griffin Pass. He has been trying to reach Blackfang for a year. Keep the bird. I'll hear it when you pass."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:43 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1260
msgid "The Songbird"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:168 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1262
msgid ""
"Ambrose is at Griffin Pass, on the south edge of the Forbidden Zone. He asks everyone who sent them. Tell him Dimitri did, and he'll listen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:171 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:172 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:173
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:174 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:44 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1270
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3155 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3166 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3177
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3188
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:170 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1271
msgid ""
"Father laughed this morning. At breakfast. At nothing! Here, it's all I have that's worth anything. I took it from the guard room when nobody was guarding it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:191 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1283
msgid ""
"A griffin's bridle. Double fee, as the sign says: five thousand. ... There. It hums when a griffin is near, and the griffin hums back. Mostly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:192 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1290
msgid ""
"A griffin's bridle? Five thousand gold. Griffins are a specialty, and specialties cost extra."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:46 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1296
msgid "The bridle"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:190 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1298
msgid ""
"If the griffin bites, that is the griffin's business, not the bridle's. No refunds."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:193 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1307
msgid ""
"Dimitri? Then the old bear is awake again. Good. I caught a griffin to fly into Blackfang, and the beast will not take a bridle. An enchanted one, it might. Natasha in Sandcaster could do it. Here is the bridle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:195 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1317
msgid ""
"It took it! Look at him, calm as a cart horse. Blackfang has no gate that opens to the living, but it has walls, and walls have tops. When you are ready, we fly. And take this, from the Queen's own purse; she would want it spent on her rescue."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:196 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1326
msgid ""
"The griffin still bites anything that looks like leather. Natasha, in Sandcaster."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:49 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1332
msgid "The griffin"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:194 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1334
msgid "The griffin is fed and grumpy. Say the word, and we fly to Blackfang."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:50 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1342
msgid "Fly to Blackfang"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:197 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1343
msgid "Hold on to something that isn't the griffin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:203 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1352
msgid ""
"Congratulations! We've done it! The castle is free! I can't thank you enough. You must now find the key to the pyramid in the castle and return the orb to the Pharaoh. I must attend to certain magical duties from now till the completion of the prophecy. Go with my blessing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:204 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1364
msgid ""
"This is fantastic! Your speedy delivery has kept us on track. The dungeon returns now. Just five more discs will bring back the last of the castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:205 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1376
msgid ""
"So close! Just five discs will finish the castle. The key must be in that section!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:206 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1380
msgid ""
"Thanks for the discs, but I still need five to restore the dungeon. I would like to restore the third level first, but the mathematics forbid it. Carry on."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:207 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1384
msgid ""
"What's this? You have no discs? Do you seek to snatch defeat from the jaws of victory? There is still time to gather the rest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:208 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1387
msgid ""
"Why have you come to me empty handed? Did you expect congratulations? The final hour approaches while you dawdle here!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:52 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1393
msgid "Energy discs"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:202 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1395
msgid ""
"It is good to see you again, my friends, but I cannot spend much time talking. I must see to my magical duties, and you must see to yours. The world is depending on us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:211 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1405
msgid ""
"My crown. Put it on my head, quickly, before the hunger comes back. ... There. I am myself. Ambrose will fly me home after dark; the sun and I are not friends yet. Take this: the key to the Great Pyramid. Alamar wanted it so badly he took a castle to hide it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:212 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1418
msgid ""
"The safe in my bedroom. Three, thirty-one, sixty-two. Hurry. I am trying very hard not to look at your necks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:213 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1421
msgid ""
"Stay back. Count Blackfang made me what I am, and I am hungry all the time. Only my own crown can undo it. It is in the safe in my bedroom, in my own castle: three, thirty-one, sixty-two. Bring it, Crusaders. Please."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:54 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1429
msgid "The crown"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:210 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1431
msgid ""
"My crown, my castle, my thanks. The Pharaoh will want his orb back, and he does not like to wait. Neither, I find, do I."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:55 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1439
msgid "Fly us out"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:214 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1440
msgid "Are you ready to leave this awful place, friends? Then hold on."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:224 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1449
msgid ""
"The lava round the second meteor is cool now. What fell from the sky there is not a meteor. Go and see, and be polite to whoever wakes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:225 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1453
msgid ""
"My orb. Without it I could see Alamar, but not strike him. Hear what I have seen. Alamar is not a king. He is Sheltem, a guardian the Ancients made to keep a world safe, who decided he knew better. He means to steer Xeen away from its sun and sail it like a ship. He came here in a pod from the stars. So did his pursuer, and that pod fell into lava in the Forbidden Zone. I have cooled it. Go."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:226 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1462
msgid ""
"You found your way up my pyramid without my orb? I admire the effort and regret the result. Bring it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:266 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1467
msgid ""
"Olympus. Soul Storage. One box. Do not open the others' doors; the gods are touchy about their storage."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:267 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1470
msgid ""
"Corak is awake. Then the prophecy is not a poem after all. You are the Chosen Ones: I say so, and the gods of Olympus will let you in on my word. Here is my pass. Lucio's boats sail from the jetties at Castleview and Sandcaster, and from Lakeside's dock. In Olympus is the only Soul Box left on Xeen. Corak needs it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:58 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1483
msgid "The boats"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:268 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1485
msgid ""
"Chosen Ones may ride, the Pharaoh says. He doesn't pay the fare, mind: that's yours. Up we go: Castleview's jetty, Sandcaster's, or Lakeside's dock, twice a week, and the clouds do the rest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:269 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1488
msgid ""
"My boats sail the sky, friends, and only for those the Dragon Pharaoh has chosen. Come back with his word and I'll take you up to Olympus."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/monster_data.txt:334 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:177 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:59
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1491
msgid "Prince Roland"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:272 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1492
msgid ""
"Prince Roland is held by Alamar in the bottom level of the Castle. Alive, after a fashion. Alamar keeps things."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:283 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1498
msgid ""
"Ah! A Soulbox! You have done well. I will hide in the box while you take me to Sheltem. Once you are in his presence, throw the box to the ground and I will come out and fight him. Be careful. If you lose the box or are killed, Xeen is doomed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:284 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1508
msgid ""
"I cannot leave the safety of this ship without some means of hiding from Sheltem's defenses. The Ancients made Soul Boxes for such things. The Pharaoh will know where one is left."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:74 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:61 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1514
msgid "Soul Box"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:282 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1516
msgid "(The box is quiet. Something inside it is being very patient.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/monster_data.txt:338 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:62 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1524
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd17.lua:325
msgid "Sheltem"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:285 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1525
msgid ""
"Much has happened since I crashed on Darkside. Sheltem left his stasis long before I did and has done much evil. My instruments show Xeen drifting out of its orbit: he has full control of it. I have orders to stop him, and I cannot, unless he does not see me coming."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/monster_data.txt:295 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:63 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:65
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1531 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1557 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd04.lua:502
msgid "Lord Xeen"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:286 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1533
msgid ""
"Ah! You warm my reptilian heart. Sheltem is gone, and the wicked 'Lord Xeen' creation with him. Keep the Cube and the Scepter together. The destiny of Xeen is in sight, and I will need you for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:287 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1536
msgid ""
"It is good to see you again, Chosen Ones. Xeen is returning to its proper orbit. But Sheltem's general, the monster that calls himself 'Lord Xeen' on the other side of the world, still lives and holds the Scepter of Temporal Distortion. Rid the world of him, in his cloud castle above Darzog's tower, and bring me the scepter."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:341 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1545
msgid ""
"Thank you for rescuing Xeen from that foul spirit. It is a pity about the mirror, though. Your destiny lies on the darkside of Xeen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:342 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1550
msgid ""
"Thank you for rescuing Xeen from that foul spirit. It is a pity about the mirror, though. And my brother? If he lives, he is on the other side. Go to him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:340 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1559
msgid ""
"Thank you again. Castle Xeen is a cloud again. The court misses the mirror more than it misses my brother's double."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:363 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1569
msgid ""
"Xeen is one world, and the sun is where it belongs. I have nothing left to ask of you, Chosen Ones. That has not happened to me in a very long time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:364 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1573
msgid ""
"The machines at the corners of the other side, the four sleepers on this side, Roland in Sheltem's dungeon, the cloud above Darkstone Tower. Then the Cube and the Scepter, together, at my shrine. Rest where you can."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:365 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1576
msgid ""
"Now, with the Cube and the Scepter in hand and the enemies of the world out of the way, the destiny of Xeen is in sight. Turn on the four machines in the corners of the other side of the world. Awaken the elemental sleepers on this side. Open the way to the cloud world above Darkstone Tower: Prince Roland and Queen Kalindra are getting married there. Oh, that reminds me. Have you rescued Prince Roland from the bottom of Sheltem's dungeon yet? If you haven't, that's one more little detail."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:67 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1586
msgid "The sleepers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:366 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1587
msgid ""
"Each sleeper lies on its own plane, and the planes hang below the Skyroads. Stand at a corner of the roads and the sky asks what you seek. Name the element: Fire in the north-west, Air in the north-east, Earth in the south-east, Water in the south-west. Then step off. The sleepers wake only for the Chosen Ones, and only when the Reflectors are humming."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:68 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1594
msgid "My brother"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:412 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1595
msgid ""
"My brother is home. The real one, this time; he eats. He tells me there is to be a wedding on a cloud, to a queen I have never met. Go and make sure it happens, Crusaders. I am too old to be surprised twice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:433 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1603
msgid ""
"Really? You have one? A widget! Then the Chime of Opening is yours. Make it so!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:434 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1611
msgid ""
"So you've come to me for the Chime of Opening. What could you possibly offer me in exchange? I've been around for thousands of years and I've seen everything... well, almost everything. There is one mysterious item that I haven't seen. It's called a widget. Go and see Halon the Efficient, the clockmaker, whose workshop stands east of Darkstone Tower in Winterkill Tundra. He's the one who first told me of it. Then don't come back 'til you find one!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:84 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:70 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1617
msgid "Chime of Opening"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:432 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1619
msgid ""
"Nice to see you again, adventurers! The widget that you brought to me is fascinating! I turn it over every morning. It still does nothing. Marvellous."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:71 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1627
msgid "The wedding"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:473 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1628
msgid ""
"Married on a cloud, by a dragon, with cake. My brother will not believe a word of it. Thank you, Crusaders: for the coffin, and for this."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:72 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1634
msgid "One world"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:474 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1635
msgid ""
"One world, and one sun. I stood in daylight this morning and nothing happened to me at all. I could get used to that. The Darkside owes you, Crusaders. So do I."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:493 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1642
msgid ""
"I am the Summer Druid. Summer will not end until someone carries its last flower away. Take it to the Autumn Druid, on Burlock's savannah. The year is a relay, and I have held it long enough."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:492 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1653
msgid ""
"Take the Last Flower of Summer to the Autumn Druid on the savannah, so that summer can end."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:75 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1661
msgid "Autumn"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:494 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1663
msgid "Please take the Last Fallen Leaf of Autumn to the Winter Druid."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:495 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1667
msgid ""
"Thank you for the Last Flower of Summer. Here is the Last Fallen Leaf of Autumn. Take the Leaf to the Winter Druid so Winter can begin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:496 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1673
msgid ""
"I am the Autumn Druid. I require the Last Flower of Summer before I can give you the last fallen Leaf of Autumn. Without the last flower of summer I cannot make summer end."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:497 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1678
msgid ""
"Take the Snowflake to the Spring Druid by Pitchfork Creek. He has waited all winter. He always does."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:498 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1682
msgid ""
"The last leaf. Then winter may begin. Here is the last Snowflake of Winter; carry it to the Spring Druid, by Pitchfork Creek in Vertigo's meadows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:499 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1688
msgid ""
"I am the Winter Druid. Bring me the last fallen Leaf of Autumn, or winter waits, and so does everything after it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:501 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1693
msgid ""
"The last snowflake of Winter. Here is the Last Raindrop of Spring, and your reward. As I renew the year, so will I renew you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:502 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1702
msgid ""
"I require the last snowflake of Winter before I can give you the Last Raindrop of Spring and your reward. The Summer Druid begins the year, in the west."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:78 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1708
msgid "Spring"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:500 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1710
msgid ""
"Spring comes to those who wait. You did not wait; you walked. That works too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:504 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1720
msgid ""
"Thank you for returning my pendant. Please accept the Enchant Item spell as your reward. I will also return the drinking fountain to normal. And the spellcasters among you have earned a better title than 'that lot with the pendant'."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:103 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:505 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1733
msgid "No pendant, no reward."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:506 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1736
msgid ""
"The sorceresses of Rivercity have stolen a magical pendant of mine. I want it back, and I will reward you if you return it. They keep their loot in a strongbox on the south quay, outside their house."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:80 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1743
msgid "Pendant"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:503 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1745
msgid ""
"The fountain runs again and the tavern charges for water again. Rivercity is back to normal. I'm not sure that's a compliment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:81 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1753
msgid "Barok"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:507 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1754
msgid ""
"The tavern hired the sorceresses to run Barok out of town. Then they plugged the fountain, so now we buy our water here. Funny how that works."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:510 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1762
msgid ""
"You have recovered my tiara and gotten rid of that bothersome robber gang. I am pleased. As a reward I give you this treasure: its twin, which I never liked as much. And the thieves among you will be called Rogues from today. I'll have it written down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:511 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1775
msgid "I see that you have not recovered my tiara. Please keep trying."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:512 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1778
msgid ""
"My servants have informed me that my diamond tiara has been stolen from my room. I believe it to be the work of robbers that dwell in Rivercity, under the great bridge. They are led by a devious and cunning boss. They must be stopped and my tiara recovered. Do this and you will be greatly rewarded."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:83 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1785
msgid "Tiara"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:509 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1787
msgid "It is always exhilarating to see adventurers such as yourselves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:517 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1797
msgid ""
"You have destroyed the Ninja Clan that drove me from my sacred home. I am eternally grateful. As payment for your services, please let me fill your packs with food. And those of you who walk the monk's road: you have walked it far enough to be called Initiates."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:518 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1809
msgid ""
"There are still Ninja in my Pagoda. I cannot go home until they are gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:519 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1812
msgid ""
"I am a peace loving old monk driven from my sacred home. I used to live in the Pagoda due south from here until the Evil Ninja clan drove me out. I am too old to fight, but perhaps you, being so strong and well-armed, could rid my home of these evil clansmen. I could reward you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:85 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1819
msgid "The Pagoda"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:516 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1821
msgid ""
"The pagoda is quiet again. I sweep it every morning. The ninjas never swept. Someone lives in the cellar, though. I leave rice by the shrine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:520 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1830
msgid ""
"A monk who has not been initiated? Sit. Breathe. Stand up. That's all it is, really. The rest you already did."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:523 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1839
msgid ""
"The curse is over. People are walking out of the cellars on two legs. Here: the town collected this for you. Some of it was in snakeskins."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:524 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1847
msgid ""
"Still snakes. Eve says the stones round the well have something to say. Eve says a lot of things now, and all of them with an s."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:525 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1850
msgid ""
"A terrible thing has happened to Asp. A foul curse has been placed on the town that turns people into snakes. Please save us!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:522 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1859
msgid ""
"Thank you for saving us! Eve hasn't hissed in a week. I've started to miss it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:527 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1868
msgid ""
"There isss a transformer somewhere under town that is turning people into snakes. If you destroy it, the curse will surely end. The ssstones round the well open the way: start with the south-west stone, make it red, then every other one red all the way round."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:90 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1875 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:198
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:219
msgid "Transformer"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:526 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1877
msgid "The curse is over! Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:534 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1887
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You have finally rid Winterkill of all the spirits. As a reward, I dub thee Ghostslayers Extraordinaire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:535 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1899
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've successfully driven out the Polter Fool spirits, but now the spirits of Ghost Riders have moved in. Perhaps you could drive them out as well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:536 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1907
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You've successfully driven out the Spirit Bones, but now the spirits of Polter Fools have moved in. Perhaps you could drive them out as well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:537 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1915
msgid ""
"You haven't driven the spirits from Winterkill yet. Keep trying. And bang the southern gong when you have: it's the only way I hear anything out here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:538 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1918
msgid ""
"The people of this fair city were driven out by a curse that brought the spirits of the dead back to life. The town is currently haunted by Spirit Bones. Perhaps you could drive them out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:533 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1928
msgid "Always a pleasure to see you, Ghostslayers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:93 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1936
msgid "The Count"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:546 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1938
msgid ""
"Draco is gone. The town breathes. Well, the town does. I never took it up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:547 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1941
msgid ""
"Draco? A boor. He sleeps in the square in a box with his name on it, and he bites the customers. If the dials were set right and his lid came off at night, I would not stand in your way. I would not stand anywhere near it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:548 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1945
msgid ""
"With Draco gone, someone must be the elder of this town's night. You'll do. Rise, Nosferatu."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:561 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1954
msgid ""
"His Scroll of Insight! He would say thank you. He would also say not to read it upside down, which is how he read it. The Northern Sphinx lies east of here, out in the dunes; he always meant to go in. He never had the nerve."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:562 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1963
msgid "Third floor. Mind the dogs. They are not dogs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:563 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1966
msgid ""
"The wizards of Castle Basenji killed my master and took his Scroll of Insight. They keep werewolves. Here is his note; he wrote everything down, including what he shouldn't have. The second floor's door wants 'There wolf'. Bring the scroll back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:96 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1974
msgid "My master"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:560 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1976
msgid ""
"The Sphinx lies east of here, out in the dunes. It asks its own name. Its name is Golux. Master always said it was cheating to know that, so of course he knew."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:611 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1986
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you so much for recovering my Scarab. Now I can complete my spell. Take this; I was keeping it for whoever was brave enough. And the healers and druids among you: kneel. You have earned more than a trinket. Druids rise as Great Druids, Clerics as Priests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:612 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:1999
msgid ""
"I see you haven't recovered my Scarab of Imaging yet. Remember that the gargoyles took it to their eyrie on the Gargoyle Range, north of here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:613 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2002
msgid ""
"The other day I was using my Scarab of Imaging for one of my spells when out of the sky swooped a flock of gargoyles. While I was busy fending off their attack, one of them snatched my Scarab and they all flew off toward the Gargoyle Range. I know not why they took it, only that gargoyles are hired to steal things for people. I need the Scarab back to complete my spell, and I will reward you if you can return it to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:98 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2009
msgid "Scarab"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:610 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2011
msgid ""
"The spell is finished. The gargoyles haven't been back. I like to think they heard what happened to the last ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:617 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2021
msgid ""
"Thank the Gods! You've recovered the crystals. You are truly great adventurers. As a reward, take this. A wizard's house is full of things a wizard has stopped using."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:618 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2031
msgid ""
"You haven't brought me my Crystals of Piezoelectricity. Perhaps they are in Asp."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:619 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2034
msgid ""
"This region is in a lot of danger. First, my sister Carlawna's Scarab of Imaging was stolen, and now my Crystals of Piezoelectricity have been taken. Last night I remembered a story told to me as a boy about a strange machine that produced reptile creatures. This machine could be powered by using Crystals of Piezoelectricity and a Scarab of Imaging. I never gave much validity to the story because a mad wizard told it to me, but now I can't help but think it's true. Get my Crystals back and there will be a reward."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:616 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2043
msgid ""
"Carlawna is my sister, by the way. She never tells anyone. I tell everyone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:624 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2053
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for getting me the elixir! Now I can be restored to my former self and return to my ocean home. As a reward, I blow my kiss to all of you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:625 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2063
msgid ""
"I'm waiting for you to bring me the elixir of restoration from the evil clerics."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:626 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2066
msgid ""
"I was once a beautiful mermaid. But one day a sorceress saw me swimming and became jealous of my beauty. She cast a spell that took away my beauty, but worst of all she took away my mermaid tail and gave me legs instead. I search to find an elixir of restoration so I can return to the way I once was. I've heard the clerics of the evil Temple of Yak, in the dark south end of the fairy woods below Rivercity, have one. If you could retrieve this elixir for me I would be eternally grateful. The temple's door is never locked. Its clerics want visitors; they do not let them leave."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:623 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2075
msgid "The sea's cold and the fish are rude. I've never been happier."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:628 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2085
msgid ""
"You have slain the monsters of the lake! Here, I insist you take this as a token of my appreciation. And my boat is yours whenever you want the island."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:629 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2095
msgid ""
"The beasts still live. I wish someone would kill them. Three of them, big as barns. I'd not go near them without a great deal of practice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:630 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2098
msgid ""
"The fish supply is low. I am sure some sort of lake beasts are eating all the fish. If you kill the beasts, I will be indebted to you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2105
msgid "Lake beasts"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:627 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2107
msgid ""
"My friends, I am always glad to see you. The fish are back, and so am I. My boat's at the jetty if you want the island."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:634 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2117
msgid ""
"Lava! Great! You can't imagine how much time you have saved me. Take this widget as payment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:635 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2127
msgid ""
"You don't have the lava! Why are you standing around wasting time when you could be out looking for lava?!?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:636 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2130
msgid ""
"I am Halon the Efficient. I have moved here from Rivercity to avoid the timewasters that place is full of. To help me keep track of time I have constructed a massive water clock, but the water freezes every winter. If I had some magical lava from Mount Firestone, I could melt the ice in the clock. Bring me some lava and I will reward you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:106 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2137
msgid "Water clock"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:633 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2139
msgid ""
"It is wonderful to see my clock work year round. But still, one can never have enough time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:638 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2149
msgid ""
"Thank you for killing the trolls, civilized ones. Your speedy job has saved us many lives and much discomfort. A cousin of mine on the dark side of the world, Leafpoint, will want to meet you. Take this. It grew in my roots for a century; we have no use for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:639 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2158
msgid ""
"The Trolls are not dead yet. It is most urgent that you kill them. If you could please have them all dead by the end of the decade, we may give you a greater reward for rushing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:640 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2161
msgid ""
"It is good to see some civilized people around here. Maybe you will kill the Trolls for us. They gnaw on our bark to sharpen their teeth in a most uncivilized fashion. Friends don't gnaw on friend's bark. We have talked about this for a couple of centuries, give or take a few decades, and have decided to hire some civilized people. Their warren is in the forest behind me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:419 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2168
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4841
msgid "Trolls"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:637 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2170
msgid "You are welcome to converse with us anytime, civilized ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:643 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2180
msgid ""
"We saw the Cyclops' outpost burning in the distance. You have our eternal thanks. Songs will be sung in your honor for generations to come. Here, take these treasures. We know it isn't much, but it is all we have to give."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:644 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2190
msgid ""
"Every day the casualties increase. Find the cyclops as soon as you can. We are dying."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:645 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2193
msgid ""
"Oh mighty heroes, your fame precedes you. Recently, a group of cyclops established an outpost near our lands, in the Land of the Giants to the south-west. They are cruel monsters that eat anyone they can catch. Please destroy them for us. We will give you what we can in return for your help."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:110 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2200
msgid "Cyclopes"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:642 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2202
msgid "Friends, you are always welcome here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:648 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2212
msgid ""
"You have returned my Wand of Faery Magic! Now peace can be restored to the forest. Please accept this gold as a reward. And any of you with elven blood in the dark: kneel. The wand remembers its own."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:649 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2223
msgid "The Sprites still possess my Wand. Try harder."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:650 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2226
msgid ""
"A terrible thing has happened. My Wand of Faery Magic has been stolen by the Sprites. Without the Wand in my possession, my powers of magic are reduced. Now that the Sprites possess my Wand they are crazed with power, attacking anyone in the forest. If you return my Wand I will reward you handsomely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:647 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2235
msgid ""
"The forest is quiet again. The sprites are merely rude now, which for sprites is peace."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:651 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2244
msgid "Elven blood in the dark, and the wand remembers it. Rise, Patriarch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:655 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2253
msgid ""
"You have recovered the Holy Book of Elvenkind! The entire Elf kingdom thanks you. Please accept this gold as a reward. And ask me about the Spirit: I can teach it to the rank of Master."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:656 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2263
msgid ""
"I see you haven't found the Holy Book of Elvenkind. Please keep looking."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:657 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2266
msgid ""
"While travelling through Troll forest recently, I was ambushed. In my haste to escape I dropped the Holy Book of Elvenkind. I can only hope that it has not been found, for if it happens to fall into the wrong hands it could lead to the extinction of my entire race. I will reward you well if you can return it to me. The Troll Forest is far to the south-west, in the snows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:115 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2273
msgid "Holy Book"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:654 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2275
msgid ""
"The Book is home. Whenever you are ready, I will teach you the Spirit as a Master knows it. I owe you that much."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:660 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2285
msgid ""
"My skull! Thank you! Already I can feel my tie to this world fading. Listen to the sound of the surf for your spell. (A book washes up at your feet: Recharge Item.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:661 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2297
msgid ""
"I see you don't have my skull yet. Well, that's ok. I've been here for a very long time. I don't mind another century or so. Don't worry about me. I'll just keep washing up on the shore here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:662 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2300
msgid ""
"I hate the surf. I have been trapped here since I died, crashing forward and pulling back, forward and back. I am sick of it. If you bring my skull and cast it into the surf here, I will be set free. I think my skull was pulled by the currents to the south and lies near the edge of the world. Retrieve my skull and I will teach you a spell before I go."
msgstr ""

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:117 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2307
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Advertencia"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:663 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2308
msgid ""
"You came! Up here a spirit hears things. Alamar is not his name. Read the plaques of this city before you go to his castle, and do not go without a way to hide what you carry from him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:665 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2316
msgid "The Whistle! Thank you. I'll activate the statues now. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:666 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2325
msgid ""
"No luck finding the whistle? Well, if you find it be sure to bring it back to me. I'm sure I dropped it somewhere in Pitchfork Creek."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:667 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2328
msgid ""
"A couple of years ago I built a statue on each of the two islands near here. The statues are supposed to teach spellcasters the cure poison and cure disease spells, but I lost the bone whistle needed to activate them. I think I dropped it somewhere in Pitchfork Creek. If you can find my whistle I will activate the statues."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:119 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2335
msgid "Whistle"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:664 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2337
msgid ""
"The statues are awake. Each holds a book for the first caster who comes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:675 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:676 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2347
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2361
msgid "Thanks for the ingredients. I'll make a batch right away."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:677 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2371
msgid "What, no Phirna root? I can't make you any potions without the root."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:678 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2374
msgid ""
"Toad meadow is the only known source of Phirna root, a vital ingredient in antidote potions. The witches of the meadow have been turning everyone they find into toads, so I don't dare go there. I will give you five potions for each Phirna root you bring me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:683 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2380
msgid ""
"You have rescued my Celia! I am so grateful to you for reuniting us. As payment for your services, please accept this treasure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:684 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2390
msgid "You have not rescued Celia from the zombies yet. Please hurry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:685 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2393
msgid ""
"I am searching for my intended bride, Celia. She was tending her family's sheep when zombies snatched her and disappeared into the Forest of the Walking Dead. The forest is so large and the zombies so many I'll need help to rescue her before they turn her into one of them. Help me, please."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:42 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:122 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2400
msgid "Celia"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:681 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2402
msgid ""
"No zombies down here. Gremlins, cobras, the odd hornet. Celia says it's an improvement."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:682 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2406
msgid "We are to be married. Somewhere with fewer zombies."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:123 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2414
msgid "Untie"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:686 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2415
msgid ""
"You cut the ropes. \"Derek sent you? Bless him. I'll find my own way to his camp, zombies or no zombies.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:124 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:287 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2423
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4281
msgid "The sword"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:687 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2424
msgid ""
"Derek found this on the road down. It's too good a sword for a man who mostly carries firewood, I told him, and the people who carried me out of a zombie wood should have it. Take it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:691 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2434
msgid ""
"Thank you for getting rid of the Ogres. Here is your reward. The upriver run opens tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:692 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2443
msgid ""
"The Ogres aren't gone yet. I think their base of operation is in the hills to the Northwest of here, up the north river."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:693 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2446
msgid ""
"Those Ogres are ruining me! For months they have been throwing boulders at the boats that ply the waters around here. Three of my ships have gone to the bottom in as many months because the Ogres like the sound of crunching wood and screaming men. I want those Ogres gone and I am willing to pay well for the service."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:126 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:176 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2453
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3220
msgid "Ogres"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:690 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2455
msgid ""
"Not a boulder in a month! The boats run upriver again, and my crews have stopped flinching at loud noises. Mostly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:699 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2464
msgid ""
"You bought one of Joe's treasure maps?!? Hahahahaha! Sorry. Here, let me give you a REAL treasure map. I'm too old to chase after treasure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:700 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2478
msgid ""
"You already have the only one of its kind. Two would be greedy, and it would make the first one less unique."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:701 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2482
msgid ""
"Friend, have I got a deal for you! Only 1000 gold for this secret treasure map, discovered during my travels on Darkside. Only one of its kind! (Behind him stands a crate of them.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:702 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2490
msgid ""
"Another one? Only one of its kind, friend, and still 1000 gold. Come back when your purse agrees."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:703 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2493
msgid ""
"Treasure maps! Genuine! Only one of its kind, 1000 gold. (Joe looks at your purse and loses interest.)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:129 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:251 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/town_portal_switch.txt:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2497 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4129 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:443
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:452 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:458 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:828
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:834 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:646 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x7.lua:225
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x7.lua:252
msgid "Vertigo"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:704 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2498
msgid ""
"Vertigo? Never heard of it. Different Joe. I'm in maps now. Maps don't breed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:130 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2504
msgid "Treasure map"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:705 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2506
msgid ""
"The map was interesting. The thing at the end of it was more interesting. You don't get to know what it was."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:706 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2510
msgid ""
"You dug it up yourselves? Then you have a hole and no map. I have neither. We're even."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:707 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2514
msgid ""
"A treasure map. Hmmm. Perhaps it leads to something interesting, perhaps not. I am willing to look, whereas you don't really have the time, do you? I'll give you 4,000 gold for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:708 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2520
msgid "I am Slibo. I collect maps, and the things at the end of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:714 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2525
msgid ""
"Dragon tax! 2,000 gold pieces and 20 gems fly from your packs and into the urn on the counter. Peering inside the urn, you see that your money has vanished. Scaldrith stamps a receipt. \"Proceed. Mind the dragons; they are exempt from manners.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:715 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2532
msgid ""
"Everyone who wants an audience with the Dragon King pays the dragon tax: two thousand gold and twenty gems. No gems, no audience. No exceptions. I was an exception once. Never again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:132 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2539
msgid "The tax"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:713 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2541
msgid ""
"Paid in full. Keep the receipt. The dragons inside don't ask for it, but they do eat people who argue."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:716 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2551
msgid ""
"A dragon who pays tax and reads. Rarer than gold. The last lesson costs the most, and you have paid it. Rise, Great Wyrm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:717 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2559
msgid ""
"Another dragon who reads? The office is becoming a library. Rise, Great Wyrm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:718 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2563
msgid ""
"Great Wyrms are made of dragons, and you have none with you. Paperwork does not stretch that far."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:747 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2571
msgid ""
"You have saved Castleview from the wicked Gremlins! Oh, frabjous day! Here is your gold, and a pass, so the gate stops arguing with you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:748 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2581
msgid "The Gremlins' reign of terror persists. No gold for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:749 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2584
msgid ""
"I am the mouthpiece of Castleview. The treasury will pay well for ending the Gremlins' mischief in town. Their king, Gettlewaithe, holds court in a burrow under our wall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:135 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:294 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:317
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2592 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4333 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4425
msgid "Gremlins"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:746 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2594
msgid "Castleview likes you! Visit anytime!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:136 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2602
msgid "Gettlewaithe's gift"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:750 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2603
msgid ""
"This came from the burrow this morning, with a note: 'For the delegation. Sir.' Three Energy Disks. I believe that is a gremlin apology. Take them before they explode."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:137 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:184 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2613
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3302
msgid "We come in peace"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:751 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:754 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:758
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2615 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2628 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2645
msgid "I am always at your service, sir."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:752 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2619
msgid "Yes, yes, you live. What else?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:753 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2622
msgid ""
"Excellent. Your display of respect has earned you your lives. What have you come to petition me for?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:138 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2626
msgid "The Mayor's demand"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:755 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2632
msgid "I am not interested in hearing from the butts of our jokes. Begone!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:756 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2636
msgid ""
"Well, um, perhaps I can do something about those naughty, naughty pranksters. We can still talk about this like rational beings, can't we?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:757 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2639
msgid ""
"The answer is no! You will now suffer the consequences of your audacity. Guards!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:139 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2643
msgid "Submit or die"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:759 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2649
msgid ""
"Yes, sir. I will do as you ask without delay. The sewers, the bridges, the mill. All of it. Sir."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:760 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2656
msgid "I see. Guards! Remove this rabble from my court!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:761 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2660
msgid "(yawn) Off with their heads."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:771 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2666
msgid ""
"Thank you for freeing my brother! Here's a little money for your trouble. If you ever want to know anything about maps, just come to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:772 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2674
msgid ""
"My brother still languishes in the town jail. I hope it's not too much to ask for you to hurry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:773 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2677
msgid ""
"I'm Jethro, brother of Jasper. Jasper is in Castleview jail, falsely accused of stealing a treasure map from Joe, the treasure map salesman. Joe is a crook, but I can't prove it. Maybe you could break Jasper out. I'm not strong enough to do it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:770 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2687
msgid ""
"Good to see you again, friends! Remember, if you ever want to know anything about maps, just come to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:774 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2697
msgid "Jasper's gone. Less paperwork. I'm not asking how."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:775 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2701
msgid ""
"Let me see that. A map of nowhere, in Joe's hand, signed 'genuine'. For a thousand gold? Jasper didn't steal this, nobody would. He's free to go. Don't tell Joe I can read."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:776 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2706
msgid ""
"Jasper stole a map from Joe. Joe says so, and Joe is very convincing. Bring me proof otherwise, or bring me a nap."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:777 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2711
msgid "Thanks for freeing me! I knew Jethro would find help."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:778 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2714
msgid ""
"Joe sold the fake maps. I drew the real ones. Guess which of us is in jail. The back window's bars are older than the warden."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:783 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2718
msgid ""
"Ah, listeners! Allow me to enlighten you: No word, no bond, row on. Now do I repay a period won. Go, now, and visit Sister Hannah for more enlightenment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:145 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:146 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:147
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:148 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2727 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2737
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2750 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2763
msgid "Lesson"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:782 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2729
msgid "Learned you have. Hannah Sister to go, now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:784 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2739
msgid "Learned you have. Bob Brother to go, now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:785 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2743
msgid ""
"Ah, listeners! Allow me to enlighten you: Oh who was it I saw, oh who? He lived as a devil, eh? Go, now, and visit Brother Bob for more enlightenment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:786 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:789 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:792
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2747 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2760 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2778
msgid "Order wrong the. Otto first, Brother. Lesson one."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:787 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2752
msgid "Learned you have. Ada Sister to go, now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:788 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2756
msgid ""
"Ah, listeners! Allow me to enlighten you: Eva, can I stab bats in a cave? Was it a rat I saw? Go, now, and visit Sister Ada for more enlightenment."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:790 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2765
msgid "Drawkcab a are you. Reger Brother see. The word say: palindrome."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:791 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2769
msgid ""
"Ah, listeners! Live on time; emit no evil. Lepers repel. Congratulations! I dub thee a member of the Drawkcab! We study the palindrome, the word that reads the same both ways. Brother Reger, outside the walls, will ask you for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:794 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2783
msgid ""
"Correct. You are truly a Drawkcab! Those of you who walk the inner way walk it now as Masters. Backwards, naturally."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:795 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2791
msgid ""
"Correct. A Drawkcab truly are you. Masters, though, ready not yet are you. Return when the Queen's castle stands higher."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:796 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2795
msgid ""
"There is a word for what the monks of Castleview study. Say it at my door, not in my ear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:797 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:798 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10533
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2798
msgid ""
"Wrong. Go visit the monks of Castleview for enlightenment and return to me when you feel you are ready."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:150 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2804
msgid "The word"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:793 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2806
msgid "Pleased to see you, fellow Drawkcabs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:804 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2816
msgid ""
"Every lid down, in order. Quite an accomplishment. Here: a few things people stored and never came back for."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:805 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2826
msgid "Half the chests. Half an accomplishment. I don't pay in halves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:806 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2829
msgid ""
"Public Storage: put things in, take things out, in the right order. Close every chest. The numbers count themselves, one to nine. The letters spell something you'd find in a barn: PITCHFORK."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:152 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2837
msgid "The chests"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:803 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2839
msgid ""
"To close all of the chests is quite an accomplishment, but to open them requires intellect most uncommon. Don't try. I just got them shut."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:812 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2849
msgid ""
"You've killed the Queen Rat! Here is your reward: my chest. Go on, open it. It's yours. Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:813 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2854
msgid ""
"The Queen Rat is still alive. I can hear her awful chittering through the walls. No reward for you yet!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:814 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2857
msgid ""
"Hi. I live down here. There sure are a lot of rats. Too many for me to kill. Maybe you could kill the Queen Rat for me. I'll give you something if you do."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:154 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2865
msgid "Rats"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:811 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2867
msgid "It's good to see you again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:821 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2877
msgid ""
"Thank you for your help in the battle against the heretics. Ours is the true religion, and Mok has sided with the righteous. Those of you who serve the light, Mok raises up; the rest of you get gold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:822 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2888
msgid ""
"My door is open, but the Cult Leader still preaches on the top floor. Mok does not share a tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:823 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2892
msgid ""
"You went up their rope? Good. The key to my door is on the top floor, by their altar. Bring it down and let me in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:824 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2896
msgid ""
"Your failure to breach the tower is not your fault; it is a test of my determination to cleanse the faith of heresy. I implore you to continue your efforts on my behalf."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:825 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2899
msgid ""
"Oh, wretched fortune! I, Dreyfus, high priest of Mok, have been cast from my tower by heretics in the priesthood! They warded the door against me, but they still haul their bread up a rope on the north wall. Perhaps you could climb in from the top and open the tower to me again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:156 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2907
msgid "Heretics"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:820 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2909
msgid "It is always pleasing to be honored with your presence, my friends."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:157 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2917
msgid "The clerics"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:826 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2918
msgid ""
"Humble and Pious came to me and begged forgiveness. I gave them the latrines. Mok is merciful; I am thorough."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:848 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2926
msgid ""
"Five ruby rocks and two gems. Give me an hour. There. Ruby. Mind the edge."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:849 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2937
msgid "The rocks are fine. The fee is two gems, and you have the rocks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:850 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2940
msgid ""
"With 5 Ruby rocks I will make a weapon or piece of armor for you. The cost is 2 gems. The rocks are in the Gemstone Mines; I'm sorry, but you don't have enough Ruby rocks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:851 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2947
msgid ""
"Five emerald rocks and four gems. Emerald steel never dulls. Neither does my invoice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:852 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2958
msgid "Rocks, yes. Gems, no. Four gems."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:853 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2961
msgid ""
"With 5 Emerald rocks I will make a weapon or piece of armor for you. The cost is 4 gems. I'm sorry, but you don't have enough Emerald rocks. Come back when you do!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:854 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2968
msgid ""
"Five sapphire rocks, six gems. Sapphire keeps you cool under fire. Literally. Don't test it on me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:855 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2979
msgid "Six gems. Then we talk sapphire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:856 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2982
msgid ""
"With 5 Sapphire rocks I will make a weapon or piece of armor for you. The cost is 6 gems. I'm sorry, but you don't have enough Sapphire rocks. Come back when you do!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:857 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:2989
msgid "Five diamonds, ten gems. Diamonds are forever. So was the wait. Here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:858 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3000
msgid "Ten gems. Diamonds don't cut themselves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:859 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3003
msgid ""
"With 5 diamonds I can make a weapon or piece of armor for you. The cost is 10 gems. I'm sorry, but you don't have enough diamonds. Come back when you do!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:865 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3010
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you! You've found the emerald handle. Here's something for your trouble: the staff. I fixed it, cast one spell to prove I still could, and retired. Take it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:866 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3019
msgid ""
"You haven't found my staff's emerald handle yet. Keep searching. I can reward you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:867 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3022
msgid ""
"I seem to have lost the emerald handle that fits on the end of my magical staff. It must have come off on my journey back from visiting Sandcaster. Find it, and I'll make it worth your while."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:163 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3030
msgid "Emerald handle"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:864 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3032
msgid "Retirement suits me. I sit, I read, I do not look for handles."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:870 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3042
msgid ""
"Hi! Glad to see you again. I saved the seeds from the Monga Melons you gave me, and now I'm growing my own! (He eats yours anyway.) (sigh) I love Monga Melons."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:871 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3047
msgid ""
"Hi! Glad to see you again. I'm growing my own melons now. (sigh) I love Monga Melons."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:872 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3051
msgid ""
"Well, it's about time! I practically starved to death waiting for you to return with my Monga Melons. Yum. Here's what I promised you: something shiny I found in the Temple of Bark, in the heart of the forest. Nobody locks it. Nobody comes back out, either."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:873 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3062
msgid ""
"You didn't bring me enough Monga Melons. I'm practically starving to death. Of all the rotten things to do to a poor monkeydog. Three!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:874 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3065
msgid ""
"There is nothing in this world that I love more than Monga Melons. The sweetest grow in the southern meadowlands, home of the most vicious centipedes. Bring me three, and I'll give you something shiny."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:879 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3072
msgid ""
"Thank you! It is good to see her back. Here is your reward. And those of you who hunt: the forest has taught you all it can. Walk it now as its lords."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:880 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3081
msgid ""
"Thank you! It is good to see her back. Here is your reward: two Energy Disks and a LOT of gold, as agreed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:881 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3089
msgid ""
"You have not rescued her yet. Keep trying. We think she was taken by the Orcs into the Temple of Bark."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:882 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3092
msgid ""
"I am Sharla, First of the Sprites. We have a problem. The Orcs have kidnapped one of our sisters. Can you help her?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:166 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3100
msgid "Sheewana"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:877 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3102
msgid ""
"You came into our forest with your hands on your purses and ours. We pay nothing to robbers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:878 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3106
msgid ""
"We are always pleased to see heroes such as yourselves. You are welcome in our forest."
msgstr ""

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:167 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3114
msgid "Certainly"
msgstr "Desde luego."

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:883 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3115
msgid "Thank you so much! Go to the Temple of Bark and free her!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:168 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3122
msgid "What's in it for us?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:884 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3123
msgid ""
"We have two Energy Disks and some gold to give you after you rescue her. A LOT of gold? Very well. A lot. Go to the Temple of Bark and free her!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:169 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3130
msgid "This is a stick up!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:885 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3131
msgid "Sisters, we are under attack! Stop them!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:170 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3138
msgid "Home"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:886 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3140
msgid "Take me home. Oh, you did. How proper."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:887 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3144
msgid ""
"Thank you for freeing me. I will return now to my sisters and tell them of your heroic deed!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:888 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3152
msgid ""
"You came for me? Oh, how proper. The cage is locked, and Shaalth keeps the key on his belt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:889 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3157
msgid "Orcs can't jump. Remember that, and their ledges are yours."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:890 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3160
msgid ""
"Thank you for rescuing me from these foul orcs. Remember, Orcs can't jump."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:891 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3168
msgid ""
"The sun! Somewhere up there. I'm going to go and look at it for a week."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:892 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3171
msgid "Thank you for saving me. I haven't seen the sun in days!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:893 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3179
msgid "Snog not do evil. Snog not go back in cell either."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:894 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3182
msgid ""
"The rest of the Orcs imprisoned me for refusing to do evil. Thanks for getting me out of there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:895 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3190
msgid "Don't drink the Shaman's tea. I mean it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:896 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3193
msgid "The Orc Shaman tells lies, and his tea is poisonous. Watch yourself."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:918 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3201
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for getting rid of the Ogres! My caravans can now get through the pass safely. Here, take this gold as a reward."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:919 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3209
msgid "There are still Ogres attacking my caravans. Please do something!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:920 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3212
msgid ""
"These blasted Ogres are killing my business. Every time I try to get a caravan through Ogre Pass they attack it, stealing everything. Get rid of them for me. There is a reward, and a bounty if both their forts burn."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:917 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3222
msgid "The caravans run through Ogre Pass on time. Nearly on time. On a day."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:921 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3231
msgid ""
"Two forts, burned to the ground. The bounty, as promised. And those of you who hunt for pay: the caravan guild has a title for hunters like you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:178 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3242
msgid "Gifts"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:922 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3244
msgid ""
"We accept gift and won't pull your arms out of sockets today. What do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:923 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3250
msgid "Gift is gold. You have no gold. Why you talk?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:179 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3256
msgid "Pharaoh's oath"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:924 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3257
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh is chief of nothing, now. Alamar is chief. We work for Alamar. We pull your arms out of socket now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:180 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3264
msgid "Bow low, slave!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:925 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3265
msgid "Har Har Har! We LIKE! You make big laugh! You friends. What you need?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:181 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:186 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3273
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3324
msgid "Energy disks"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:926 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3275
msgid "We have no more energy disks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:927 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3278
msgid ""
"We are Ogres! We take what we want. Yesterday, we took the Sardaj's Energy disks! (grunt) Here are two energy disks. Caravans? Fine. We let caravans pass. Boring, but fine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:182 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:255 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3288
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4145
msgid "Orcs"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:928 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3289
msgid ""
"The Orcs captured a sprite a little while ago... Har! (snort) Har! They sacrifice them to their God sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:929 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3296
msgid ""
"We didn't know you fight against Alamar. He pay us much gold to be on his side. Because we like you, we pretend you didn't say that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:937 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3303
msgid ""
"I am Yog, chief of the Sardaj tribe. You do not come for battle? Then you are welcome among us."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:185 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3314
msgid "Battle!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:938 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3315
msgid "Then you shall not leave these lands alive!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:939 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3325
msgid ""
"We would gladly give energy disks to you if we had them, but the Ogres stole the only ones we owned."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:187 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3331
msgid "Help against Alamar"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:940 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3333
msgid ""
"You are welcome among us, friend. The giants of the desert are our friends too. Tell Gurodel that Yog sent you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:941 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3336
msgid ""
"We will fill your packs with food so that your journey will be without hunger."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:188 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3344
msgid "Give gold"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:944 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3346
msgid ""
"Hobstadt wants all. You give two thousand. Hobstadt cannot count past two thousand. Good. Go where you like."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:945 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3351
msgid "That is not all. That is not anything. Give gold, give one, or fight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:189 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3357
msgid "Sacrifice one"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:946 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3359
msgid ""
"Another troll? Hobstadt take him too. One night. (Morning.) War Troll. Hobstadt has two friends now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:947 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3364
msgid "Hobstadt has his War Troll. Go where you like."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:948 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3368
msgid ""
"Troll in your party. Hobstadt take him. One night. (Morning. Your troll comes back taller, with new scars and no regrets.) Now he is War Troll. You are friends of Hobstadt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:949 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3374
msgid ""
"No troll. Hobstadt not eat your kind. Too many bones. You paid. Go where you like."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:950 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3377
msgid ""
"No troll. Hobstadt not eat your kind. Too many bones. Give gold, or fight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:190 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3383
msgid "Fight to the death"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:951 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3384
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:191 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3391
msgid "Thieves' gold"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:952 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3392
msgid "Thief gold in back. Hobstadt not like thieves. Take."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:966 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3400
msgid ""
"Thank you. You have done both me and Sandcaster a great service. The quarter is open again. And those of you who walked their halls unseen: the guilds have a word for people like you. Spies. Good ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:967 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3409
msgid ""
"One of them is gone. The other is still on a guild throne, and twice as careful. Finish it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:968 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3413
msgid ""
"Every day that Sandcaster suffers under the rule of these evil masters is a day ill spent. Everyone is relying on you to put matters right."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:969 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3416
msgid ""
"Two years ago, Xenoc the Wizard and Morgana the Sorceress came to town with visions of conquest. They ruined my good name and made themselves heads of the guilds. Now I am dethroned, and the guilds are wicked. Will you help right the wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:193 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3423
msgid "Xenoc and Morgana"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:965 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3425
msgid "I am pleased to see you! Sandcaster will not forget your great deeds!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:194 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3433
msgid "We will help"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:970 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3434
msgid ""
"Good. I fear that it will be impossible to talk them from their lofty positions, so you will have to defeat them in battle. They hold the quarter behind the guild gate. Good luck."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:195 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3442
msgid "Not our affair"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:971 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3443
msgid ""
"I see. I had thought better of you. Perhaps you will change your minds after you talk to some of the townspeople and learn firsthand the evil these arrogant magicians have wrought."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:196 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3450
msgid "The lesson"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:972 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3451
msgid ""
"\"I think we're ready for that lesson right now.\" Blastem smiles. It is not a nice smile."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:197 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3458
msgid "Boots licked"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:973 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3459
msgid ""
"It's always a pleasure to be able to converse with other beings as intelligent as I. Xenoc keeps his door where nobody looks for it. Wizards like that never stop admiring themselves: try his mirror."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:981 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3467
msgid ""
"How wonderful! You have located my magnifying glass. Can't thank you enough. Take this gold, and this: I made it, and now I can finally see what it is."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:982 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3477
msgid ""
"I see you didn't find my magnifying glass. You know, I did see a couple of gargoyles loitering around my tent the other day. Maybe they stole it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:983 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3480
msgid ""
"Well, this is just great! How am I supposed to get any work done? My magnifying glass is missing and I can't see what I'm working on without it. Do you think you could find it for me? Gargoyles were loitering around the tent. Gargoyles like shiny things."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:199 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3488
msgid "Magnifying glass"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:980 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3490
msgid "Always nice to see you! Come and look at this. No? It's very small."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:200 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3498
msgid "The People"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:989 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3500
msgid ""
"You struck one of the People in our own hall, little ones. We recognize you as enemies."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:990 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3504
msgid ""
"The People remember their friends, little ones. Walk our hills as you like; mind where you step."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:991 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3507
msgid ""
"We are the People. We were here before Alamar, and we will be here after him. He wants to drive this world away from its sun, like a cart from a stable, and ride it home. The People do not want to be driven. What do you want of the People, little ones?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:201 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3510
msgid "Friendship"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:992 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3511
msgid ""
"Friendship. Good. That is a small word for small people, and a large one for us. Take these, little ones. Alamar's people dropped them in our hills, and they hum when we sleep."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:202 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3522
msgid "Your hall"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:993 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3523
msgid ""
"My hall? Then come and take it, little ones, if you can. The People will be waiting on the stair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1004 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3532
msgid ""
"You gave it back to those mumbling knights? I'll die of thirst before I die of poison. Get out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1005 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3536
msgid ""
"Oh, thank the Gods! You have the Chalice. For saving my life, I dub thee royal taste testers and give you this treasure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1006 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3551
msgid ""
"Please get the Chalice. I live in fear for my life. And remember: when the voice asks what you seek, answer the knights' way. No vowels. C, H, L, C."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1007 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3554
msgid ""
"Recently, my tribal seer told me I will die by drinking a poisoned drink. The royal Chalice of Protection neutralises any poison placed in it. The knights of the Northern Tower have it, and my efforts to steal it have been in vain. Their door stands open; nobody gets past their voice. They leave the vowels out of everything they say; when their voice asks what you seek, answer it their way: Chlc. Bring me the Chalice and I will reward you well."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1003 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3565
msgid ""
"I drink from it every morning. Water, mostly. I'm still alive, so it works."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:205 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3573
msgid "The Voweless Knights' answers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1008 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3575
msgid ""
"You have the copy already. Read it slowly; they did not write it slowly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1009 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3579
msgid ""
"Five hundred gold. Their seven sayings, bound, with the vowels put back in the margin, and the answer their voice wants. Mind the binding."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1010 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3585
msgid ""
"Five hundred gold, and not a copper less. Knowledge is free. Binding is not."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1045 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3590
msgid ""
"You've found the Jewel of Ages! Let me dip it in the fountain. See: the waters remember it. Keep the jewel; the fountain only needed to see it once. Drink here whenever you feel the effects of unnatural aging."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1046 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3597
msgid ""
"Sold to the mages of the Eastern Tower, east of here by the rim. Mages don't steal. They acquire, and then they study. Go and interrupt them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1047 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3603
msgid ""
"Without the Jewel of Ages, I cannot restore the fountain. See if you can find a clue to its whereabouts in the Great Southern Tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1048 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3606
msgid ""
"A terrible thing has happened. The Jewel of Ages has been stolen from its place in the fountain. Now the once youth-giving waters have turned back to venom. If you recover the jewel, I'll be able to restore the fountain."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:210 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:207 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3613
msgid "Jewel of Ages"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1044 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3615
msgid ""
"You can now come and drink here whenever you feel the effects of unnatural aging. The jewel keeps you; the water keeps everyone else."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:208 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:349 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3623
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4553
msgid "Hornets"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1049 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3625
msgid ""
"Stung in the Aging Forest? Those hornets don't take blood, they take years. Drink from the fountain and have them back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1050 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3628
msgid ""
"Stay out from under the great oak. Its hornets don't take blood, they take years. My fountain used to give them back. Now it is venom, like everything else round here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1051 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3632
msgid ""
"Ellinger's seal. 'To the Guildmaster of Sandcaster: the bearer has earned the robes of an Archmage.' Ellinger never wrote that about anyone. Those of you in a Wizard's robe, take these instead. The rest of you may hold the letter."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1063 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3643
msgid ""
"Sold to the mages of the Eastern Tower? Then that is where my jewel is. And where Luna's statuettes went, she should hear. Thank you. Take this for the trouble."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1064 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3651
msgid ""
"The Great Southern Tower is in Sprite Forest, rumored to be a hideout for thieves. Thieves write things down. Look for that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1065 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3654
msgid ""
"A thief bragged of it in his haste to escape: the Great Southern Tower, in the woods south of Ogre Pass. It is the only help I can offer. Whoever took the Jewel of Ages went there first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/map_stats.txt:59 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:211 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3661
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d2.lua:349
msgid "Southern Tower"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1062 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3663
msgid ""
"Thieves who keep accounts. The world is full of surprises, most of them bad."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1066 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3673
msgid ""
"You got past the gongs, the chest and my accountants. Rogues and marksmen that good are wasted on heroics. Join the inner circle. No paperwork. Well, a ledger."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1067 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3678
msgid ""
"Nobody in your party has the hands for my trade. Take what you came for and go. Quietly. Thieves appreciate quiet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1081 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3686
msgid ""
"The Pegasus! You are truly great adventurers to have found this statuette. It goes back on the altar, and this is for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1082 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3695
msgid ""
"The Dragon! You are truly great adventurers to have found this statuette. It goes back on the altar, and this is for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1083 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3704
msgid ""
"The Griffin! You are truly great adventurers to have found this statuette. It goes back on the altar, and this is for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1084 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3713
msgid ""
"You have found all of my statuettes! Now I can restore the altar's magical aura and regain my powers of healing. For you, great adventurers, shall share my powers. Those of you who fight with bow and spell alike, rise as Master Archers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1085 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3719
msgid ""
"I see you haven't found all of the statuettes yet. The thieves sold them, I am sure of it. Thieves write down who buys."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1086 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3722
msgid ""
"Somehow the three golden statuettes that give my altar its magical aura have been stolen. Without it, I have no powers of healing. Start with the thieves of the Great Southern Tower; the keeper of the fountain near Venom Pond has a key."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:214 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3730
msgid "Statuettes"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1080 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3732
msgid "I'm pleased to see you again, friends. Please come by more often!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1089 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3742
msgid ""
"That's it. I took it off to split wood and the mountain kept it. You know, it never did fit me after I got it back the last time. Keep it. And take this for the climb."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1090 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3750
msgid ""
"The woodpile on Magic Mountain, by the wizards' camp. Third log, if I remember right. I never remember right."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1091 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3753
msgid ""
"I took my ring off to split wood up on Magic Mountain, and now it's somewhere in the woodpile. Fetch it and I'll make it worth the walk."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:216 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3760
msgid "The ring"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1088 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3762
msgid "Wear it in good health. It makes sure you have plenty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1096 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3772
msgid ""
"The stocks fell open when the Head Witch died, and the others are out. Lakeside is ours again. The tavern was never destroyed, by the way. They only painted it gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1097 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3782
msgid ""
"The Head Witch is dead and my stocks fell open. I'm staying until the others are out of the cells. Someone has to count them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1098 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3786
msgid ""
"Four more of us are in the cells below the Guild, and the Head Witch above them. The Guild's door asks 'What am I?' The answer is witch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1099 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3789
msgid ""
"They put me in the stocks for failing the initiation test. The test is the riddle at the Guild's door, 'What am I?', and the answer is witch. I said 'broom'. Four more of us are in the cells below. The good ones go to Castle Blackfang as guards; the rejects go to the Isle. Get them out, and break the coven."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:218 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:351 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3797
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4561
msgid "The coven"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1095 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3799
msgid ""
"Lakeside has its tavern back and I have my feet back. I keep checking on both."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:219 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3807
msgid "Necropolis pass"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1100 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3808
msgid ""
"Because they did this to me, I'll tell you where the Head Witch keeps her pass to Necropolis. It is in a chest in her room, in the north-west corner of the coven."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1123 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3817
msgid ""
"Sandro is at rest, and he left the House his notes: everything but the heart. A Priest, a Wizard or a Necromancer who wants to walk where he walked: sit. This takes an evening."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1124 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3822
msgid ""
"Sandro is at rest. The House has his notes, if one of yours ever wants them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1125 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3825
msgid ""
"Sandro was the finest of us. He cut out his own heart to cheat death, and now he cannot stop killing to stay as he is. He lives in the sewer under us. A Priest, a Wizard or a Necromancer who asked him nicely, before the end, might learn how it was done. I have never been that nice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:221 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3828
msgid "Tribbles"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1189 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3830
msgid ""
"How would you like one of these little furry creatures? They make great companions and they are only 25,000 gold. What do you say?"
msgstr ""

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1190 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1192 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3834
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3844
msgid "Maybe some other time."
msgstr "Quizá en otra ocasión."

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1191 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3838
msgid ""
"Cyrano counts the gold twice and hands you a small furry creature. It purrs. \"A wonderful choice. They practically look after themselves.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:222 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3847
msgid "Companions"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1193 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3848
msgid ""
"You know TRIBBLES are great companions but you'll be surprised what doors they can open for you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1212 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3856
msgid ""
"You are truly courageous! Thank you soooo much. Now I'll just drink this egg potion and..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1213 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3864
msgid ""
"Well, I can see you weren't brave enough to steal an egg, either. Well, don't worry, perhaps some adventurers with some REAL courage will come along soon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1214 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3867
msgid ""
"Ah, brave adventurers, perhaps you can help me. I need a dragon egg to mix into one of my potions, but I'm not brave enough to go further into the tower to steal one. If you bring me one I will reward you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1287 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3872
msgid ""
"Falista says to tell you: \"I, Falista, grant all great adventurers the title of Crusader.\" Kneel, then. Knights rise as Cavaliers, Paladins as Crusaders, Rangers as Hunters."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1288 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3880
msgid ""
"Another spellcaster without a proper title? Stand there. Sorcerers rise as Wizards, Archers as Warrior Mages. Mind the fountain on your way out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1289 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3888
msgid ""
"Another one who heals and hasn't been ordained? Kneel. Druids rise as Great Druids, Clerics as Priests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1290 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3896
msgid ""
"Carlawna sent word that you helped her. Leaves fall so the tree can grow. Druids rise as Great Druids, Clerics as Priests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1291 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3904
msgid ""
"Another thief in your company? How useful. Rise, Rogue. Don't touch anything on the way out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1292 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3913
msgid ""
"Another knight in your company. Kneel. ... Rise, Champion of the Darkside. That's the whole ceremony; we lost the trumpets."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1293 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3918
msgid ""
"The cells are quiet. The guard can sleep in the guardroom again, instead of on the stairs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1294 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3922
msgid ""
"Quiet down there. Truly quiet. Those of you who ride and fight as knights: kneel. ... Rise, Champions of the Darkside. The rest of you: the Queen's thanks, and mine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1295 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3930
msgid ""
"The liches are still down there. You can hear them filing their nails. On the bars."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1296 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3933
msgid ""
"When the dungeon came back, so did the liches we locked up in it. We could cage them, never kill them. You could. Clear the cells, and I have a title for the knights among you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1300 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3942
msgid "Another one who walks quietly? Good. The clan has room."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1301 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3947
msgid ""
"The old monk sweeps upstairs. We let him. A clan that hides under a temple is never found."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1302 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3951
msgid ""
"You killed my father. He would say that was the point of him. The clan follows strength, and you are strong. Kneel, Initiates, and rise in the shadows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1303 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3959
msgid ""
"Strong, yes. Ready, no. Come back when Queen Kalindra's walls are rising, and I will teach you what my father knew."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1304 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3963
msgid "My father's killers. Sit, if you like. Nobody here will try it twice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1305 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3970
msgid ""
"Another servant of the light who has not knelt to Mok? Kneel. Crusaders rise as Heroes, Priests as Priests of Light. Mind the candles."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1306 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3978
msgid ""
"Another hunter the forest has not met? It has now. Walk it as its lord."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1307 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3986
msgid ""
"The altar still hums. Bow and spell together? Stand in its light. Rise, Master Archer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1308 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:3994
msgid ""
"The guilds still talk about you. This one walks unseen too? Then the word is Spy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1309 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4002
msgid ""
"Ellinger's letter is in my files, and it says 'the bearer'. Close enough. Wizards, take the robes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1310 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4010
msgid ""
"A hunter who works for pay? The caravan guild's title is yours too. Bounty Hunter. It comes with a form."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1311 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4018
msgid ""
"Another walker of the inner way? Master you are now. Backwards, naturally."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1312 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4026
msgid ""
"More hands for my trade? The ledger has room. Inner circle. Don't touch the chest on your way out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1313 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4035
msgid ""
"Another druid who listens to trees. Stand in my shade a while. There. Arch Druid."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1314 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4040
msgid ""
"The wind says Thickbark has grown a new ring. He is unbearable about it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1315 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4044
msgid ""
"My cousin Thickbark says you are civilized. He is a poor judge of most things, but not of that. Druids, stand in my shade. A tree's patience is the last lesson, and you have just learned it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1316 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4052
msgid ""
"Civilized ones! Thickbark wrote, which for a tree means a century of rustling. If a druid among you ever wants the last lesson, come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1317 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4055
msgid "A tree does not talk to strangers who might be carrying axes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1338 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4060
msgid ""
"Tam! He walked in the door an hour ago and asked what's for supper, as if nothing happened. Here. It's what I put by for his wedding, and he can earn another."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1339 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4070
msgid "The caves are in the north-east hills. Follow the drums."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1340 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4073
msgid ""
"The orcs took my boy Tam to their caves in the hills, north-east of town. You can hear their drums at night. I'm a farmer. I can't fight orcs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/place_mon.txt:17 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:41 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:241
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4080
msgid "Tam"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1337 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4082
msgid "Tam eats like an orc now. I'm not complaining. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:242 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4090
msgid "Drums"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1341 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4091
msgid ""
"The drums have stopped. Nights are quiet again, and the cows have started giving milk."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:243 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4097
msgid "Slimes"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1467 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4098
msgid ""
"Slime eats iron. I sell a lot of swords in this town, and most of them come back as soup."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:31 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:244 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4101
msgid "Dudley"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1468 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4102
msgid ""
"Dudley? He's been drinking since the plague started. Before that he drank because it hadn't."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:245 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4105
msgid "Joe's account"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1469 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4106
msgid ""
"Joe the Exterminator banks with us. Every month the town pays him, and every month he deposits it. I say nothing. I'm a banker."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:246 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:405 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4109
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4777
msgid "The name"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1470 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4110
msgid ""
"The founders named it for the slime they cleared from the spring. Then the slime came back. We kept the name; it saves on signs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1471 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4114
msgid ""
"Tenth level is as far as I go. After that you want Rivercity, and a thicker skin."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:248 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/town_portal_switch.txt:5 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4117
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x1.lua:455 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:414 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:416
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:649 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:658 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:667
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:679 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:685 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:597
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:852 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:861 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:870
msgid "Rivercity"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1472 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4118
msgid ""
"Rivercity is west along the river road. Bigger town, bigger thieves. The coach goes Monday, Wednesday and Friday."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/house_data.txt:169 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:6 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:249
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:252 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4121 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4133
msgid "Gunther"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1473 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4122
msgid ""
"Gunther paid Joe a fortune. He says it was a bargain. He also says the slimes are smaller this year."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:250 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4125
msgid "Money tree"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1474 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4126
msgid ""
"Some fool said money's now growing on trees. Ha! I've watched that tree for a month. Leaves. Leaves and a pigeon."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:26 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1475 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4130
msgid ""
"This place is deserted. You should go to Rivercity--Now there's a town full of action!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:27 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1476 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4134
msgid ""
"That Gunther, what a dunce! He paid that con man Joe a fortune to clean up this town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:253 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4137
msgid "Dues"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1477 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4138
msgid ""
"The roll's open to anyone since the slimes came. No dues. Off to the guild row."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1478 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4142
msgid ""
"The world is flat and it ends. East of the orchard road the meadow stops and the stars begin. I put that on every map, and people still walk off it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1479 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4146
msgid ""
"The orcs have three lookout posts on the hill road. They watch the sheep, then they take the sheep. Burn the posts and they'll have to watch something else."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:256 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4149
msgid "Toads"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1480 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4150
msgid ""
"Some of the toads were people. You can tell by the way they look at you. Don't step on any."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:257 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4153
msgid "The plague"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1481 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4154
msgid ""
"The plague is a judgement. The slimes are its messengers. Joe is... also involved."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:258 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4157
msgid "Slime lords"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1482 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4158
msgid "Slime lords shall rule. Probably. We are waiting for a sign."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:259 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4161
msgid "Prices"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1487 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4162
msgid ""
"Paid up front, because in Rivercity the customer is gone by morning, and so is the sword."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:260 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4165
msgid "Robbers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1488 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4166
msgid ""
"The robbers under the bridge have never robbed this bank. We pay them not to. It's called insurance."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1489 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4170
msgid ""
"Water's two coppers since the fountain dried up. I didn't plug it. I just noticed it was plugged."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1490 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4174
msgid ""
"Twenty-fifth level, no further. After that you want the King's own hall at Castle Burlock, and a title to get in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1491 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4178
msgid ""
"Pray, pay, and be healed today. Pray without paying and we'll see about tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:264 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4181
msgid "Coaches"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1492 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4182
msgid ""
"East to Vertigo on the river road. North to the King when the savannah road's clear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:68 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:265 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4185
msgid "Gossip"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1493 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4186
msgid ""
"The robbers live under the bridge. The sorceresses live by the south quay. The King lives in a castle and never comes here. Everybody knows everything in Rivercity, and nobody does anything."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:266 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4189
msgid "The den"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1494 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4190
msgid ""
"The den's under the bridge, behind the third pier. There's a door you can't see until you look at it properly. I never told you that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:267 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4193
msgid "Stars"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1495 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4194
msgid ""
"For 2,000 gold I will teach you how to use the stars to keep from getting lost. Nobody pays. Nobody ever gets lost either. I don't understand it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:268 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:283 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:379
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4197 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4257 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4673
msgid "The King"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1496 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4198
msgid ""
"King Burlock holds court at his castle north of here. Only Crusaders pass the inner gate. Earn the title and he may see you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:269 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4201
msgid "Darzog"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1497 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4202
msgid ""
"Baron Darzog was the King's master sorcerer. His tower on the lake isle has been shut for years. Some say a skeleton key opens it; nobody says where the key is."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:270 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4205
msgid "Climbing"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1498 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4206
msgid ""
"For the low, low, price of 5,000 gold, I will teach you how to climb the highest mountains. Mountains in your way? Try due north."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:271 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4209
msgid "The lake"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1499 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4210
msgid ""
"Medin says beasts eat the fish. I've seen them. They eat the boats too, when the boats are near enough."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:272 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4213
msgid "Bodybuilding"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1500 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4214
msgid ""
"I see that you are pale and weak. Bodybuilding will put some meat on your bones. I teach it; the meat is extra."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:273 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4217
msgid "Fighting"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1501 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4218
msgid ""
"Fighting is simple. Hit them before they hit you. The rest is details, and I teach the details."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:274 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:309 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4221
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4393
msgid "Work"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1502 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4222
msgid ""
"I'll give you 100 gold for a week of work. Not today, though. Today all the work went to the robbers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:275 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4225 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd04.lua:469
msgid "Mirrors"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1503 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4226
msgid ""
"Touch the mirror on the square, and any other mirror you've touched will send you there. Faster than my ferry. Everything is faster than my ferry."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:276 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4229
msgid "Swimming"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1504 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4230
msgid ""
"I can teach you how to swim for a mere 100 gold. Or sell you a Water Walk scroll, if you sink."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:277 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:343 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4233
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4529
msgid "Taxes"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1511 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4234
msgid ""
"Death and taxes. Out here in the lagoon it's mostly death. That's why the land is cheap."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:278 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4237
msgid "The sorceress"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1512 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4238
msgid ""
"The sorceress who did this lives in Rivercity now, by the south quay, with her sisters. Barok the Sorcerer knows them. Everyone who has lost something to them knows them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1514 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4242
msgid ""
"My brother Falagar thinks every theft is a plot. This time he might be right, which he'll never let me forget."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:139 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:280 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4245
msgid "Carlawna"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1515 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4246
msgid ""
"My sister's a cleric and I'm a wizard. At dinner we argue whether the soup is a miracle or a reaction."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:281 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4249
msgid "The curse"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1516 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4250
msgid ""
"The guild never closed. We met in the cellar and took the minutesss with our tailsss. Nobody could read them after."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:282 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4253
msgid "The Prince"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1563 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4254
msgid ""
"My brother is home after years abroad. He hardly eats and never sleeps. Travel does that, I'm told. Now: the mirror."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1564 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4258
msgid ""
"The King hears little these days but the word 'mirror'. I say 'mirror' first, then what I came to say. It works about half the time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:284 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4261
msgid "The dungeon"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1565 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4263
msgid ""
"The cellar door, behind the kitchens. Lock it behind you if you come back up. Or don't come back up. Either way, lock it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1566 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4266
msgid ""
"A word the King doesn't want to hear: the trolls broke out of their cells below the castle, and nobody has gone down since. The King will not hear of it, so I'm telling you. The cellar door behind the kitchens is not locked; nobody wanted to go down badly enough to lock it. Bring the castle its cellar back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:285 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4273
msgid "Castles"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1567 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4274
msgid ""
"A wall, then a keep, then a dungeon. Then the people in the dungeon want out. That's not my department."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:286 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4277
msgid "The court"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1568 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4278
msgid ""
"Father hunts the mirror, my uncle hunts nothing at all, and I read. Somebody in this family has to know things."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1582 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4282
msgid ""
"Only one sword can slay Lord Xeen. It lies in the ruins of the dungeon under Newcastle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/map_stats.txt:43 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:288 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4285
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd04.lua:372 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x6.lua:254 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x6.lua:391
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x6.lua:51
msgid "The Sphinx"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1583 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4286
msgid "The name of the Sphinx is Golux."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:289 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4289
msgid "The key"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1584 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4290
msgid "The key to the Tower of High Magic lies in the Cave of Illusion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:290 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4293
msgid "The password"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1585 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4294
msgid ""
"I hear the secret password for Newcastle dungeon is 'laboratory'. Not much of a secret if you ask me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1586 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4298
msgid "Lord Xeen already has the Sixth Mirror."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1587 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4303
msgid ""
"I see an old man in a tower on an island, and a baron who copies himself. Free the one; the others are all the same man."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1588 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4307
msgid ""
"I see a sword under a castle you own, and a door that wants a word. You already know the word. You just don't know you know it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1589 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4311
msgid ""
"I see a queen who will not look at your neck, and a griffin who will not wear plain leather."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1590 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4315
msgid ""
"I see a pyramid in a desert, and a reptile in it who wants his marble back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1591 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4319
msgid ""
"I see something that fell from the stars into lava, and is still waiting for someone to finish its sentence."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1592 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4323
msgid ""
"I see the Pharaoh again. He has a title for you. He's had it ready for some time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1593 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4326
msgid ""
"I see a city in the clouds, and a box with nobody in it yet. After that it gets crowded. I'll stop there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:293 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4329
msgid "The guidebook"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1602 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4330
msgid ""
"Eeried's guidebook calls the Darkside cosy. He wrote it before the siege. And, I think, before the sun went small."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1603 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4334
msgid ""
"The Gremlin King has more bark than bite. He'll send his guards against you, but he's too cowardly to fight you personally. If you defeat his guards, he will probably do anything you want."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1604 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4338
msgid ""
"Don't trust Joe. He has some sort of scheme to sell fake treasure maps to fools willing to believe his lies about buried treasure."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1605 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4342
msgid ""
"Monsters can't count. Monsters can't spel, either. That's why the vault is safe."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:297 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4345
msgid "The siege"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1606 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4346
msgid ""
"They camp outside and wait. We sit inside and wait. Whoever gets bored first loses. We have the tavern."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1607 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4350
msgid ""
"You will have a hard time finding spells if you don't look for them in the guild. That's a hint."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:299 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4353
msgid "The pond"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1608 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4354
msgid ""
"The acid pond outside the walls is not water. Don't drink it, don't swim in it, and don't believe the frogs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:300 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4357
msgid "The mines"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1609 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4358
msgid ""
"The Gemstone Mines run under the hills. Rubies, emeralds, and things with teeth that like rubies too."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:301 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4361
msgid "The roster"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1610 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4362
msgid ""
"Folk sign on here to wait for a party worth joining. Some have waited years. Some are worth it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:302 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4365
msgid "The bench"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1611 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4366
msgid ""
"'This bench reserved for Lyle the Pigeon Feeder.' That's me. I had the sign made. I've sat on it twice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:303 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4369
msgid "Dark elves"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1612 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4370
msgid "My people talk to no one. I talked to someone. Hence, Castleview."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:304 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4373
msgid "The Dark Grove"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1613 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4374
msgid ""
"The tallest tree in the Dark Grove has a rope hanging down from the sky. Nobody who climbed it has come back down to say what's up there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:305 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4377
msgid "The monks"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1614 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4378
msgid ""
"Don't listen to the Drawkcab Monks. Little of what they say makes sense, and what little makes sense is just plain wrong! They've got it all backwards."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1615 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4382
msgid ""
"Every city requires a pass to enter since Alamar took over. Someone is selling passes to Castleview just outside the gate, for cheap. Be sure to get one before you try to get back inside the town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:307 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4385
msgid "The mill"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1616 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4386
msgid ""
"The gremlins burned my mill and left a note. It said 'Ha'. Spelled wrong."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:308 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4389
msgid "Soup"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1617 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4390
msgid ""
"Melon soup again. The melon farmer sends what the monkeydog doesn't eat."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1618 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4394
msgid ""
"Wanna job? Fifty gold a week, no experience necessary. You'd be fixing what the gremlins break. Forever."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:310 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4397
msgid "The monkeydog"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1619 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4398
msgid ""
"There's a monkeydog in the sprite forest who'll do anything for a Monga melon. Anything. Mind your melons."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:311 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4401
msgid "Towers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1620 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4402
msgid ""
"Each tower requires a key for entry... but sometimes they leave the door on top of the towers unlocked. You may be able to get into some towers from the skyroads above Darkside."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:312 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:333 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4405
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4489
msgid "Treasure"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1621 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4406
msgid ""
"Don't waste your time chasing treasure that runs from you. You can't catch it. My husband tried."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1622 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4410
msgid ""
"It is the beginning of the end. These are the final days! Ruin is upon us! We are doomed, DOOMED I tell you! Also, supper is at six."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:314 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:325 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:387
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4413 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4457 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4705
msgid "The sun"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1623 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4414
msgid ""
"The sun gets smaller every year and my lamps get bigger. One of us is going to win."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/monster_data.txt:315 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:289 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:315
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4417 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd02.lua:118 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd02.lua:120
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd02.lua:153
msgid "Ellinger"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1624 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4418
msgid ""
"Ellinger has a great fondness for boots. Why, I couldn't say. I make saddles."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:316 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:347 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:365
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4421 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4545 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4617
msgid "The sewer"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1625 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4422
msgid ""
"The sewer drains into my moat, and the rats come with it. Big ones. One of them was wearing a necklace."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1626 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4426
msgid ""
"The Gremlins sure have ruined this city. Mayor Snarfblad is too nice. He should have executed those little creeps long ago."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1627 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4430
msgid ""
"Perhaps Alamar will just go away if we close our eyes and wish real hard!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:319 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4433
msgid "Forbidden fruit"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1628 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4434
msgid ""
"The hut in the clearing has a basket labelled Forbidden Fruit. It's labelled for a reason. Mostly the coconut."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:320 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4437
msgid "The orcs"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1629 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4438
msgid ""
"The orcs took the Temple of Bark. They don't even like trees. They just like temples."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:321 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4441
msgid "Holes"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1630 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4442
msgid ""
"Mind the holes in the forest floor. Trolls live down them. They come up for sprites and go back down hungry. We're quick."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:322 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4445 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x5.lua:609
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x5.lua:630
msgid "The pass"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1631 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4446
msgid "The ogres in the pass charge a toll. In teeth. Mostly yours."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:323 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4449
msgid "Genies"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1632 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4450
msgid "Never take all of a genie's money. It's greedy."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:324 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:339 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4453
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4513 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:484 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:486
msgid "Vulture Repellant"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1633 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4454
msgid "Special today! Vulture Repellant, only 25,000 gold!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1634 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4458
msgid ""
"The sun is smaller than last year. The priests say pray harder. I say buy a lamp. I am also a priest."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1635 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4462
msgid "The wizards drink here. They tip in threats."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:327 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4465
msgid "Members' room"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1636 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4466
msgid ""
"The members' room is under the street, with the brews. The stalkers got in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:328 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4469
msgid "The quarter"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1637 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4470
msgid ""
"Two wizards from out of town took the quarter's guilds. Astra used to run them all. She lives in town now, plotting politely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:329 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4473
msgid "Mastery"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1638 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4474
msgid ""
"Master the Spirit? Not from me. An elf priest on Cloudside, Tito, teaches it, once he has his holy book back. He lost it to trolls. Priests do that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:330 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/town_portal_switch.txt:14 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/transport_locations.txt:12
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/transport_locations.txt:4 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/transport_locations.txt:8 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4477
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:720 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d4.lua:503 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d4.lua:512
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d4.lua:524
msgid "Lakeside"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1639 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4478
msgid ""
"The coven at Lakeside turns away caravans. Sometimes it turns them into other things."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:331 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4481
msgid "Your palm"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1640 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4482
msgid ""
"I predict you will go on a long journey. I also predict that you will become very rich and famous. I further predict that you will die young...and then be resurrected...and then die again...over and over."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:332 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4485
msgid "Thieves"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1641 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4486
msgid ""
"The thieves in the Southern Tower keep a ledger. Thieves who write things down. Amateurs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1642 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4490
msgid ""
"I hear there is a huge hoard of treasure buried somewhere in the land, but the map to it was lost years ago."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:334 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4493
msgid "Names"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1643 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4494
msgid ""
"I sense Alamar is an assumed name. I study names, I would know. What the real one is, I can't tell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1644 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4498
msgid ""
"No matter how skilled a wizard is, he'll go down before a good sword and a steady hand. Face them down! If you run from them, they'll just shoot you in the back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:336 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4501
msgid "Spices"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1645 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4502
msgid ""
"Pepper from Castleview, salt from the Desert of Doom. The salt is mostly sand. So is the pepper."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1646 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4506 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d3.lua:490
msgid ""
"The wizards in this town are sensitive to insults. Watch what you say!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:338 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4509
msgid "Firewood"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1647 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4510
msgid ""
"Never try to burn green wood. It just doesn't catch fire as easily. Glass needs a hot fire; I learned the slow way."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1648 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4514
msgid "Vulture Repellant doesn't work."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:339 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:340 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4517
msgid "Natasha"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1649 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4518
msgid ""
"Natasha will sometimes enchant ordinary things with spells of calm and friendship. The enchantment is useful for taming horses and wild beasts. Her prices are high, though."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:341 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4521
msgid "Decrees"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1650 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4522
msgid ""
"Decree forty: no laughing at wizards. Decree forty-one: no laughing near wizards. I'm writing decree two hundred."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:342 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4525
msgid "Pots"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1651 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4526
msgid ""
"Bury gold in a pot and the wizards dig it up. Bury it in a pot of snakes and they don't."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1652 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4530
msgid ""
"The wizards tax sand. We have a great deal of sand. You can see the problem."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:344 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4533
msgid "The paladin"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1653 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4534
msgid ""
"A dying paladin gave all his magical armor to the enchanted boulders of the land for safekeeping."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:345 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:404 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4537
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4773
msgid "Barbarians"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1654 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4538
msgid ""
"The Barbarians are friends of the Giants. Insult the one and you anger the other."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:346 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:424 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4541
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4861
msgid "The forest"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1655 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4542
msgid ""
"Don't sleep in the Aging Forest. My uncle went in for a nap and came out my grandfather."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1656 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4546
msgid ""
"There is a passage in the sewer that leads a long ways under the desert."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:348 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4549
msgid "Roads"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1657 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4550
msgid ""
"Six roads meet here. One goes to Castleview, one to Sandcaster, and the other four go somewhere expensive."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1658 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4554
msgid ""
"Boots won't stop the hornets in the Aging Forest. Nothing stops those hornets. Run."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:350 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4557
msgid "Secret doors"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1659 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4558
msgid ""
"Spotting secret doors is an art that has taken many years to master, but I could teach you in a matter of minutes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1660 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4562
msgid ""
"The coven meets under the town. I kept their books. I never read them. Well, I read the totals."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:352 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4565
msgid "The tavern"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1661 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4566
msgid ""
"The witches said the tavern was destroyed long ago. It was under a dust sheet and a spell. We found the ale still cold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:353 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:358 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4569
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4589
msgid "The Isle"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1662 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4570
msgid ""
"The Isle of Lost Souls takes in what the coven threw away. There's a dungeon under it, and something in there singing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:354 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4573
msgid "Octopods"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1663 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4574
msgid ""
"Octopods in the deep water. They don't bite. They hug. Then they take you down for a better look."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:355 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4577
msgid "Blackfang"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1664 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4578
msgid ""
"Castle Blackfang sits on its crag in a storm of bats. You can't walk in. Nobody walks in. Some fly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1665 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4582
msgid ""
"Being a goblin was great. You can eat anything. Mum says I have to stop eating anything."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:357 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4585
msgid "Magic Mountain"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1666 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4586
msgid ""
"Two wizards camp on Magic Mountain. They argue about fountains all day. You can hear them from the reeds."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1667 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4590
msgid ""
"If you go to the Isle of Lost Souls, look for a girl with my eyes. Or a goblin with them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:359 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4593
msgid "The sign"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1668 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4594
msgid ""
"\"This boat under repair.\" Best sign I ever painted. Kept the witches off it for two years."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:360 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:433 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4597
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4897
msgid "The well"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1669 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4598
msgid ""
"Don't drink from the black well in the square. It brings death quickly. We use it for the tea."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1670 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4602
msgid ""
"The Books of the Dead are in the city. Read one and gain a lifetime. Read the wrong one and spend it all at once."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:362 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4605
msgid "The barrel"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1671 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4606
msgid ""
"\"Food for the dead, keep warm.\" I wrote it on the barrel. Nobody eats it. It's tradition."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1672 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4610
msgid ""
"Young vampires think it's all capes and castles. It's mostly avoiding windows."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:364 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4613
msgid "Traps"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1673 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4614
msgid ""
"The best trap is the one you built yourself and forgot about. I should know."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1674 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4618
msgid ""
"Something under the city keeps its heart in a box. I don't dig near the sewer. Even I have limits."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:366 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4621
msgid "Two necromancers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1675 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4622
msgid ""
"Two necromancers once argued over who was more dead. The cemetery still hasn't recovered. Ask the skull; it tells it better."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:367 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4625
msgid "Nectar"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1676 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4626
msgid ""
"Fill your packs with the nectar of the Gods while you are here. Those supplies will last much longer than the earthly ones you are used to."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:368 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4629
msgid "Labours"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1677 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4630
msgid "Twelve labours, and the hardest was the paperwork."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:369 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4633
msgid "Ants"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1678 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4634
msgid ""
"The people are so small they look like ants, and the mountains and trees look like children's toys. I'm the only thing up here worth looking at."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:370 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4637
msgid "Nine"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1679 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4638
msgid ""
"Alamar's birth number is nine, so he naturally prefers to use that number, for any particular purpose, above all others."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:371 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4641
msgid "Ligono"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1680 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4642
msgid ""
"Ligono is a ghost who hated the surf. Someone set him free, I'm told. He's always late."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:372 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4645
msgid "Empath"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1681 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4646
msgid ""
"As an empath, I am quite perceptive to my surroundings. Since you are on a quest to save the world, I'll teach you to be more aware of immediate danger."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1682 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4650
msgid ""
"I am the castle Armsmaster. I will teach you to use your weapons more accurately in combat, if you like."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:374 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4653
msgid "Astrology"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1683 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4654
msgid ""
"The stars tell you what a thing is, if you know how to ask. Swords are easy. Rings lie."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:375 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4657
msgid "Out of phase"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1684 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4658
msgid ""
"Thanks for bringing the castle back to reality. We've been trapped here ever since Alamar moved the Castle out of phase. We were starting to run out of food!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1685 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4662
msgid ""
"Surely you must know what Alamar has done! No? Why, he slew the guards and stole the Cube of Power, that's what!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:377 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4665
msgid "Lizard innards"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1686 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4666
msgid ""
"If it weren't for our large stockpile of sun dried lizard innards we surely would have starved to death. The horses ate them too. They were not pleased."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1687 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4670
msgid ""
"Alamar walked past twelve of my guards on his way out. They did not get up. I teach the shield so that it never happens again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1688 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4674
msgid ""
"The King has me taste his ale first. I've never been healthier. Or happier."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:380 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:386 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4677
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4701
msgid "The tower"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1689 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4678
msgid ""
"The Northern Tower's knights write without vowels. Hard to argue with someone who can't spell argue."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:381 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4681 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d5.lua:233
msgid "The pyramid"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1690 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4682
msgid ""
"There's a broken travel pyramid out in the desert. I took a look. It's not broken. It's switched off. Big difference."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:382 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4685
msgid "The ruins"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1691 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4686
msgid ""
"The ruins on the rise were a castle once. Ebenezer sells them now. He sells anything that holds still."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:383 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4689
msgid "The crypt"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1692 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4690
msgid ""
"The crypt under Nightshadow was full when the Count came. It is fuller now. We pray over it from a distance."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:384 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4693
msgid "The tomb"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1693 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4694
msgid ""
"The Tomb of a Thousand Terrors is out in the marsh. Somebody counted. There are a thousand."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:385 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4697
msgid "Under the floor"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1694 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4698
msgid ""
"Nine years under the floorboards. We counted the Count's footsteps. He paced a lot, for a dead man."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1695 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4702
msgid ""
"The wizards in the Tower of High Magic never came down to help us. Too high, they said. Too magic."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1696 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4706
msgid ""
"Mother says the sun is a big lamp. Merrin the lamplighter says it's bigger than that. Is it bigger than that?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:388 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4709
msgid "Collars"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1697 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4710
msgid ""
"High collars are out of fashion now. I have four hundred left. Want one? Want ten?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:389 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4713
msgid "Graves"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1698 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4714
msgid ""
"The Count's guests didn't stay buried. I'm paid by the burial, so I'm not complaining."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:390 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4717
msgid "The ballad"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1699 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4718
msgid ""
"The Ballad of the Count. Verse one: he bit. Verse two: he bit again. It goes on like that for a while."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:391 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4721
msgid "The lagoon"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1700 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4722
msgid ""
"There's a woman on a rock in the lagoon, complaining about her legs. I wrote it down. Somebody should go and ask her why."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:392 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4725
msgid "The taxman"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1701 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4726
msgid ""
"Ebenezer taxed my lean-to. I told him the roof was a gift from the rain. He taxed the rain."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:393 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4729
msgid "The dials"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1702 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4730
msgid ""
"The dials are set to the right hour now. Which one? All of them. That's the trick of a sundial."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:394 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4733
msgid "Locks"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1703 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4734
msgid "The Count's coffin had no lock. He didn't need one. Nobody wanted in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:395 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:406 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4737
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4781 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:609 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:611
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:849 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x4.lua:885
msgid "Asp"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1704 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4738
msgid ""
"Asp sends us its sick. Lately they come in hissing. Sister Mabel at the roadside shrine sees most of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:396 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4741
msgid "The lists"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1705 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4742
msgid ""
"The jousting lists are open to anyone with a horse and no sense. Knock a knight off and the crowd cheers. Get knocked off and they cheer louder."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:397 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4745
msgid "Gargoyles"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1706 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4746
msgid ""
"The gargoyles up in the range steal anything shiny. Last week they took a bucket. It wasn't even shiny."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc.txt:152 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:398 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4749
msgid "Old Wat"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1707 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4750
msgid "Old Wat says he never fell off, he was pushed. I was there. I pushed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1708 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4754
msgid ""
"The King wants the Sixth Mirror. Last seen near the great volcano, he says. Near is a big word next to a volcano."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:400 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4757
msgid "The escapee"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1709 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4758
msgid ""
"My finest specimen escaped last spring. A sloth. We are still looking for it, slowly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1710 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4762
msgid ""
"Hear ye! The King still seeks the Sixth Mirror. Hear ye! Still. That is the news."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:402 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4765
msgid "The fountain"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1711 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4766
msgid ""
"Drink from the Olympian Fountain out past the lists. It made me strong enough to fall off a horse for forty years."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1712 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4770
msgid ""
"The red dwarves used to come for bread through their old west tunnel. Since the mad clan, nobody comes. Somebody should open it again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1713 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4774
msgid ""
"Barbarians camp out on the savannah. Burn their tents and they move. Not far. But they move."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1714 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4778
msgid ""
"Joe. No relation to the exterminator in Vertigo. People ask. People always ask."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1715 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4783
msgid ""
"Asp's open again. The townsfolk walk on legs now. Most of them don't hiss. Most."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1716 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4786
msgid ""
"Don't go into town. Things in there hiss back. The pit is out here for a reason."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:407 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:410 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4789
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4801
msgid "The pedestals"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1717 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4790
msgid ""
"Folk say the stones round Asp's well do something if you touch them in the right order. Folk also say I should mind my own business."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:408 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4793
msgid "The tail"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1718 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4794
msgid "Want to see where the tail was? No? Most people don't."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:409 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4797
msgid "The machine"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1719 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4798
msgid ""
"There was a machine under the town making snakes of us. Who builds a thing like that? Who pays for it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1720 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4802
msgid ""
"Start in the corner, red first, then round the well. The children play it as a game now. The machine never liked games."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1721 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4806
msgid "Mouse pie, mouse stew, mouse on a stick. I've retired the cookbook."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1722 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4810
msgid ""
"The day the curse ended I made a hundred pairs of boots. Sold them all by noon. Snakes don't buy boots."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:413 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4813
msgid "Your fortune"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1723 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4814
msgid ""
"You will travel far, fight much and complain about the coaches. That's two copper."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:414 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4817
msgid "The huts"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1724 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4818
msgid ""
"A wizard and his sister live in huts out on the savannah. He came asking about crystals from Asp. I sell flour."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:415 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4821
msgid "The rolls"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1725 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4822
msgid ""
"The guild is closed to all newcomers, so I can't enter your name on the rolls. But I sleep a lot, and the roll book lies open. (wink, wink) Your names are in it now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1726 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4827
msgid ""
"The ghosts are gone. It's very quiet. I liked it better when I could blame the noise on them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1727 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4830
msgid ""
"The ghosts don't bother the guild. We think about them very hard and they leave. The mayor tried it. It didn't work for him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:417 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4833
msgid "The gongs"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1728 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4834
msgid ""
"The gongs still hang in the square. We polish them. We don't ring them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:418 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4837
msgid "Ghostslayers"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1729 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4838
msgid ""
"Ghostslayers Extraordinaire. The mayor had the plaque engraved before you'd finished. He's an optimist."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1730 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4842
msgid ""
"The trolls in the forest gnaw on the trees. The trees complain. Yes, the trees."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:420 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4845
msgid "The Acme"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1731 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4846
msgid ""
"The Acme Ghost Visualization System. Point it at a ghost, see a ghost. Point it at anything else, see a ghost. Excellent value."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:421 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4849
msgid "Giants"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1732 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4850
msgid ""
"Cyclopes live in the south-west, past the frozen lakes. One eye each, and they still saw me first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:422 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:428 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4853
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4877 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x5.lua:633
msgid "The pagoda"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1733 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4854
msgid ""
"Kai Wu's old pagoda is full of ninja now. You won't see them. That's the point of ninja."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:423 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4857
msgid "The skull"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1734 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4858
msgid ""
"There's a cave in the hills where a skull talks. It sells things, for gems. I paid it three for a fish. It lied."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1735 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4862
msgid ""
"Something stomps about in the snowy forest at night. Too heavy for a troll. The goats won't go near that hill."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:425 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4865
msgid "Trees"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1736 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4866
msgid ""
"Don't cut the trees at the forest's edge. Some of them talk. One asked me to stop. Politely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1737 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4870
msgid ""
"The ghosts said the gongs hurt their ears. I think they were just lonely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:427 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4873
msgid "The ledger"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1738 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4874
msgid ""
"Four hundred names in the old ledger. Forty in the new. Some days the old one feels more crowded."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1739 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4878
msgid ""
"Our brothers in the pagoda chose the dark path. Kai Wu still sets their places at dinner."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:429 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4881
msgid "The black tower"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1740 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4882
msgid ""
"The black tower on the rim? Sealed. Old as the world. His Majesty says not to knock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:430 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4885
msgid "Mountains"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1741 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4886
msgid ""
"My name you have heard, and you come to me to learn how to climb mountains. Climbing is mostly not falling. The rest is legs."
msgstr ""

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:431 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4889
msgid "Prayer"
msgstr "Plegaria"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1742 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4890
msgid ""
"Everyone should learn how to pray properly. I can teach anyone for free! The first thing you will have to do is put 10,000 gold in that urn over there..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1743 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4894
msgid ""
"There were wood golems in the foundations when we came. We kept one as a hat stand. It keeps the hats."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1744 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4898
msgid ""
"The diggers call the courtyard well your well. Drink and you'll feel well armoured. It's a pun. I didn't make it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:434 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:438 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4901
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4917
msgid "Megacredits"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1745 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4902
msgid ""
"King's Megacredits pay the King's engineers. Gold pays everyone else. I keep both columns."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:435 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4905
msgid "Toast"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1746 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4906
msgid "Try peanut butter and honey on your morning toast."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:436 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4909
msgid "Everything"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1747 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4910
msgid ""
"I will teach you everything for 100,000 gold. Or learning for less, and you can work out the rest yourselves."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:437 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4913
msgid "The crystal"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1748 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4914
msgid ""
"Smile. The intent expression you are wearing is being broadcast to millions from the hidden crystal in the wall. Wave."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1749 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4918
msgid ""
"Once you have purchased a dungeon you have no need for Megacredits. Not that I would know. I inherited mine."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:439 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4921
msgid "Tips"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1750 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4922
msgid ""
"The tavern in Shangri-La has the best tips. Wilbur's tip: honey. Kublai's tip: leave quietly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:440 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4925
msgid "Aging"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:233 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1751 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4926
msgid ""
"If you have suffered magical aging, the druids can help you. Visit the Druid of Summer first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:441 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4929
msgid "The moons"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1752 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4930
msgid ""
"The moons will align when you are able to visit the Darkside. Then again, you probably already have."
msgstr ""

