#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1354 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4941
msgid ""
"Fountain of Energy Resistance. Your spine tingles and the hair on the back of your neck stands on end. (+5 Air resistance, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1352 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4954
msgid ""
"Fountain of Might. Fantastic might surges through your body as the water passes your lips. (+20 Might until you rest)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1358 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4960
msgid "Broken trunks and bones. Nobody has rebuilt it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1357 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4965
msgid ""
"You put your backs into it and tear the place apart. Nobody will be sleeping here tonight."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1355 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4972
msgid "The water is cold and very clear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1356 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4977
msgid ""
"The Last Water. The water is cold and very clear. You feel fortune turn your way. (+2 Luck, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1359 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4986
msgid "SOMEONE in the party got the munchies and ate all the food!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1349 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4993
msgid "Only silence greets your supplications."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1350 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5005
msgid ""
"Recognizing the urgency of your quest, the Gods answer your prayers. (+15 to every statistic until you rest)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1373 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5011
msgid "Ash and arrowheads. The archers have not come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1372 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5016
msgid "Smoke rises into the sky as you put the camp to the torch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1363 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1365 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1367
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5023 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5036 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5049
msgid "You've already read it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1364 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5029
msgid ""
"Book of the Dead, Vol. 1. The words are cold, and they stay with you. The experience aged you. (+3,000 experience, +8 years)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1366 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5042
msgid ""
"Book of the Dead, Vol. 2. Somewhere in the middle, the book reads you back. The experience aged you. (+3,000 experience, +8 years)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1368 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5055
msgid ""
"Book of the Dead, Vol. 3. The last page is a mirror. You look older in it. The experience aged you. (+3,000 experience, +8 years)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1361 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5061
msgid ""
"The gate stays shut. A voice through the grille: \"The living need a pass. The dead need nothing. The Lakeside witches write passes for both.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1360 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5063
msgid ""
"The gatekeeper reads your pass through the grille, twice, and the leaves swing open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1371 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5069
msgid ""
"The second pod's hatch is sealed from inside. The hull is cold. Whoever came down in this one is not answering the door."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1370 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5071
msgid ""
"With Sheltem gone, the pod's lock has died too. The hatch rolls aside on a cold, red-lit airlock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1362 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5077
msgid ""
"Unprompted, the magic skull begins to speak: Once upon a time two necromancers had a little disagreement. Darkness said he was the most powerful, foul and evil necromancer in all of Xeen; Death said HE was. On the darkest night of the year they met in a graveyard and raised the dead against each other, and the battle raged a full five days. When the corpses were piled so high that they made a bridge between the two burial mounds, the necromancers met on top. Death caught hold of Darkness' throat, and Darkness of Death's, and they died as one at the top of the hideous mountain they had made. They built the town on it afterwards. The view is very good."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1369 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5083
msgid "The Forbidden Zone. Beyond: Castle Alamar. The dead keep the road."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1386 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5089
msgid ""
"A message in the bottle reads: Evil Genies NEVER let their victims off the hook. They will always kill someone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1389 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5095
msgid ""
"A note in the bottle reads: Help! I'm stranded on an air island past the genie's rock, south of the old launch."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1387 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5101
msgid ""
"A message in the bottle reads: The test of the elements is merely difficult, not impossible."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1388 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5107
msgid ""
"A note in the bottle reads: Help! I'm stranded on an air island off the West Lookout."
msgstr ""

