"\"You already carry a Fire scarab's power,\" says Rahib. \"One is all a soul can hold.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1392 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5303
msgid ""
"The scarab crumbles to dust as its power passes into you. (+10 Fire resistance, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1396 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5310
