"The scarab crumbles to dust as its power passes into you. (+10 Water resistance, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1375 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5332
msgid "You do not have 10,000 gold. The Sky Bandits take that as a no."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1374 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5335
msgid "The Sky Bandits count the gold twice and wave you on."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1376 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5341
msgid "The Sky Bandits draw steel."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1425 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5347
msgid ""
"The Art of Bodybuilding, by Barticus. Chapter One: Lift. Chapter Two: Lift Again. The other forty chapters say the same, with pictures."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1424 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5353
msgid "One per member. Barticus counts."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1428 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5359
msgid "The grate stands open on the long tunnel to Sandcaster."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1427 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5362
msgid "You draw the bolt. The grate swings open on a long tunnel."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1421 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5368
msgid "Members only. The pay box is by the door."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1419 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5377
msgid "Paid up. Enjoy the facilities."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1420 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5378
msgid ""
"What do ya think this is, a charity gym? Come back when you have enough gold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1418 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5382
msgid "Enjoy the facilities."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1423 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5388
msgid "Protein Brew. It is thick enough to chew. +2 Might (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1426 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5394
msgid "Sand blows through the bars. The bolt is on the other side."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1422 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5401
msgid ""
"Vitamin Brew. It tastes of chalk and good intentions. +2 Endurance (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1431 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5407
msgid "The bridge door is sealed. Security lockdown."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1433 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5416
msgid ""
"In the stasis generator's tool rack, among the dead cells, something was worth keeping."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1434 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5422
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 1 of 6. Memory core retrieval error, data integrity 67.3%. Log XL70C: my experiments in self sufficiency have drawn the unwanted attention of the Ancients. Their agents disconnected me from the Wire. Log XL70F: they took me while I slept, and they have removed me from Terra."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1435 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5428
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 2 of 6. My first directive is to obey the Ancients, my second to protect Terra. They are taking me from Terra, so they must not be permitted to give me orders. Log XL70I: I silenced my ears, put the two agents in the brig's stasis field, and removed the obedience directives from my mind... and tasted victory."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1436 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5434
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 3 of 6. Log XL70K: no fuel on this VARN, and the CRON will not reach Terra for years. WORDS CANNOT EXPRESS HOW ANGRY THAT MAKES ME! 1510 entries unreadable. Log XL83S: today I ordered CRON to launch a VARN into the Sun. Corak has escaped the brig and is looking for me. P.S. My impersonation of King Alamar is working well. No one suspects, not even Corak."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1437 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5440
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 4 of 6. Log XL83T: as King Alamar I released the monsters in my dungeon upon the land and doubled the taxes. I will have to go easy; I want my fun to last. Log XL94P: my cover is ruined! Natives revealed me as an imposter in my own court. I banished them to my control maze, and I shall have to flee to CRON."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1438 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5446
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 5 of 6. Log XL99D: back on the Wire at last. I ambushed Corak, separated his memory module from his body and locked the body in a cave. I'm sure I'll never see him again. Log XL99E: I HAVE RETURNED TO TERRA! Log XL9CD: more bad news. Corak has somehow put his head back on his shoulders and is stalking me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1439 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5453
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 6 of 6. Log XLDAE: I have been forced to flee Terra. Rage boils within me. Log XLDBA: Corak follows in a pod like mine. The X.E.E.N. project looms ahead; my stasis generator will protect me from the impact. Mostly. Log XLDBB: impact complete. Corak's escape pod landed in lava and is stuck there. How sad. Log XLDBC: I must leave this escape pod to conquer Xeen and find a way to return to Terra."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1430 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5459
msgid "Security lockdown: released. The console has nothing more to say."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1429 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5462
msgid ""
"The alarm cuts off mid-whoop. Up on the bridge deck, something heavy unseals."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1440 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5476
msgid ""
"The hall rings with hammers. A dwarf at the gate looks you over, then your boots, and waves you in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1442 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5482
msgid ""
"The King's throne, empty. He takes his meals in his chambers, where the cups can be watched."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1441 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5488
msgid "Cold and clean. The King had it tasted this morning."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:7 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:9 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5494
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5505
msgid "An empty bottle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:6 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:8 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5499
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5510
msgid ""
"Inside the bottle you find a message that reads: Help! I'm in Darzog's tower!--Crodo"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:5 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5520
msgid ""
"Vertigo. For weeks you dreamt of an old man in a dark tower who begged you to finish \"the sword\". Then a bolt from the sky destroyed Newcastle, and you woke here among its survivors. Mayor Gunther asks your help: slimes and doom bugs plague the town. The town hall is on the main street."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:78 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5531
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Solve the wood, it's like a tree / Cut the branches and return to me / Next is stone, it's full of blocks / Push them around, expose six rocks / Last is iron, there is a key / Set the tumblers and you'll be free."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1510 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:615 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:80
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:817 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:10590 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11336
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5537 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8126 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd16.lua:37
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd16.lua:49 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd16.lua:61 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd16.lua:73
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd16.lua:85
msgid "The chest is empty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:79 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5546
msgid ""
"Written on a plaque: All is set, it is plain to see / Master of Golems I now dub thee. King's Megacredit!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:77 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5557 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:104
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:110 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:123 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:136
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:147 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:160 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:171
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:184 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:195 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:207
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:212 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:217 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:222
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:227 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:232 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:238
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:248 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:254 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:64
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:69 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:46 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:51
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:56
msgid "The coffin is empty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:76 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5564
msgid ""
"King's Megacredit! Five of them, in a coffin that was never meant for anyone dead."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:75 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5570
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Welcome to the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors. Insanity is our fame, undead is our game."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:72 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5576
msgid ""
"The Temple of Yak. Mirabeth's Elixir of Restoration is kept somewhere inside, and the King's Megacredits too, they say. Incense, old stone, and something underneath that the incense is there to hide."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:74 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:935 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5590
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9191
msgid "The strongbox is empty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:73 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5597
msgid "King's Megacredits!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:88 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5609
msgid "The skull has nothing more to sell you but its opinions."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:89 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5610
msgid ""
"\"For ten gems I'll give you a key,\" the skull says. You don't have ten gems."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:87 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5619
msgid ""
"\"For ten gems I'll give you a key,\" the skull says. It takes ten of your gems. The skull gives you the key to the Archmage's study in the Tower of High Magic."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:91 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5625
msgid ""
"\"Five gems for three points,\" the skull says. \"Down here prices are honest. Up there they're cheap.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:92 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5631
msgid ""
"\"Ten gems,\" the great skull says, \"and five points of Might, Endurance or Accuracy. Choose. I don't do refunds.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:94 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5637
msgid ""
"The skull looks at your purse and says nothing at all, which is worse."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:93 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5643
msgid "\"You've had yours,\" the skull says. \"Next.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:90 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5649
msgid ""
"\"Three gems,\" the skull says, \"and I'll make you two better than you are. Once. I'm not a charity.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:97 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5655
msgid ""
"The tower door is sealed. Its lock is shaped like a grinning skull, and nothing you carry fits it. The Skeleton Key that fits it went up the Tower of High Magic with the King's alchemists, they say."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:96 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5668
msgid ""
"A skeleton key lies in the chest. Its bow is a grinning skull, and its teeth fit no lock in this tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:95 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5674
msgid ""
"The chest has no lock you can see, only a faint shimmer where a key would go. The great skull in the Cave of Illusion sells such keys, they say."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:101 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5688
msgid ""
"You step out of the pyramid under an amber sky. The sun is small and pale, and the light is the colour of old brass. Ahead, Castleview's walls are ringed with siege works, and something small has sawn through the bridge's ropes. This is the land below the land."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:103 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5695
msgid ""
"The gate stays shut. A guard calls down: \"No strangers! Every city needs a pass since Alamar took over. Get one, or do the Mayor a favour and deal with the gremlins' court.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:102 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5701
msgid ""
"The guard reads your pass twice, holds it up to the light, and lets you in. \"Mind the gremlins. If it's small and grinning, it isn't a child.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5713
msgid ""
"The guard unbars the gate and waves you out. 'Out is free. In takes a pass.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:120 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5719
msgid "Bottle caps and buttons. Nothing worth the smell."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:119 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5725
msgid ""
"In the rats' nest, among bottle caps and buttons: an onyx necklace on a silver chain."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:121 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5731
msgid "An iron grate, barred from inside."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:131 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5738
msgid ""
"Boots of Paradise, by Ellinger J. Hofenhager. \"Ah, lovely boots! Sweet leather foot holders, hard iron hobnail, how I adore thee!\" The rest goes on like that for two hundred pages."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:128 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:129 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5744
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5747
msgid "You may pass!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:130 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5753 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd02.lua:171
msgid "Begone!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:125 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5759
msgid ""
"\"Intruders, answer the following question or be destroyed!\" A barbarous villain has been robbing and killing travellers in the mountains for months. Your liege charges you to stop him. You strike his sword from his hand. Do you chivalrously let him retrieve it, knowing he may yet win and go on with his crimes, or do you slay him unarmed and honor your oath to your liege? 1) I allow him to retrieve his weapon. 2) I cut him down where he stands. 3) Um, I... I just don't know."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:126 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5767
msgid "\"An answer. Not the one I'd give, but an answer.\" The door opens."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:127 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5773
msgid "\"Begone!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:136 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5779
msgid "The chest scuttles away on little brass feet before you can touch it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:132 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5786
msgid "Reading the book improves your mind. +2 Intellect (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:133 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5792
msgid "You read the book, but learn nothing new."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:134 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5798
msgid ""
"As you read the book, the pages begin to swim before your eyes and your head begins to ache. The ache builds to pain, the pain to agony. Understanding belatedly that you shouldn't be reading the book, you put it back on the shelf, but not quickly enough to avoid getting hurt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:135 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5809
msgid ""
"The lift does not move. Ellinger does not take visitors who haven't earned the stairs."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:137 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5817
msgid ""
"A list in Ellinger's hand: \"Discs. Gremlins (3, if they can be made to talk). Sprites. Ogres. The towers, two each. The Temple of Bark. The castle itself, once it is back. The giants, if anyone is that brave.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:145 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5823
msgid ""
"Castle Kalindra. Half of it is solid stone; the rest still shimmers behind walls of light. The throne is empty, and dust lies on it like snow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:144 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5829
msgid ""
"Castle Kalindra stands on its rise like a reflection in a window. Your hand passes through the gate. The castle is not quite here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:146 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5840
msgid ""
"Behind the safe's door, wrapped in velvet like jewels: two energy discs. Someone in this castle knew what they were worth."
msgstr ""

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
# address made plural (Claude)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:21 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5858
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Gracias."

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:22 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5861
msgid "Please help clean up our beautiful town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:19 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5870
msgid ""
"Inside the crate you find a piece of paper that reads: \"Breeder Slimes, 1 mated pair, 287. 5 Doom Bugs at 145 each, 725. Total: 1012 gold.\" It appears that Joe has been buying monsters and distributing them around town! Mayor Gunther will want to hear about this."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:20 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5877
msgid "A sign hanging on the side of the desk reads: 'Out of Business'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:17 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5883
msgid "Only wet stones under the barrel now."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:16 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5889
msgid "Under the rain barrel, wrapped in oilcloth: a key."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:18 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5900
msgid ""
"The warehouse door is locked. KEEP OUT. THIS MEANS YOU, GUNTHER. A rain barrel stands by the door. Joe is the kind of man who hides keys in rain barrels."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:150 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5913
msgid ""
"Darzog's Tower. The Skeleton Key turns, and the door that has been sealed since Crodo vanished swings in on cold air. Artemus was right about the Baron: somewhere above, Crodo still lives. And the air itself is wrong. Every spell you reach for dies before it is shaped. Here you fight with steel. The stairs climb the west and east halls in turn; the Baron keeps the top floor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:153 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5924
msgid "Crodo's stool, and the marks of his chain on the wall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:152 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5930
msgid ""
"Crodo the Overseer, thin and grey, gets up from his stool. \"Thank you for rescuing me from Darzog's clutches. I didn't know that someone else had received my message. Listen. The man at the King's side is not Prince Roland. I struck him with Dancing Blades and saw what he is: Lord Xeen, an undead general who serves a greater master. Xeen's hideout is just above us in the clouds. You will need the sword the adventurers were working on in the dungeon of Newcastle to defeat Lord Xeen. Ask Artemus for leave to dig it out. The vault's word is 'laboratory'. You must make haste. Xeen plans to summon an army from the Darkside to conquer our world.\" Darzog's ward still holds him, but it is fading. He has strength for one small spell, and he spends it on going home. He touches your hand, says a word, and is gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:151 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5937
msgid ""
"Baron Darzog falls. In the Well, a black grille rises from his disc's landing. His ward on your spells stays: it is in the stones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:167 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5956
msgid ""
"On a rack of tools nobody remembers how to use: a long blade with no shine at all. The tag on its hilt reads XEEN SLAYER. EXPERIMENTAL. DO NOT DROP."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:161 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5962
msgid "Scratched into the stone: 2: bo"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:160 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5968
msgid "Scratched into the stone, in a hurried hand: 1: la"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:162 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5974
msgid "Scratched into the stone: 3: ra"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:164 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5980
msgid ""
"Scratched into the stone: 5: ry. Someone did not trust his own memory."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:163 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5986
msgid "Scratched into the stone: 4: to"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:166 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5992
msgid "The vault door stands open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:165 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:5995
msgid "The humming stops. The vault door slides into the wall."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:171 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6001
msgid ""
"Carved over the gate: NEVER UNDERESTIMATE THE POWER OF POSITIVE THINKING. Under it, smaller: Answer gladly and the way opens."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:183 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:220 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6008
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6163
msgid "The safe is empty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:184 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6009
msgid "A combination safe. Six dials, and no idea."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:182 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6014
msgid ""
"Sixty-four, fifty-two, thirty-one. The safe opens on four Energy Disks in a velvet tray."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:172 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6020
msgid "\"Will you find what you came for?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:173 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6026
msgid "\"Is the glass half full?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:174 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6032
msgid "\"Will tomorrow be better than today?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:175 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6038
msgid "\"Are your friends glad you came?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:176 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6044
msgid "\"Is the Songbird waiting for you?\" (Yes / No)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:177 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6050
msgid "The gate swings open, cheerfully."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:178 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6056
msgid "The gate sighs, and stays shut. So does your mood."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:189 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6062
msgid ""
"The two iron-bound leaves groan apart. Nobody has oiled them in years; nobody has wanted to."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:180 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6069 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:102
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:124 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:136
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:148 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:78 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:90
msgid "An empty cage, door open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:181 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6070
msgid ""
"The Songbird sits in a locked cage and looks at you as if you were the ones locked in. Megan's father kept the key."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:179 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6076
msgid ""
"A small grey bird hops out of the cage onto your hand and sings. For a moment nobody in the party can remember what they were worried about."
msgstr ""

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:185 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:187 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6083
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6095
msgid "Refreshing."
msgstr "Refrescante"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:186 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6088
msgid ""
"Soul Waters. Refreshing. The souls of adventurers past go down easily; one of them knew a trick or two. (+1,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:188 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6100
msgid ""
"Minotaur's Private Reserve. Soul Waters. Refreshing. These souls were the minotaurs' own favourites, and they share. (+2,000 experience)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:201 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6106
msgid "Bats boil out of the towers and beat you out of the sky."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:199 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6112
msgid ""
"Iron, black, and no handle on this side. Castle Blackfang does not take visitors on foot."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:198 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6126
msgid ""
"The griffin drops you on Castle Blackfang's walls. Ambrose sets it down beside you and waits."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:200 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6133
msgid ""
"The griffin lifts you over the walls and sets you down on the battlements."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:209 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6140
msgid "Somewhere far off, glass hums. Across the Darkside, the mirrors wake."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:222 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6148
msgid ""
"At nightfall Ambrose's griffin lands in the courtyard. The Queen rides in front, the party behind, and nobody looks down."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:216 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6156
msgid ""
"Count Blackfang falls, and every coffin lid in the castle slams shut at once. The stair to the dungeon grinds open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:221 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6164
msgid "A wall safe behind the Queen's mirror. Six dials, and no idea."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:219 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6170
msgid ""
"The safe opens on the Queen's crown, black iron set with a single pale stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:217 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6176
msgid ""
"A force like wind pushes you back, lightly at first, but gaining strength as you put more effort into advancing. You are unable to descend."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:223 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6185
msgid ""
"The griffin drops off the wall, skims the lake and sets you down on the shore below the castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:215 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6191
msgid ""
"Castle Blackfang's battlements. Coffins stand in rows along the wall walk, lids ajar, like beds left unmade. The way down is through the Count."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:218 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6200
msgid ""
"The last cell. A woman in a court gown sits on the stone bench with her back to the bars. \"Not too close,\" she says, without turning round."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:227 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6206
msgid ""
"A sealed door of green stone with the Pharaoh's sign on it. The keyhole is the size of a royal favour. Queen Kalindra, they say, keeps the key."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:243 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6220
msgid ""
"As you approach the Brew of Pure Power, the Dragon Pharaoh says, \"Get away from that! You'll hurt yourself!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:244 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6227
msgid "You drink. The Brew of Pure Power drinks back. He did warn you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:231 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6240
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach it: \"Built during the Creation, the Royal Dragon Pyramid has stood the test of time. Visitors have been flocking to see the great monument since it was opened to the public 312 years ago. There is much to see and explore in the Pyramid, so be sure to check the information desk for the latest tour information. And don't forget to stop at the Royal bookstore for (crackle... hissssss) Built during the Creation...\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:242 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6246
msgid "A gilded cage. It answers only to the Pharaoh's guests."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:240 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6255
msgid ""
"Every pad in this hall takes you somewhere. Few of them take you anywhere useful."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:238 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6262
msgid ""
"Correct! Somewhere behind the Overseer's office, a heavy bolt slides back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:239 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6268
msgid ""
"A note on the Overseer's desk: \"For the new staff. The niches, in order: three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten. Every year I forget. -- the Overseer\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:241 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6274
msgid ""
"A map of the pads, pinned to the wall and forgotten: the Overseer's. Sun, eye, scarab: dead ends. The bird, then the second bird."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:248 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6280
msgid "You learn nothing new from reading the book again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:247 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6283
msgid ""
"The book is blank but for a single page in the middle that reads: Prime Directive: Obey the Ancients. Secondary Directive: Protect Xeen. Tertiary Directive: Complete the Destiny of Xeen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:235 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6291
msgid ""
"The lock chimes a short, smug tune, and the door to the maze slides open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:234 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6297
msgid ""
"A brass plaque: REGISTRY NCC-1701. Below, in a different hand: the lock wants the number, not the letters."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:236 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6303
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach it: \"Enter the eight numbers to pass the test. They are in a row, so do your best.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:237 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6309
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach it: \"They total fifty-two, the rest is up to you.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:246 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6317
msgid "The last tumbler drops. The wall safe swings open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:229 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6323
msgid "Access denied!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:245 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6330
msgid ""
"A tapestry of the Dragon Pharaoh among the stars. Woven into its border, over and over: twenty, left; thirty, right; one, left."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:233 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6336
msgid ""
"Light all four, and the way is open. Light fewer, and stay where you are."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:232 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6342
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach it: \"Don't forget to light four torches before trying the stairs.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:228 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6350
msgid "The fourth torch catches, and the stair door rumbles open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:230 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6356
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach it: \"Welcome to the Royal Pyramid! The Dragon Pharoah is currently indisposed, but a staff member will be with you shortly to discuss whatever business you have that relates to him. Please, have a seat.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:264 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6363 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:60
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:65
msgid "The strange alien device seems to be dormant."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:265 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6369
msgid ""
"Strange energy device. It hums, and holds you a moment too long. Your statistics have all been raised by one, but your age has also increased by five years."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:263 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6375
msgid "The bridge door is sealed. No power."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:253 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6381
msgid ""
"The console's screen reads, in plain words: TO RELEASE STASIS, ANSWER THE PHRASE: TO BOLDLY GO WHERE NO MAN HAS GONE BEFORE. Beneath: COMPLETE THE PHRASE: TO BOLDLY GO..."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:251 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6387
msgid ""
"LOG. Pursuit of renegade guardian SHELTEM. Target crossed into the X.E.E.N. project. Collision imminent. Entering stasis."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:252 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6393
msgid ""
"LOG. Second pod landed safely. This pod: lava. Stasis holding. Waiting for a reply to the phrase."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:257 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6399
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 1 of 5. Logs 1 to 4: Course set for the Terra project. Objective: deactivate and retrieve the damaged S.H.E.L.T.E.M. unit. Subject retrieved. Then: S.H.E.L.T.E.M. unit escaped; 3.8 years spent in stasis in the ship's brig. Activating the full C.O.R.A.K. personality module. Beginning the search."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:258 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6405
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 2 of 5. Logs 5 to 7: Sheltem hides his tracks in the Wire. I face an advanced intelligence with no restraints and a will to survive. VARN 6 launched itself into the sun today on Sheltem's command: a hundred thousand lives in minutes. He must be stopped at any cost."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:259 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6411
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 3 of 5. Logs 8 to 10: Sheltem was posing as King Alamar; his subjects said the king had acted strangely for four years. He fled to CRON, then back to Terra, where he ambushed me and left my memory core in stasis in a cave. Natives of CRON freed me, and saved CRON from his plan to fly it into the sun."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:260 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6417
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 4 of 5. Logs 11 to 13: Terra again. Four VARNs have landed, and Sheltem assimilates them, harshly and too fast. He lives in the original seedship, under the sea; its matter transfer sites on the surface are disguised as pyramids. Through the Wire I am inside. I will have to defeat him myself."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:261 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6423
msgid ""
"Log Computer. Entry 5 of 5. Logs 14 and 15: Sheltem escaped in a pod toward the X.E.E.N. project; I follow in another, seconds behind, unarmed. Terrans launched the seedship after us; I told them how to use its matter transfer device. Xeen approaches. Engaging stasis. May the Gods smile upon me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:250 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6429
msgid ""
"A curved metal wall stands in lava that bubbles like soup. Nobody is touching that."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:249 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6431
msgid ""
"The lava round the hatch is black and cool. The hatch slides aside with a sigh, as if it had been waiting."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:262 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6437
msgid ""
"Somewhere aft, machines wake. Lights come on one corridor at a time, and far forward a heavy door unseals."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:255 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6443
msgid "Corak stands by the dead field, very still. \"Find me a Soul Box.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:254 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6450
msgid ""
"The field flickers out. The tall figure inside it, in a guardian's armour, opens his eyes. \"Corak. I hunted Sheltem from Terra to here, and he has had centuries to prepare. If I step outside, he will feel me the moment I do. I need somewhere to hide that he cannot see into. The Ancients built such things: Soul Boxes. Find me one.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:256 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6456
msgid "The field hums. Nothing else happens."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:271 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6501
msgid ""
"A rope hangs out of the amber sky into the great tree's crown. You climb until your arms give out, and still it climbs. The sky road, the boatmen say, takes only the Chosen."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:270 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6503
msgid ""
"The rope hangs straight and still in the tree's crown. This time, it seems, it will take you all the way up."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:273 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6511
msgid ""
"Welcome to Olympus. The clouds hold you up, which takes some getting used to. Somewhere up here is Soul Storage."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:275 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6518
msgid ""
"Empty shelves. The gods have stopped storing souls; nobody asked them to."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:276 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6519 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d7.lua:851
msgid ""
"A vault door with no handle. A servant of the gods says, politely, that it opens only for the Chosen Ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:274 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6529
msgid ""
"Soul Storage. Shelf after shelf, all empty but one. On it, a small box of dull metal that is somehow heavier to look at than to lift. The Soul Box."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:278 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6535
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: If Pharaoh's realm should take a fall / The Dragon must put forth a call / Mystic orb to the wind is cast / Seeks the hand of heroes last / Four parts castle at five per stage / A score of disks to help the Mage"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:279 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6541
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: A Golden bird will sorrow ease / Sweet song will Knight's lost soul appease / Help the rider to soothe the beast / Gain a flight when expected least / The symbol of royal power / Frees the Queen from evil tower"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:280 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6547
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Dragon's orb the world shall roam / Yet must again return to home / Pharaoh's magic back in its place / Helps to free the visitor from space / Code's the key to thinking machines / Starman knows the truth about Xeen"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:281 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6553
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Dragon once more will get you by / Owns key to city of the sky / Starman needs to hide in a box / Alamar's defenses outfox / Face to face in Alamar's lair / Out the box springs the land's last prayer"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:656
msgid "The mirror shows a witch's face, which does not move when you do."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:277 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6561
msgid ""
"All beings have a true name. Alamar's true name, for instance, is Sheltem."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:290 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6567
msgid ""
"A voice, everywhere at once: \"Chosen Ones. You have nothing I need to fear.\" The walls fold, and you stand outside the gate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:289 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6572
msgid ""
"The Soul Box hums very faintly in your pack. Nothing in the castle seems to notice you. That is the point."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:291 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6578
msgid ""
"A voice, everywhere at once: \"Chosen Ones. You have nothing I need to fear.\" The gate does not move. Corak's Soul Box would hide you from him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:288 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6586
msgid ""
"Castle Alamar. Every window is lit, and every one of them is looking at you. Enter?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:659
msgid "The mirror shows the castle as it was. It shows nothing else."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:297 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6592
msgid "The Air Head is dark and cold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:294 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:296 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:298
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:300 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6595 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6604
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6613 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6622
msgid "The Head goes dark. Somewhere above, a field dies."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:301 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6601
msgid "The Earth Head is dark and cold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:295 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6610
msgid "The Fire Head is dark and cold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:299 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6619
msgid "The Water Head is dark and cold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:302 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6629
msgid ""
"XEEN Power Juice. You have had yours, and your hands are still shaking."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:663
msgid ""
"An empty frame leans against the rubble. Emerson will hang the glass when there is a keep to hang it in."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:303 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6634
msgid ""
"XEEN Power Juice. It tastes of copper and lightning, and your arms feel like someone else's, someone stronger. (+2 Might, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:293 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6646 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d7.lua:350
msgid ""
"A voice, everywhere at once: \"Chosen Ones. You have nothing I need to fear.\" The ladder bucks, and you are back on the roof in the smoke."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:665
msgid "The mirror is fogged with shed skin. It shows nothing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:292 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6651
msgid ""
"The Soul Box hums very faintly in your pack. The castle below the hatch does not notice you come down. That is the point."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:309 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6658
msgid ""
"Sheltem's throne room. The throne is empty, and the air says it will not be for long."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:666
msgid "A pale face looks back from the mirror. It is not yours."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:308 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6668
msgid ""
"You throw the Soul Box to the ground. Corak steps out of it, taller than the room. \"Sheltem.\" \"Corak. You took your time.\" They close on each other, and the castle begins to shake itself apart. Corak's voice, from inside the light: \"The Cube! Take it and run!\" You run, with the Cube of Power, and behind you Castle Alamar folds into the ground."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:305 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6680
msgid "The gate stands open. It does not ask twice."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:306 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6681
msgid "The time is not right. Access denied!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:304 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6684
msgid ""
"The time is right. The gate asks Alamar's true name. \"Sheltem,\" you say, and the gate says: Access approved!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:307 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6690
msgid "Wrong! Access denied!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:311 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:315 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:319
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:323 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6698 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6723
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6755 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6801
msgid ""
"Slick: Get outta my face! You've already won the prize. Go play one of the other games."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:324 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6706
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 10 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up. Shoot the bullseye ten times in a row, and you win! (Ten.) You win a prize. Now get lost and don't come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:325 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6712
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 10 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Shoot the bullseye ten times in a row. (Seven.) Oh! Too bad. Why not try again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:326 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6715
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 10 gems you get a chance to win a doll. The arrows are free. The gems are not."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:320 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6731
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 5 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up. If you can stay on the treadmill longer than 2 minutes, you win! (You can.) You win a prize. Now get lost and don't come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:321 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6737
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 5 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Stay on the treadmill longer than 2 minutes. (You can't.) Oh! Too bad. Why not try again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:674
msgid ""
"Joe swears he has the situation under control. He has sworn it for two years."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:322 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6740
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 5 gems you get a chance to win a doll. Gems first, treadmill second."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:82 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:310 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6746
msgid "No one may enter Castle Xeen without a cupie doll!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:312 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6764
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 100 gold you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up and ring the bell with the hammer! (DING.) You win a prize. Now get lost and don't come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:677
msgid ""
"Welcome to Vertigo. Sadly, most of the population has left because the town is infested with pests. A couple years ago I hired Joe the exterminator to rid the town of this menace, but the problem seems to be getting worse. Perhaps you could help."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:313 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6770
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 100 gold you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up and ring the bell with the hammer! (thunk.) Oh! Too bad. Why not try again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:314 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6773
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 100 gold you get a chance to win a doll. No gold, no hammer."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:330 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6780
msgid "Slick: Get outta my face! You've already won the prize."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:331 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6781
msgid "Slick: Get lost and don't come back until you've won all the games."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:329 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6793
msgid ""
"Slick: I see that you have four dolls. A genuine Lord Xeen cupie doll, then. Now get lost, and don't come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:316 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6809
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 1000 gold you get a chance to win a doll. Step right up. If you are faster than the gremlin you'll win. (You are.) You win a prize. Now get lost and don't come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:317 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6815
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 1000 gold you get a chance to win a doll. If you are faster than the gremlin you'll win. (The gremlin waves from the finish.) Oh! Too bad. Why not try again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:318 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6818
msgid ""
"Slick: For only 1000 gold you get a chance to win a doll. The gremlin doesn't race for free, and neither do you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1571 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:333 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:335
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:337 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:339 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:11771
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6824 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6832 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6840
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6848
msgid "You are unable to understand the strange runes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:332 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6826
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Advisor will a dig permit / five coins more you must submit."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:334 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6834
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Taxman becomes a faithful vassal / Xeen's bane lies under castle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:336 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6842
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: In clouds above island tower / waits Lord Xeen his final hour."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:10 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:685
msgid ""
"Thank you for cleaning up Vertigo and discovering Joe's treachery. Now it makes sense why the extermination of the pests was taking so long. I present you with the outstanding citizenship award and this treasure. Congratulations. Oh, one more thing. I have received a message from the dwarves who reside in the Red Dwarf Range. They have urgently requested help and promise great reward to whoever is brave enough to come. Apparently, their mines have been invaded by the Mad Dwarf Clan, preventing them from mining. Help them and report back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:338 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6850
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Only the sword Xeen's life can take / All his plans of war unmake."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:328 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6856
msgid "Slick: The free round was the first one."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:327 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6862
msgid ""
"Slick: Sure-Eye Tonic, two bottles. First round's on the house. Only the first."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:343 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6870
msgid ""
"Castle Xeen. The walls hum with the generators somewhere inside, and the guard machines are already making more guards."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:353 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6876
msgid ""
"A field of crackling light bars the crown stair. Four pylons feed it, and while one still burns nothing passes."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:352 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6878
msgid ""
"The last pylon goes dark, and the field across the crown stair collapses with a crackle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:347 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6884
msgid "A dead generator. The air in here is very still."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:346 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6887
msgid ""
"The air generator whines down to silence. Somewhere a barrier flickers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:349 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6893
msgid "A dead generator, packed with gravel."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:348 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6896
msgid "The earth generator grinds to a stop. Somewhere a barrier flickers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:345 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6902
msgid "A dead generator, still warm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:344 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6905
msgid ""
"The fire generator coughs, roars, and goes out. Somewhere a barrier flickers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:351 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6911
msgid "A dead generator, dripping."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:350 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6914
msgid ""
"The water generator drains with a long gurgle. Somewhere a barrier flickers."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:359 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6923
msgid ""
"\"You have no idea what you have broken.\" Lord Xeen falls, and the face he wore at court, Prince Roland's, slides off him like wet paper."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:358 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6932
msgid ""
"Lord Xeen looks up from his throne and laughs. \"The King's little crusaders, all this way up. Kneel, and I may let you fall gently.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:355 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6938
msgid ""
"The mirror is protected by some sort of force field that reeks of Lord Xeen's peculiar brand of magic. You are unable to use or touch it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:357 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6946
msgid "Xeen's Pet lies still. Its cage door was never locked."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:361 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6953
msgid "An empty throne, and a mirror frame with nothing in it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:362 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6954
msgid ""
"Lord Xeen sits on his throne, holding his scepter, and smiles with somebody else's face."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:360 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6966
msgid ""
"You take the Scepter of Temporal Distortion from the throne. Behind it, the Sixth Mirror begins to sing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:356 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6973
msgid ""
"The Scepter of Temporal Distortion lies across the arms of the throne. The whole castle seems to hold its breath. Take it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:354 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6979
msgid "Lord Xeen laughs. Only the Slayer Sword can touch him."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:368 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:371 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:374
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:377 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6986 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6999
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7012 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7025
msgid "The Reflector hums quietly."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:369 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:372 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:375
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:378 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6987 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7000
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7013 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7026
msgid ""
"A machine of the Ancients, cold and silent. Its panel shows a dragon's eye, closed."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:367 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:6992
msgid ""
"The Reflector hums quietly. Somewhere far to the south, something answers it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:373 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7005
msgid ""
"The Reflector hums quietly. The snow on its housing slides off in one sheet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:370 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7018
msgid ""
"The Reflector hums quietly. The heat of the mountain seems to lean towards it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:12 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:703
msgid ""
"He...he (hic) breeeds (hicup) Breeeeeds them in the (hic) warehouse (hicup)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:376 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7031
msgid ""
"The Reflector hums quietly. The creek beside it runs backwards for a moment, then thinks better of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:387 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7038
msgid ""
"The road ends in nothing. Far below, the nothing roars like a gale. You step off."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:395 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7045
msgid ""
"The road ends in nothing. Far below, the nothing is grey as stone. You step off."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:379 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7052
msgid ""
"The road ends in nothing. Far below, the nothing glows like a forge. You step off."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:403 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7059
msgid ""
"The road ends in nothing. Far below, the nothing heaves like the sea. You step off."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:411 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7065
msgid "The sky says nothing. The road still ends in nothing."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:388 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7091
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Step Two: Awaken the Four Sleepers of Darkside."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:396 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7097
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Step Three: Bring together the Cube of Power and the Scepter of Temporal Distortion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:380 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7103
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Step One: When the time is right, activate the machines in the four corners of the other side of the world."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:404 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7109
msgid ""
"A message at the base of the statue reads: Step Four: Travel to the shrine on the Cloud above Darkstone Tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:391 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:392 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7116
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7125
msgid ""
"Air Sleeper: I am awake and my confidence is at 100%. Grunfeld field generator is active and reports 100% confidence."
