msgid "You accept the test of Air."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:13 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:721
msgid ""
"Joe keeps his warehouse key under the rain barrel in his yard. Everybody knows. Nobody looks."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:382 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:390 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:398
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:406 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7215 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7229
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7243 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7257
msgid ""
"The last guardian falls back into the pit. The gate to the Sleeper's chamber grinds open."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:397 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7221
msgid "You accept the test of Earth."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:381 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7235
msgid "You accept the test of Fire."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:405 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7249
msgid "You accept the test of Water."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:8 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:727
msgid "Pests"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:14 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:728
msgid ""
"Two years ago, I came to this town on contract to control the vermin infestation. It has been a long, hard job, but I've just about got the situation under control."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:429 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7283
msgid "An empty velvet cushion."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:428 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7286
msgid ""
"In the chest, on a velvet cushion: a key of black stone, cold as the bottom of a well. Darkstone Tower's."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:414 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7292
msgid ""
"A stair leads down under the ruin, sealed with Sheltem's mark. Nothing you carry means anything to it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:413 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7294
msgid ""
"The stair under the ruin is sealed with Sheltem's mark. The Cube of Power hums, and the mark goes out."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:424 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7302
msgid "You draw the bolt."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:425 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7308
msgid "Bolted from the other side."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:9 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:731
msgid "Warehouse"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:421 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:423 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7314
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7324
msgid "The lever won't budge."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:422 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7318
msgid "Far to the east, a wall grinds down into the floor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:15 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:732
msgid ""
"My warehouse? Strictly off limits. Dangerous chemicals. I don't even carry the key on me."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:420 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7328
msgid "Far to the west, a wall grinds down into the floor."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:417 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7334
msgid "The message on the plaque reads: Nine is the time."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:426 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7340
msgid "Its light is out. Its twin stands outside the gate."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:431 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7346
msgid "An empty stasis coffin, still faintly cold."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:430 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7356
msgid ""
"The coffin's lid slides back and a man sits up, blinking. \"Allow me to introduce myself. I am Prince Roland, brother to King Burlock. I must thank you for freeing me from that stasis chamber Alamar put me in. Queen Kalindra and I are destined to marry on the cloud world above Darkstone Tower. You hold the key to the Tower, but you will need a key to open the way to the cloud world above it. That key can be found in the Southern Sphinx on the other side of the world. I have here the Amulet of the Southern Sphinx. Take it. I must return to my brother and prepare for the wedding.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:427 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7364
msgid ""
"You climb down through smoke and rubble to the floor of what was Castle Alamar."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:24 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:737
msgid ""
"The local dwarves have informed me of your great deed and have authorized me to present to you a rare honor: The Red Dwarf Badge of Courage. Congratulations."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:419 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7370
msgid "The skull says, \"Access denied! You do not have the proper I.D.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:418 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7373
msgid "The skull sees the Cube of Power and says, \"Access granted.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:416 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7379
msgid "The statue says nothing more. Alamar has had his say."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:415 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7383
msgid ""
"The statue speaks as you approach: Not only is Alamar a wise and just ruler, Alamar is sporting, as well. Alamar graciously grants clever opponents a chance to defeat him by leaving hints and clues. But know this: Alamar takes pleasure in the failure of his opponents, especially when they come close to success. And you WILL fail."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:44 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7393
msgid ""
"The cauldron roars and boils over: green steam boils up the shaft! Get off the bridge!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:34 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:39 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:41
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:43 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7400 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7421
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7433 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7444
msgid "The cage hangs open and empty."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:35 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7407
msgid ""
"You touch the Alacorn to his ears: they shrink back, pink and round. He whoops and runs for home."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:36 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7411
msgid ""
"'I'm not going home with goblin ears!' The boy will not budge. 'They say the witches' Alacorn cures anything. It's up top, over the cauldron.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:37 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7415
msgid ""
"The ring turns the lock and the cage rattles up its chain. The boy steps out and stops: 'Not with these ears. Mum would die. The witches' Alacorn could cure them. It's up top, over the cauldron.'"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:38 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7427
msgid ""
"The ring turns the lock and the cage rattles up its chain. A girl with a green tinge to her skin tumbles out and hugs you. 'I'm Rosebud. The door at the top of the north stair has a witch's face on it, and it only opens to the coven's key. They keep it in their stores in the herb loft, past the vats. Don't tell them I told you!' Then she is gone, running for Toad Meadow."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:40 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7438
msgid ""
"The ring turns the lock and the cage rattles up its chain. A boy crawls out of the cage, wiping his nose. \"Thanks for getting me out of there,\" he says. \"I thought the witches were going to turn me into a goblin for sure. I want to go home.\" And he runs. Valia will hear of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:42 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7449
msgid ""
"The ring turns the lock and the cage rattles up its chain. The child in the witches' bedchamber slips out and is gone down the stair. Valia will hear of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:25 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:747
msgid ""
"The dwarf mines are still being over-run. Please help them. The mine portal is in the hills north-west of town."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:462 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7471
msgid ""
"Throne of Legends. It is a very good chair, and Picard would like it back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:461 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7477
msgid "The strange runes read: \"Don't feed the dragons.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:459 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7483
msgid "Jars of embalming fluid. Nothing you would drink."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:458 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7486
msgid ""
"Among the jars of embalming fluid on the table stand two flasks of red draught, stoppered and still warm. The embalmers needed strong arms for the lids."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:460 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7494
msgid "It was an illusion! An angry voice booms: \"No one steals from ME!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:453 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7501
msgid "The mask says nothing. Its blades stay in their slots."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:451 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:454 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:456
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7502 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7512 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7529
msgid "\"Well, maybe next time.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:452 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7506
msgid ""
"The mask's eyes glow and dim. Overhead, the blades draw up into their slots and stay there."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:455 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7515
msgid "\"There's one born every minute.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:457 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7521
msgid "\"Begone, then!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:450 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7528
msgid "The mask says nothing. Its blades hang still."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:449 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7533
msgid ""
"The mask's eyes glow and dim. Along the run, the blades swing slower, slower, and hang still."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:445 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7540
msgid "\"Correct, come on up!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:448 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7546
msgid "\"Wrong.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:23 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:755
msgid ""
"The dwarves are digging again. You can hear their picks from the town wall, which is more than I asked for."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:440 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7553
msgid "The strange writings seem to give a lesson about the letter \"A\"."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:439 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7560
msgid "The strange writings seem to give a lesson about the letter \"C\"."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:442 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7567
msgid "The strange writings seem to give a lesson about the letter \"D\"."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:438 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7574
msgid "The strange writings seem to give a lesson about the letter \"I\"."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:437 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7581
msgid "The strange writings seem to give a lesson about the letter \"P\"."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:441 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7588
msgid "The strange writings seem to give a lesson about the letter \"R\"."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:443 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7595
msgid ""
"The lessons you have studied, in the order of the halls: P, I, C, A, R, D."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:436 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7601
msgid ""
"A sphinx of sand-coloured stone, its jaw shut. There is a hollow in its breast the size of an amulet."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:435 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7603
msgid ""
"The Sphinx's stone eyes find Roland's amulet. Its jaw opens on a stair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:447 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7609
msgid "A voice from behind the door: \"What is my name?\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:446 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7611
msgid ""
"The door at the top of the stair opens on a room full of books, and an old man in a very good chair."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:444 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7617
msgid "The strange runes read: \"Study the lessons to learn my name.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:465 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7623
msgid "A voice booms: \"No Sound No Ground!\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:466 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7629
msgid ""
"Read down the columns, the four plaques say: NEW WORLD THANKS YOU FOR PLAYING MIGHT AND MAGIC"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:467 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7635
msgid ""
"Read down the columns, the four plaques say: SO ENDS THE SAGA OF CORAK AND SHELTEM!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:468 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7641
msgid ""
"Read down the columns, the four plaques say: 1994 BEGINS THE NEXT MIGHT AND MAGIC SAGA!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:469 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7648
msgid ""
"Read down the columns, the four heads say: TYPE \"COMPUTER\" ON LEVEL 4 OF THE DUNGEON OF DEATH. SEE YA SOON!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:27 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:765
msgid ""
"You have destroyed the witches and for that I am grateful. For your gallant deeds, I dub thee all Crusaders! Now I must take the Alacorn, for if I can find Falista, I believe the healing power of the Alacorn is strong enough to resurrect her."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:471 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7660
msgid "The stair to the roof is open. Cloud light comes down it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:472 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7661
msgid "An invisible seal prevents passage."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:470 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7667
msgid ""
"You strike the Chime of Opening. The note goes on long after it should have stopped, and something you could not see cracks across like ice. The seal has been broken."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:464 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7673
msgid ""
"A tower of black stone, polished like a mirror. The door has a keyhole and no handle."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:463 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7675
msgid "The black key turns without a sound. So does the door."
msgstr ""

