#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:43 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:54 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:65
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:76
msgid "Nothing here."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1106 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9839
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you for rescuing me! The witches were going to use me for spare parts in their potions."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9850
msgid ""
"Thanks for getting me out of there. The witches turn people into monsters: the good ones guard Castle Blackfang, the rejects end up on the Isle of Lost Souls. There are others. Find them."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1120 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9862
msgid ""
"Cauldron. It tastes of iron and old boots, and you feel you could take a beating. (+2 Endurance, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:83 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:987
msgid "You don't have enough Megacredits."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1118 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9874
msgid ""
"Cauldron. You taste the brew, and the witches' charm rubs off on you a little. (+2 Personality, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1122 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9886
msgid ""
"Cauldron. The brew is gone before you taste it, and so, nearly, are you. (+2 Speed, permanent)"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1101 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9899
msgid ""
"My first is in water but not in tear. My second is in hire but not in hear. My third is in tree but not in peer. My fourth is in race but not in fear. My last is in sharp but not in spear."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:84 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:990
msgid "How about a keep to go with those walls? Just 5 Megacredits!"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1102 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9907
msgid ""
"Correct! As a reward, I give you free membership to the guild. Members use the cellar door round the back."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1103 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9914
msgid ""
"Wrong! Begone fools! The floor of the porch drops away, and you land in the sewer under the Guild."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1112 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9926
msgid "The cauldron is cold. Nobody here is initiating anybody."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1113 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9930
msgid ""
"Another of the green ways drinks. The witches clap, politely. Warlock."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9934
msgid "You have had some. It is still toad."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1115 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9939
msgid ""
"The brew tastes of toad and ambition. 'Welcome, sisters,' says a witch, whatever you are. Those of you who walk the green ways come up from the cauldron Warlocks. Members may also help themselves to the Head Witch's chest. Politely."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9950
msgid ""
"(yawn) Thank you for saving me from my hideous fate. I am forever in your debt. I'll be going now. See you."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1110 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9961
msgid ""
"Thank you for saving me. I'm tired of adventuring and I'm going home, but the dragon statuette is in the sewer below us. The witches caught me just as I was reaching for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1116 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9968
msgid "The Head Witch's chest. The Head Witch is standing next to it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1141 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9978
msgid "A sign on the barrel says: Food for the dead, keep warm."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1139 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9984
msgid "A culvert gate, shut. Somewhere upstream, a wheel would raise it."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:85 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:999
msgid ""
"The Tower of High Magic stands in the lagoon. Mind the top floors: the wizards brewed things up there they never named."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1142 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9991
msgid "You are not strong enough to pry the lid off the barrel."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1143 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9996
msgid "Dead Food. You have all had some. Nobody wants seconds."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d1.lua:1003
msgid ""
"A letter on the lid reads: H. It will not shut. All nine lids spring open again."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d1.lua:1003
msgid "A letter on the lid reads: H. The lid drops shut."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d1.lua:1003
msgid "The H chest is shut."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d1.lua:1022 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d2.lua:340
msgid "The great tree"
msgstr ""

