msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:72
msgid ""
"BOOK OF PERSONALITY. One of Darzog's own studies, written for his apprentices; whoever reads it to the end is changed by it. +5 Personality (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:76 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:84
