msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:83
msgid ""
"BOOK OF SPEED. One of Darzog's own studies, written for his apprentices; whoever reads it to the end is changed by it. +5 Speed (permanent)."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:89
msgid ""
"The cloud gives under your foot like fog. Something holds it shut: Crodo would know what."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:100
msgid "A patch of fallen facing stone where a coat of arms once hung."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:103
msgid "A white tower on blue: the arms of Newcastle. Yours."
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:107 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:109
msgid "To the Newcastle site"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:112 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:114
msgid "Speaking grille"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:113
msgid ""
"A brass grille in the wall beside the steel door. When you lean close, a dry voice asks: \"What is the password?\""
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:117 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:119 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:151
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:153 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:171 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:173
